<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Adele Old Testament</book>
  <para style="rem">Typeset for community testing November 2024 by John Sidsaya</para>
  <para style="h">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Samweli Gɩkpa-Gyangbasɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli Gɩkpa-Gyangbasɛlɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli gewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Ete ɛkɩ ɛ sara Ramatami-Sufim gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Efrayim wodon wuu koro fɔ. Bee kpèlè wɔ̀ alɛ Elikana, wote n di Yeroma, gɛ wotu n di Elihu. Elihu wote n di Tohu gɛ Tohu wote e ye Sufi dɩkpaara gɛtɛ di ye Efrayim wofoli waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Elikana e to bɛna bɛnyɔɔ. Bee kpèlè ɛkɩ Hana, gɛ bee kpèlè edo Penina. Penina e wo bebi, mɔ Hana en wo. <verse eid="1SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Gɩkyan n di gɩkyan fɔ, Elikana ee ye wo ditele daanɩ ɛ bʋn ɛ san ɛ ma sʋma Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ, fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ gedi Silo ditele daanɩ. Dʋkɔ gɛ Eli bebi-teni bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè bɛ alɛ Hofini ma Finehasisi bè di gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Elikana ɛɛ tɛ gedi fɔ, ɛɛ tɛ wɔsɔ Penina woyo gedikʋn fɔ ɛ̀ tɛ wo bebi-teni ma wo bebi-nanɩ mɔ booyo adikʋn. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Mɔ Hana bɩrɛ, ɛɛ tɛ wɔ gedikʋn gɛtɛ gii di gʋnʋn yema ee len wade ma gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛn yɛ wɔ èè wura ebi gba fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛn tɛ Hana gewo okoro, wosugbe Penina ɛɛ tɩ̀ ka gewo gaade e toro wɔ gɛtɛ wàà ka sa wɔ owurufa. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Gɛlɛ gɛ wʋʋ mɛ gɩkyan n di gɩkyan. Ɔya kamasɛ gɛtɛ Hana ɛ̀ bʋn ɛ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ, wosugbe Penina ɛɛ dɔ ade ɛ sa wɔ owurufa gɛtɛ wʋʋ yɛ wɔ eè wula gɛ ɛn taa di. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Wʋ̀ ba gɛlɛ fɔ wɔsan Elikana ee lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Hana, anʋn yii koro gɛ aa wula? Anʋn yii koro gɛ an taa di? Anʋn yii koro gɛ a mʋnya? Okoro nmɩ, mɩn da bebi-tenibi fwo tɛ wɔ̀?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Duwi dɩkɩ, gɛtɛ be di, gɛ bɛ nyʋn be were Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ Silo ditele fɔ, Hana ɛ tɔ ee tiri onyun. Fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Eli è si gɛbɩya gii koro ɛ̀ kpasa ma Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu-yon. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Dɩkpʋkpʋ-dɩrɛ di sere Hana, gɛ e wula gepepe e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Gɛ ɛ kan ntam ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Oo, Yahwe-kpatakpɩrɩ, gengyi à nya nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan, maayenpu-de nyayɩ gɛ à kʋna mɩɩn koro, gɛ an finla nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan, gɛ à tɛ mɩ ebi-teni fɔ, nan ka wɔ n tɛ awɔ Yahwe, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sʋma wɔ̀, wɔ nkpa wawi powu yaanɩ. Gɛ bɛn nan ka Ɔhayɩ (Biledi) bɛ wɔrɔ wɔ duyu bɛ nya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Hana ɛ̀ sangba ee tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ, Eli ɛɛ nya wonyun. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana ee tiri onyun woturu waanɩ, gɛ wonyun wʋʋ tɔ wʋ gbɛrɛ mɔ bɛn ta nʋn ade gɛtɛ ɛɛ dɔ, okoro Eli ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ e suu gɛ bʋkan. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Okoro Eli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ma sere ɔya-mɔmɔ gɛ aà kere bʋkan bʋʋ gɛnyʋn-suu a ya? Kere bʋkan bʋʋ gɛnyʋn-suu ya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Gɛ Hana e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, miinfonte, mɩn taa nyʋn wayɩn abɛɛ bʋkan ma ɔkɛma. Ade n tɛ taga mɩ miinturu waanɩ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ ǹ de miinturu waanɩ waade ǹ tɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Kara sa amɩnlɛ alɛ aasʋgʋgyan è di ɛnanɩ basaa. Mɩɩn dɩyɩyɛ ma mɩɩn dɩfana dii koro gɛ ǹ te tiri onyun nyawʋ anlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Gɛ Eli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;San olila waanɩ! Tii Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ gɩnyan gɛtɛ a lila wɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Hana ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Wula nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan gutunkoro.&gt;&gt; Dʋkɔ gɛ Hana ɛ da, gɛ ɛ ma len anyandilɛ e di, gɛ wo koro gɩ nʋ̀n wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Kere-kpalɛ gagyɩgyan-fuu fɔ Elikana ma wɔ bɛfʋrɩ bɛ tɔ bɛ ma sʋma Yahwe. Gɛ be biri bɛ da bɔɔlɛ Rama ditele daanɩ. Elikana ɛ dʋrɔ ma wɔsɔ Hana. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ kʋna Hana wo koro. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Wun di awi fɔ, Hana e ton diboro, gɛ e wo ebi-tenibi. Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ sa wɔ diyere alɛ Samweli, gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ, &lt;&lt;Na lila wɔ na ye Yahwe wakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana e tiri Samweli ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ mɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn ɛ tɛ Yahwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Gɛtɛ Elikana ma wɔ bɛnɩ be biri bɛ bʋn bɛ san bàà ma tɛ Yahwe gedi, fɔ èè le wɔ ntam fɔ wo koro fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hana ɛn san. Ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsan alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi ǹ bɔ ǹ tigi ebi fɔ dɩnyʋn fɔ, nan ka wɔ n ma tɛ Yahwe, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara dʋkɔ gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ wɔsan Elikana ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀! Sara ditele ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ aà tigi wɔ dɩnyʋn! Mɔ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ wɔ̀ àà talɩ di aa ntam gɛtɛ a kan fɔ wo koro.&gt;&gt; Okoro Hana ɛ sara ditele ɛ nya ebi fɔ wo koro ka ma sere ɔkʋna gɛtɛ e tigi ebi fɔ dɩnyʋn. <verse eid="1SA 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Gɛtɛ e tigi ebi fɔ dɩnyʋn fɔ, Hana ɛ ka wɔ fɩya ma ɛkwɔ-teni gɛtɛ e di bɩkyan besiyee, ma ɔnʋmʋ tasa-dɩrɛ diboro, ma bʋkan osun ɛ san Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ daanɩ, Silo ditele. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be wolo ɛkwɔ-teni fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka ebi-tenibi fɔ bɛ ma tɛ Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Gɛ Hana e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte, koturu gɛ, aa kʋna mɩ? Nmɩ n di ɛna gɛtɛ na ti yela aa bʋnʋn nfan, na tiri onyun na tɛ Yahwe fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Na tiri onyun gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɛ mɩ ebi, gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn miinyun-tiri. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Okoro ǹ de wɔ ǹ tɛ tɛ Yahwe. Wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ fɔ, è di gɛ Yahwe woyo.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛ sʋma Yahwe dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hana wonyun-tiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Hana e tiri onyun gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">&lt;&lt;Yahwe, awɔ na yɛ gɛ n te di ɔsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">gɛ awɔ Yahwe na yɛ gɛ ǹ ba ɔkɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Na mʋmwa mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">yema a to mɩ a ya.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Ɛkɩ ɛn ma gɛtɛ è we fɩrɩn-fɩrɩn anlɛ Yahwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Ɛkɩ ɛn ma fɩya ma awɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Dɩtaa dɩkɩ dɩn ma anlɛ awɔ tii Wurubwarɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />&lt;&lt;Kara tɩ̀ tabʋrʋ bʋma koro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">abɛɛ àà tabʋrʋ kɩntɩn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">Yema Yahwe è di gɛ Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ade powu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">Gɛ ɛwɔ n tɛ kɛrɛ bɛnɩ baade mɛlɛ powu.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baagyatʋrʋ ɛbɛ be sila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">mɔ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ nafɔ bè di bɛfɔbɩlɩlɛ fɔ be wura ɔkɛma.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ nafɔ bɛ̀ ba anyandilɛ kpekpesi fɔ, bɛ̀ san bee fu boo koro pɛ bàà wura anyandilɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">mɔ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ nafɔ dɩkpan dì de bɛ fɔ, nkele bɛn mɩnɩ taa ni ku dɩkpan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Ɛlamanbʋ e wo bebi kwarankɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">mɔ ɛna gɛtɛ nafɔ ɛ̀ ba bebi kpekpesi fɔ, ɛn mɩnɩ ma ɛkɩlɩn.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Yahwe ee wolo, gɛ ɛɛ lama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">ɛɛ sama ɛnɩ diku daanɩ, gɛ ɛɛ lama wɔ ɛ ba nkpa anɩ.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Yahwe ɛɛ mɛ bɛkɩ bɛkyɩnyɩn gɛ ɛɛ mɛ bedo beyenpu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">ɛɛ warama bɛkɩ gɛ ɛɛ bʋma bedo mɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Yahwe ɛɛ tɔ̀là eyenpu e ye atɩn yaanɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">gɛ ɛɛ tɔ̀là ehiyanlɛ e ye ditonton daanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Ɛɛ sɩ̀ bɛ e bon ma begyu-dɩrɛ boo bebi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">gɛ ɛɛ yɛ bee wura gedikʋn gigyu-bɩya fɔ gii koro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Yema gɛtʋnkwaa gii gesere ɔpɩ gi ye Yahwe wakʋn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">gɛ ɔpɩ fɔ wuu koro gɛ e sere owi-yasɩ powu.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Ɛɛ dɩyɛ wɔ bɛnɩ bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">mɔ duyu-kɛma dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɩrɛ, baà muru dibilin daanɩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">&lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ ɛn nan talɩ ɛ ka ɔkɛma e di diyere.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Yahwe bɛkyʋnlɛ baà muru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Ɛɛ̀ fa bɛ dɩkpaaba e ye gatala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">Yahwe ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ gɛtʋnkwaa powu gɩɩ gɔdɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">Ɛɛ̀ tɛ wogyu ɔkɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">ɛɛ̀ bʋma wogyu gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Elikana e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ Rama ditele, mɔ Samweli ɛ sara gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Eli gatɩn ɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli bebi-teni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Eli bebi-teni bɛ̀ ba gibi-kpen, gɛ bɛn taa bù Yahwe. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Fɔ wù di odu waade-mɛlɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ ma bɛnɩ fɔ gɛtɛ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ tɛ gedi, gɛ gɩnan fɔ gɩ̀ gyaga gɩɩ fara fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ wɔkpàlɛ ɛɛ̀ ka gɩnyanɩ-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ ba alobi asiyee fɔ e ton, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka gɩ ɛ sa dikere abɛɛ danseyi abɛɛ gikunbi abɛɛ osun fɔ waanɩ ɛ kyɔlɔ gɩnan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩnyanɩ fɔ gaà gye fɔ ɛɛ̀ ka ɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ. Anlɛ gɛ bɛ mɛ Isareli bete powu gɛtɛ bɛ bɛ tɛ gedi Silo fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Nkele mɔ, pɛgɛ ayo fɔ yàà be kpin gba fɔ, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ wɔkpàlɛ fɔ ɛɛ bɛ dɔ̀ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ tɛ gedi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ gɩnan fɔ akɩ èè kuma, yema ɛn taa len gɩnan-gyagalɛ e ye aakʋn, mɔ ee len gɛ gɩnan-ŋɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Gengyi ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ tɛ gedi fɔ ɛ̀ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ ayo fɔ yàà kpin pɛ, fɔ àà tiri gɩnan fɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ à len,&gt;&gt; fɔ, ɛkpàlɛ fɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kwa, ka gɩ tɛ mɩ nkenkele, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, nan ka gɩ dɩkpatɩ daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Eli bebi-saranyan fɔ baade-mɛlɛ fɔ ì di ade-kpen-dɩrɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn, yema alɛ bɛn ka gebù tɛ Yahwe gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Mɔ Samweli bɩrɛ ɛ bɔ ɛɛ sʋma Yahwe. È di ebi gɛtɛ ɛɛ sa gɛgba tinlɛ diboro fututu. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Gɩkyan n di gɩkyan, gengyi Samweli wɔna ma wote ma tɛ Wurubwarɛ gedi fɔ, wɔna ɛɛ baa gɛgba-serelɛ-bi ɛ san ma wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Gɛ Eli e hira Elikana ma wɔsɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ dama ɛnanɩ nyawɔ wo koro ɛ̀ɛ̀ tɛ wɔ̀ bebi ka sere ɛwɔ gɛtɛ e tiri onyun e lila, gɛ ɛ ka ɛ tɛ Yahwe fɔ didin.&gt;&gt; Wʋʋ gama fɔ be biri bɛ da bɔɔlɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ kʋna Hana wo koro, gɛ e wo bebi-tenibi besiyee, ma bɛnanɩbi bɛnyɔɔ. Samweli bɩrɛ ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ dan gɛ ɛɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli ma wo bebi baade-mɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Nkele Eli ɛ dan gepepe. Gɛ ɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ wo bebi bɛ mɛ Isareli bɛnɩ powu, ma anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dʋrɔ ma bɛnanɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Dɩyan dii Dikwo-dɩrɛ diitunu fɔ powu. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Okoro Eli e lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩɩ mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ? Na nʋn gɛtɛ bɛnɩ powu bɛɛ dɔ̀ gɛlɛ gaade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩɩ mɛ lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Kpakpaakpa miin bebi, ade gɛtɛ na nʋn ɩɩ yasɩ Yahwe bɛnɩ baanɩ lɛ in di gɛ ade-kpara. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ mɛ wɔwɔlɔn ade-kpen fɔ, Yahwe ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ. Mɔ gengyi ɛnɩ ɛ̀ mɛ gɛ Yahwe ade-kpen fɔ, ɛnyan nan talɩ ɛ fɔ ɛ tɛ wɔ?&gt;&gt; Mɔ bebi fɔ bɛn nʋn boote wakʋn, yema wù di Yahwe gelenbi gɛtɛ èè wolo bɛ.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ dan gɛ, gɛ ee di Yahwe ma bɛnɩ gʋnʋn.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ade-tirilɛ-wùlàlɛ ka dama giten-tiira tɛ Eli dɩkpaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Gɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ɛkɩ ɛ ba Eli wakʋn ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe alan, &lt;Ɔya gɛtɛ aatu ɛbɛ bɛ̀ sa Egyipiti, Farawo gatɩn fɔ, mɩn tiri koro wùlà bɛ kanyɩ? <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Na tiri aatu na ye Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ powu yaanɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ miin gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san miin gedi gii gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ, èè kuma olifwi fɔ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ sa gɛgba tinlɛ diboro mɩɩn bʋnʋn. Na nɩ tɛ aatu ɛbɛ bɔɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan powu gɛtɛ Isareli bete bɛɛ tɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩn taa ka gebù ɩ tɛ miin gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ ganyan gɛtɛ bɛɛ tɛ mɩ fɔ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ awɔ Eli aa ka gebù a tɛ aa bebi a da mɩ gɛtɛ aa yɛ bɛ bee tiri gekuma gii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩɩ gɩnan ma ayo fɔ gɛtɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete bɛɛ tɛ mɩ fɔ ɩ ka i di ɩ sa koro alɩ, ɩ kere nmɩ ɩ ya?<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro nmɩ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ na dɔ̀ na sɩ̀ alan, &lt;Awɔ aa dɩkpaara ma aa aatu dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ yaà sʋma mɩ gakpaakpa.&gt; Mɔ Nmɩ Yahwe ntɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Mɔ nkele, wʋ san ɔfɔ, ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà sa mɩ gebu fɔ, nmɩ mɔ nan sa bɛ gebu, mɔ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà terema mɩ fɔ, nmɩ mɔ nan terema bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Ɩ nya, ɔya wʋ nɩma gɛtɛ nan wolo wɔ̀, ma bɛsaranyanbi gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa aate dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ powu, gɛtɛ ditenikwaa dɩ nan sara yɩɩ dɩkpaara daanɩ, <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />gɛ yaà we dɩfana mɩɩn gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ. Ma gɛtɛ nan mɛ ade-kpara n tɛ Isareli bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ gba fɔ, aa dɩkpaara daanɩ bɩrɛ, ditenikwaa dɩkɩ dɩ nan sara dɩ nya. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Mɔ nan kere Yaanɩ ɛkɩ n ya ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ mɩɩn gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ sʋma mɩ, mɔ wɔ bʋnʋn baà gbena gɛ ɛn nan wura bʋnʋn bɔɔ gɛgyagakʋn bʋkɩ. Gɛ aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ powu baà belen be ku bɔɔ gɩsaranyan gaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />&lt;&lt;Gengyi aa bebi bɛnyɔɔ, Hofini ma Finehasi bè ku duwi-kɩlɩn fɔ, waà yɛ wɔ̀ àà nyɩnla alɛ ade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ fɔ yaà ba waanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Nan tiri gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ-fon gɛtɛ eè di nʋnkwarɩ, gɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ miinturu ma maamɩnlɛ yaade-lenlɛ. Nan yɛ wɔ èè wura odu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ waà yela kin-kin, gɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ gʋtʋn ma egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ nan sʋrʋ bʋnɔ fɔ ɔya-kamasɛ. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Gɛ ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè kuruma aa dɩkpaara daanɩ fɔ, eè be kura gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ ɛ fɔ sɩka-sɩya ma boroboro ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ mɩ gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɩɩ gʋtʋn gɩkɩ nan mɛ, fɔ nan ti wura anyandilɛ n di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yahwe e kpèlè Samweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Nkele ɛsaranyan Samweli ɛ sʋma Yahwe Eli gatɩn. Awi ɩtɔkɔ yaanɩ fɔ, Yahwe wanyun-gyebi ma wade-tirilɛ-wùlàlɛ ɩn taa ba bilen-bilen.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Odente wʋkɩ, Eli ɛ̀ dɔ̀ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ dʋrɔ fɔ. Fɔ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ yɔlɔ gɛtɛ ɛn taa ni we gepe. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Fɔ Samweli mɔ ɛ̀ dɔ Dikwo-dɩrɛ daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka dɩ̀ sa fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe e kpèlè Samweli, gɛ e yera alan, &lt;&lt;Nte!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Gɛ e serenti ɛ san Eli wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nyaamɩ! A kpèlè mɩ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Eli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Min kpèlè wɔ̀, biri san ma dʋrɔ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ e biri ɛ san ɛ ma dʋrɔ.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Gɛ Yahwe e biri e kpèlè alan,&lt;&lt;Samweli!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Samweli ɛ tɔ e biri ɛ san Eli wakʋn alan, &lt;&lt;A kpèlè mɩ, nyaamɩ!&gt;&gt; Mɔ Eli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi min kpèlè wɔ̀, biri ma dʋrɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Fɔ Samweli ɛn tɛ nyɩnla Yahwe gɛlɛ, yema Yahwe en te tiri ade anlɛ e wùlà wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Gɛ Yahwe e biri e kpèlè Samweli disere disiyeefɛ. Gɛ Samweli ɛ tɔ, gɛ ɛ san Eli wakʋn, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;A kpèlè mɩ, nyaamɩ wɔ lɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Ɛwʋ gɛ Eli e we ɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ, Yahwe n te kpèlè ɛsaranyan fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Okoro Eli ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Biri ma dʋrɔ, gɛ gengyi è biri è kpèlè wɔ̀ fɔ, dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Yahwe tabʋrʋ, aasaranyan ɛɛ nʋn.&gt; &gt;&gt; Okoro Samweli e biri ɛ ma dʋrɔ wɔ gɛdʋrɔkʋn. <verse eid="1SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Gɛ Yahwe e be yela, gɛ e kpèlè wɔ &lt;&lt;Samweli! Samweli!&gt;&gt; Anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ mɛ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Gɛ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, tabʋrʋ, aasaranyan ɛɛ nʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, n te len nan mɛ ade ɩkɩ Isareli bɛnɩ boo koro, gɛ ɛkamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ nʋ̀n yɩ fɔ, waà dʋrɔ onyun. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ ade gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ na gyaga Eli ma wafʋrɩ yii koro fɔ, yaà ba waanɩ ye ade gyegeyelɛ ma sere iweremalɛ. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Yema na dɔ̀ Eli alan, nan tiira ɛwɔ ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ giten gakpaakpa, yema ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ wo bebi fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ mbusu wade bɛ gyaga nmɩ Yahwe miin koro, mɔ ɛn sʋ bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Wuu koro na kan ntam na dɔ̀ Eli dɩkpaara alan, &lt;Eli dɩkpaara dɩɩ dɩpwɛ fɔ, nka gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ abɛɛ anyan yɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gɛ baà ka bɛ kpa dɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samweli ɛ dʋrɔ ma sere kere-kpalɛ, gɛ ɛ tɔ ɛ tana Yahwe Dikwo-dɩrɛ fɔ diitunu. Gɩsaa gi ton wɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ Eli ade-welɛ gʋnʋn ŋɔrɔ gɛtɛ e we fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />mɔ Eli e kpèlè wɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi Samweli!&gt;&gt; Gɛ Samweli e yera alan, &lt;&lt;Nte!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Gɛ Eli e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaade gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀? Kara ka yɩ bubwa mɩ. Gengyi à ka ade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ bubwa mɩ fɔ, Yahwe eè tiira wɔ̀ giten.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Okoro Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade fɔ powu, gɛtɛ ɛn ka gɩnyankɩ e bubwa wɔ. Gɛ Eli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwɔ n di Yahwe, yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samweli ɛ dan, gɛ Yahwe ɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ, gɛ Yahwe wade powu gɛtɛ ɛ dama Samweli wo koro ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ, ɩ ba waanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Wʋ yɛ Isareli powu, ye Dan ma sere Beeseba, be we bɛ nyɩnla alɛ Samweli è di Yahwe wɔtabʋrʋlɛ gbagba. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Yahwe ɛ̀ bɔ ee tiri koro e wùlà Silo ditele daanɩ, gɛ dʋkɔ gɛ e tiri koro e wùlà Samweli ka dama wanyun-gyebi fɔ yii koro.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ Isareli powu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">Filisiti bete be to Yahwe dikola dɩɩ Dɩdaka fɔ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ san bɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Filisiti bete. Fɔ Isareli bete bɛ sara ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Ebenesa fɔ, gɛ Filisiti bete mɔ bɛ sara ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee kpèlè alɛ Afeki fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Filisiti bete bɛ tɔ bɛ san bɛ ma tà bɩtà ma Isareli bete. Gɛtɛ akpa fɔ ɩɩ mɛ ɔtan fɔ, Filisiti bete be di Isareli bete boo koro, gɛ be wolo bɛnɩ ɩgbaa ɩnyɔɔ (4,000). <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Ɔya gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be biri bɛ ba gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, Isareli bɛndɩrɛ be lila booko-booko alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn na ba, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Filisiti bete be di tii koro ǹdò? Ɩ yɛ taà ma ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ ti ye Silo tɩ ba, fɔ Yahwe ɛ̀ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛtɩ, fɔ èè tiri tɩ ye tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Okoro bɛ sa bɛnɩ Silo, gɛ bɛ ma ka Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ gɛtɛ è si gigyu-bɩya gii koro Kerubi ɛbɛ boo getite fɔ wo Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba. Fɔ Eli bebi-tenibi bɛnyɔɔ Hofini, ma Finehasi bɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ ma Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ di be gyu bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ, Isareli powu ɛ gbɛrɛ afala-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gi kpenti. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ nʋn afala fɔ, be lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaafala gɛ Hebere bete bɛɛ gbɛrɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn lɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ nʋn alɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka di be gyu Hebere bete bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />gɩsaa gi gyu bɛ gepepe, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ekpen e be gyu bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn, ti ku! Ade nyayɩ yaakɩ yiinudu iin te sere nya. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Ti ku! Ɛnyan nan to tɩ e ye bekpen ma ɔkɛma nyabɛ baalɔ yaanɩ? Ɛbɛ n di bekpen gɛtɛ be di Egyipiti bete gyerebi kperen-kperen otonkuma waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Filisiti bete, i yela kin-kin! I yela giteni, nka gɛlɛ yaà bɛ mɛ Hebere bete bɔɔ bɛdɩ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ tɩɩ bɛdɩ̀ fɔ. I yela giteni fɔ yàà kpà!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Okoro Filisiti bete bɛ kpà, gɛ be di Isareli bete boo koro gɛ baanɩ-kamasɛ e serenti e ma gyu wɔ dɩyan-kwo daanɩ. Isareli bɛnɩ be muru akpa fɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be ku fɔ bɛ̀ ba disepekyi ma ɩgbaa-ton (30,000). <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Filisiti bete bɛ labɩrɩ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ, gɛ be wolo Eli bebi-tenibi bɛnyɔɔ Ofini, ma Finehasi.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eli diku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ daanɩ ke, Benyamin-te ɛkɩ e serenti e ye bɩtà fɔ baanɩ ɛ san Silo. Ɛ fɛɛran wɔ ngba, gɛ ɛ ka atɩn ɛ fɔgɔtɩ duyu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu fɔ, Eli è si wɔ gɛbɩya gii koro osele-kere ɛɛ nya bɛ osele. Yema gɩsaa gì de wɔ tɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ. Gɛtɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ e gyu ditele daanɩ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wu sere dʋkɔ fɔ, ditele dɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ gbɛrɛ afala be wula.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eli ɛ nʋn afala fɔ, gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaafala gɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ e serenti ɛ san Eli wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Fɔ Eli e di bɩkyan akpilin anaa ma fwo-nɩyɛ (98), gɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋn mɩnɩ taa ni we gepe. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Eli alan, &lt;&lt;Na bɔ na ye bɩtà fɔ baanɩ gafɔ. Na serenti na ye yaanɩ ǹdò.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Gɛ Eli e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi, anʋn na sere?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti be ye Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baakʋn, gɛ be wolo tɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ kpekpesi. Nkele aa bebi-teni bɛnyɔɔ Ofini, ma Finehasi mɔ be ku, gɛ bɛ gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ da.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ e kpèlè Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka dii diyere fɔ, Eli e ye wɔ gɛbɩya gii koro gɛsarakʋn fɔ giitunu ɛ nʋ̀n gamaama, gɛ wo gigyen gi sila gɛ e ku, yema ɛ dan, gɛ ɛ̀ ba ɔdʋrʋ okoro. E gyegeye ɛ tɛ Isareli bete bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ (40).<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Waanɩ fɔ, Eli wobi Finehasi wɔsɔ è de diboro gɛtɛ dɩdan ma gewo. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ɛ nʋn alɛ bɛ gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka, gɛ wɔsan-te ma wɔsan powu be ku fɔ, e gyu gɛdɩma dɩkpankpasan daanɩ gɛ e wo, mɔ wʋ taga wʋ kara. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Gɛtɛ ee ku fɔ, ɛna gɛtɛ ee to wɔ gewo fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aakola ɩ kara yɔ wɔ̀! A wo ebi-tenibi.&gt;&gt; Mɔ wamɩnlɛ ɩn ma wakʋn, gɛ en tiri ade fɔ yiinyun.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Ɛ sa ebi fɔ diyere alɛ Ikabodi gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ Yahwe gingyebi gi ye Isareli gɩ da, yema be gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ, gɛ wɔsan-te, ma wɔsan mɔ be ku. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ gingyebi gi ye Isareli gɩ da, yema be gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ sa Filisiti bete baakʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete be gye Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ be were fɔ, bɛ ka dɩ be ye Ebenesa, bɛ san Asidodi. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Gɛ bɛ ka Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ma sɩ̀ bookpen Dagon dikwo daanɩ, gɛ bɛ ka dɩ bɛ sɩ̀ wɔ bɩlan baanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Gɛtɛ Asidodi bete bɛ lama kere-kpalɛ gɛgyɩgyan fɔ, ekpen Dagon ɛ nʋ̀n e tin wɔ bʋnʋn buu koro gɛtʋnkwaa Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn. Bɛ tɔ̀là Dagon, gɛ be birima wɔ bɛ sɩ̀ wo geserekʋn. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Mɔ gɛtɛ Kere gi biri gɩ kpa gɛgyɩgyan gɛ bɛ lama fɔ, Dagon e biri ɛ nʋ̀n e tin wɔ bʋnʋn buu koro gɛtʋnkwaa Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩɩ bʋnʋn. Wo duyu di kebi, gɛ walɔ i sila ɩ̀ dɔ dikpen-kwo fɔ diitunu. Wo koro giiko na kuruma. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ bè ye ma ǹdò, Dagon bekpente oo, ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ee gyu Dagon dikpen-kwo gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Asidodi fɔ, ɛn taa kyikya otunu fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Yahwe wowurufa wʋ ba Asidodi bɛnɩ, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ gbɛma dʋkɔ fɔ boo koro. Ɛ yɛ gɩsaa gi gyu bɛ, gɛ ɛ yɛ beserelɛ be sere-sere ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be silin bɛ be tuma fɔ powu. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Gɛtɛ Asidodi bete be we ade gɛtɛ i sere fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Isareli wokpen dɩdaka nyadɩ dɩn nan nɩ sara taakʋn nfan. Yema ekpen fɔ ɛ ka owurufa tii koro gɛ ɛ ka owurufa tiikpen Dagon mɔ wo koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Okoro be kpèlè Filisiti begyu-dɩrɛ powu be tuma, gɛ be lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ taà mɛ Isareli bete bookpen dɩdaka fɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà ka Isareli wokpen dɩdaka fɔ tɩ san Gati.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ ka Isareli wokpen dɩdaka fɔ bɛ san.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Mɔ ye ɔya gɛtɛ Dɩdaka fɔ dɩ ma gyu Gati fɔ, Yahwe wowurufa wʋ tɔ ditele dɩtɔkɔ dii koro gɛ be gyu gɩsaa-dɩrɛ. Ɛ yɛ beserelɛ be sere-sere ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu, bɛndɩrɛ ma bebi powu. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Okoro bɛ ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ san Ekiron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ Dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ bɔ dii gyu Ekiron fɔ, Ekuron bete bɛ gbɛrɛ afala bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ ka Isareli wokpen dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba nfan, bàà be wolo ɛtɩ ma tɩɩ bɛnɩ. <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Okoro be kpèlè Ekiron begyu be tuma gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka Isareli wokpen dɩdaka fɔ ɩ san. I birima dɩ ɩ san dɩɩlɛ, nka gɛlɛ fɔ daà be wolo ɛtɩ ma tɩɩ bɛnɩ.&gt;&gt; Yema diku dɩ yɛ gɩsaa-dɩrɛ gi gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ, yema Wurubwarɛ wowurufa-dɩrɛ wʋ ba boo koro. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Bɛnɩ gɛtɛ ben ku fɔ, beserelɛ be sere-sere bɛ, be wula gɛ boo gewula fɔ gɩ san gatala.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Filistiya bete be birima Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Gɛtɛ Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ sara Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ bebon kwarankɩ wʋʋ gama fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Filisiti bete be kpèlè boo bekpente ma bɔɔ bɛsɔmalɛ, gɛ be lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ taà mɛ ma Yahwe Dɩdaka fɔ? I wùlà tɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ taà birima dɩ tɩ san dii geyekʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi yaà birima Isareli wokpen Dɩdaka fɔ ɩ san fɔ, ɩ kara ka dɩ ɩ san tuntun, ɩ ka ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ yii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ ɩ fɩya ma ɛdɩ. Gɛlɛ fɔ, yaà wura geyeba gɩɩ gɛkya, gɛ yaà nyɩnla ade gɛtɛ yii koro gɛ wowurufa wʋʋ ba yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Filisiti bete be lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anyan mɔmɔ gɛ taà ka tɩ tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ yii gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɩya ma Dikola Dɩdaka fɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Gɛ be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Yaà tɛ sɩka-sɩya wanyan ton gɛtɛ ì yela ɩ̀ tɛ beserelɛ gɛtɛ be sere yɩ fɔ, ma begbele ton anlɛ gɛtɛ yii begyu-dɩrɛ bɔɔkʋna wù we fɔ. Yema diyebabi-kɩlɩn nyadɩ na gye ɛyɩ ma yii-ise yɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Okoro ɩ mɛ anyan-maralɛ anlɛ beserelɛ fɔ boonundu ma begbele gɛtɛ bɛɛ mɩna gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ, fɔ yàà ka gebù ɩ tɛ Isareli wokpen fɔ. Nkɩfɔ eè kere wowurufa gɛtɛ è de ɛyɩ ma yii bekpen ma yɩɩ gɛtʋnkwaa yii koro fɔ ɛ ya. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩɩ mɛ oturu-dʋrʋ anlɛ gɛtɛ Egyipiti bete ma Farawo bɛ mɛ fɔ? Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ e tiira bɛ giten fɔ, bɛn tɛ Isareli bete fɔ osele, gɛtɛ bàà san ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bee len fɔ?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Nkele, ɩ mɛ tiiramisan, fɔ yàà len bɛkwɔ-nanɩ bɛnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bè de abi, gɛ bɛn tɛ sa bɛ oyon gigyen mɛ gʋtʋn fɔ. Ɩ ban bɛ ma tiiramisan fɔ, mɔ i birima baabi fɔ ɩ ma sa bɛnan boo dikwo daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Ɩ ka Yahwe Dɩdaka fɔ ɩ gyaga tiiramisan fɔ wo koro, fɔ yàà ka sɩka-sɩya wanyan gɛtɛ ɩ mɛ gɛtɛ i yela tɛ ade-kpen yɩɩ gɛkakyɛ dii gedi dɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ ɩ sa dɩdakabi gɛtɛ ɩ mɛ ɩ marama tiiramisan fɔ daanɩ. Fɔ yaà tiri tiiramisan fɔ osele. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Mɔ ɩ sɩ̀ gʋnʋn yaà tɩ nya dɩ! Gengyi dɩ̀ bʋn dɩɩ fɔrɔ dii geyekʋn Beti-Semesi fɔ, wuu wùlà alɛ Yahwe na di tɩ gyerebi-dɩrɛ nyawɔ. Mɔ gengyi dɩn da ma dʋkɔ fɔ, wuu wùlà alɛ nka Yahwe n tɛ tiira tɩ giten. Wù di ade-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɩ ba gɛ tuntun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Okoro bɛ mɛ gɛlɛ. Bɛ ka bɛkwɔ-nanɩ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ gɛtɛ be de abi fɔ, gɛ bɛ ban bɛ bɛ marama tiiramisan fɔ, gɛ bɛ kpaara baabi fɔ bɛ ma sa bɛnan boo dikwo daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Bɛ ka Yahwe dɩdaka fɔ bɛ gyaga tiiramisan fɔ wo koro fɩya ma begbele gɛtɛ bɛ ka sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ ma sɩka-sɩya wanyan gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ yɩ anlɛ beserelɛ fɔ, bɛ sa dɩdakabi fɔ daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Gɛ Bɛkwɔ fɔ bɛ ka osele fɔ tɩɩn bɛ bʋn ma Beti-Semesi, gɛtɛ bɛn falɩ dɩbɩyan abɛɛ ɔlɔgyɩ. Gɛ Filisiti wo-ise yii bɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɛ tɛrɛma bɛ gɛlɛɛ ma ye Beti-Semesi wɔbalan waanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Waanɩ fɔ Beti-Semesi bete bee belen baamɔrɔ dɩtagba fɔ daanɩ. Gɛtɛ bɛ bʋma bʋnʋn, gɛ be we Yahwe dɩdaka fɔ, wʋ mɛ bɛ ɔsɛ gepepe. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Tiira-mɩ-san fɔ ɛ ma gyu Yosuwa gɛtɛ e ye Beti-Semesi fɔ woli waanɩ, gɛ wu yela dʋkɔbɛ dɩtaa-dɩrɛ dɩkɩ dɩɩpɩ. Bɛnɩ fɔ be kebi tiiramisan fɔ wo-iyon bɛ sa ɔtan gɛ bɛ ka bɛkwɔ fɔ bɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi bɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Lefi bete bɛ warama Yahwe Dɩdaka fɔ fɩya ma dɩdakabi gɛtɛ sɩka-sɩya wanyan ɩ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ bɛ gyaga dɩtaa-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro. Duwi dɩtɔkɔ Beti-Semesi bete bɛ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ kperen-kperen. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Filisiti wo begyu-dɩrɛ ton fɔ be we ade nyayɩ powu, gɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke be biri bɛ da Ekiron.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Sɩka-sɩya wanyan gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ anlɛ beserelɛ gɛtɛ Filisiti bete, ditele-kamasɛ ma diiyo (Asidodi, ma Gasa, ma Asikelon, ma Gati, ma Ekuron). Bɛ ka bɛ ba anlɛ ade-kpen yii gedi dɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ tɛ Yahwe fɔ ɩ lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Gɛ begbele gɛtɛ bɛ ka Sɩka-sɩya bɛ mɛ fɔ, baasɔ ɩ̀ san ma Filisiti bete boo begyu-dɩrɛ ton baatele-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ mara ɩpɔrɩ be silin yɩ fɔ. Dɩtaa-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ warama Yahwe dɩdaka bɛ gyaga dii koro, gɛ dɩ̀ sa Yosuwa gɛtɛ e ye Beti-Semesi fɔ woli waanɩ fɔ n di adansɛ duwi dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Mɔ Yahwe e wolo Beti-Semesi beteni bɛkɩ. E wolo baanɩ akpilin asiyee ma fwo (70), yema bɛ nya Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ daanɩ. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be wula yema Yahwe e wolo bɛnɩ kpekpesi nyabɛ e ye baanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Gɛ Beti-Semesi bete be lila alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan talɩ e yela Yahwe, Wurubwarɛ fɩrɩnfɩrɩn nyawɔ bʋnʋn? Ɛnyan wakʋn gɛ taà ka Wurubwarɛ dɩdaka nyadɩ ti ye tɩ san?<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Okoro bɛ sa bɛnɩ bɛ san Kiriyati-Yarim bete baakʋn gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Filisiti bete be birima Yahwe dɩdaka fɔ bɛ ba. Ɩ waran ɩ ba yàà ba ka dɩ ɩ bʋn ɩ san yaakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Okoro Kiriyati-Yarim bete bɛ waran bɛ bɛ ka Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ bɛ bʋn bɛ san Abinadabi wɔ dɩkpaara odon wuu koro. Gɛ bɛ sʋrʋ Abinadabi wobi Eleyasa bʋnɔ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samweli e di Filisiti bete boo koro Misipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Yahwe Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ dɩ sara Kiriyati-Yarim bɩkyan kpekpesi. Dɩ sara dʋkɔ bɩkyan dikpilin bilin. Gɛ Isareli bete powu be wula be kpele Yahwe.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi i biri ɩɩ ba Yahwe wakʋn ma yiituru powu fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ i tiri yii koro i ye bekpen buru-buru, ma Asitaroti bɔɔ dɩsʋma daanɩ, fɔ yàà ka yii koro powu ɩ tɛ Yahwe, fɔ yàà sʋma gɛ woko, fɔ eè to yɩ e ye Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Okoro Isareli bete be kere boo bekpen Bala ma Asitaroti bɔɔ gɛsʋma bɛ ya, gɛ bɛ sʋma Yahwe woko.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè Isareli bete powu i tuma Misipa, fɔ nan yela yɩɩ gɩsɩrɩ n tiri onyun n fɔ Yahwe n tɛ yɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ɔya gɛtɛ be tuma Misipa fɔ, bɛ kpà butu, gɛ bɛ daa bʋ be lù Yahwe bʋnʋn. Duwi dɩtɔkɔ bɛ ban onyun, gɛ be tiri baade-kpen bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ mɛ Yahwe ade-kpen.&gt;&gt; Fɔ Samweli n di Isareli bete boogyegeyelɛ gɛ ɛ̀ sa Misipa ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ nʋn alɛ Isareli bete be tuma Misipa fɔ, Filisiti begyu-dɩrɛ bɛ bʋn bɛ maà tà bɩtà ma ɛbɛ. Gɛtɛ Isareli bete bɛ nʋn gɛlɛ fɔ, be gyu gɩsaa Filisiti bete boo koro. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Bɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Kara kere gewula-kpèlè Yahwe tii Wurubwarɛ fɔ ya tɛ tɩ, gɛlɛ fɔ eè wura e to tɩ e ye Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Samweli e gye dɩyɛranbi, gɛ ɛ ka ɛ tɛ gekuma muruyo gii gedi ɛ tɛ Yahwe. Gɛ e yela Isareli bete boo didin ɛ gbɛrɛ afala ɛ tɛ Yahwe. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ nʋn wakʋn.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Samweli ɛɛ tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi fɔ, Filisiti bete bɛ gbɛma gɛtɛ bàà ta bɩta ma Isareli bete. Mɔ duwi dɩtɔkɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ dɩkpaaba-dɩrɛ dɩ fa Filisiti bete boo koro, gɛ ɛ yɛ bɛ be gyu gɩsaa-dɩrɛ gɛ be serenti be biri. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Isareli bete be serenti be ye Misipa gɛ bɛ kpa bɛ gyaga Filisiti bete boo koro. Be belen-belen bɛ ayu osele waanɩ gɛlɛɛ ma gyu Beti-Kari.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Samweli ɛ ka dɩtaa gɛ e sere Misipa ma Sen boo getite. E kpèlè dɩ alɛ Ebenesa, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nfan gɛ Yahwe ɛ kpà tɩ e be ye.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Okoro Isareli bete be di Filisiti bete boo koro, gɛ Filisiti bete ben mini biri to Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa bɛ nya. Samweli wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ fɔ, Yahwe gʋlɔ gɩ tɔ gi yela Filisiti bete boo koro. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Isareli bete be biri be to atele gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa ye Ekuron san Gati gɛtɛ Filisiti bete be to bɛ nya fɔ. Gɛ olila wʋ ba Isareli bete ma Amori bete boo getite. <verse eid="1SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samweli ɛ mɛ Isareli wogyegeyelɛ wɔ nkpa awi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Gɩkyan-kamasɛ ee silin Isareli watele Beteli, ma Giligali, ma Misipa. Gɛ ɛɛ dɔ̀ bɔɔ gɔdɔ. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Mɔ ee biri ɛ ba Rama, yema dʋkɔ n di wɔlɛ. Dʋkɔ mɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ Isareli gɔdɔ, gɛ e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn dʋkɔ ɛ tɛ Yahwe.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isareli ee bugiti egyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ dan ditenikwaa fɔ, e tiri wobebi ɛ sɩ̀ gɛtɛ bàà mɛ Isareli begyegeyelɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Wobi-gyangbasɛ diyere n di Yoweli, gɛ ɛnyɔɔfɛ fɔ mɔ diyere n di Abiya. Gɛ bɛ mɛ gʋtʋn Beeseba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Mɔ wo bebi fɔ bɛn tɛrɛma wɔ bɩsɩrɩ, kɔba gʋnʋn-sɩya ma geto anyan dibilin daanɩ, ma gɛman dɔ̀ gɔdɔ ma giisele waanɩ gɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Okoro Isareli bɛndɩrɛ powu be tuma, gɛ bɛ san Samweli wakʋn Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;A dan ditenikwaa, gɛ aa bebi bɛn tɛrɛma aasele. Okoro tiri egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu ɛ tɛ tɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɩfɩɩ-kurumakyɛɛ bʋ ba fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Mɔ gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ eè gyegeye ɛ tɛ tɩ&gt;&gt; fɔ, wʋn mɛ Samweli ɔsɛ. Okoro e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Nʋn bɛnɩ fɔ baade powu gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ fɔ. Nka awɔ gɛ be terema, mɔ nmɩ gɛ be terema alɛ miin di boogyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Boo ye duwi gɛtɛ na tiri bɛ na ye Egyipiti bè sere ma ǹdò fɔ, be tiri bɔɔ bʋnʋn be ye miin koro, gɛ bɛɛ sʋma bekpen. Gɛlɛ ke gɛ bɛɛ mɛ awɔ mɔ lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Okoro nʋn baakʋn, mɔ tabʋrʋ tɛ bɛ gepepe, fɔ àà yɛ bɛ bàà nyɩnla ade gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ eè be di bugyu boo koro, ɛɛ̀ mɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Yahwe wanyun-gyebi fɔ powu ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee lila wɔ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ eè be di bugyu yii koro fɔ, ɛɛ̀ nyɩ yii bebi-tenibi ɛ sa bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baanɩ bàà mɛ gʋtʋn ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ ma abengyi, gɛ baà ti serenti tiiramisan ɛbɛ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn bɛ dɩyɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Ɛɛ̀ mɛ bɛkɩ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ ɛ tɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000), bɛkɩ mɔ baà mɛ bɛndɩrɛ bɛ tɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo (50), gɛ ɛɛ̀ yɛ bɛkɩ mɔ baà fʋn woli fɔ bàà sila oli fɔ wanyan. Ɛɛ̀ yɛ bɛkɩ bàà wɔrɔ bɩtà baakpanyan ma tiiramisan ɛbɛ baanyan. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Ɛɛ̀ yɛ yii bebi-nanɩbi bàà tɩ̀ mɛ anyɩmɩnyanma ofen bɛ tɛ wɔ, gɛ bɛkɩ baà kpele bɛ tɛ wɔ, bedo mɔ bàà tì kuma boroboro bɛ tɛ wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Eè to yɩɩ ntʋnkwaa-kpara, ma yɩɩ wayɩn wo-ili-kpara, ma yii-ilifwi ili-kpara ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Eè to yii-ili yaanyan dikpen fwofɛ, ma yɩɩ wayɩn wo-ili ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛndɩrɛbi ma wɔ bɛsaranyan. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Eè to yɩɩ bɛsaranyan ma yɩɩ bɛsʋgʋgyan ma yɩɩ bɛkwɔ-kpara ma yaakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ ɛ mɛ woyo. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Eè to yaanyan dikpen fwofɛ e ye yɩɩ bɛnan-tonlɛ baanɩ, gɛ ɛyɩ gbagba yaà bɛ mɛ wɔ bɛdɩ̀. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Gɛ gengyi ɔya wʋtɔkɔ wʋ̀ nɩma fɔ, yaà wula i kpele Yahwe gɛtɛ èè to yɩ ye yiigyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ i tiri fɔ walɔ yaanɩ, mɔ Yahwe ɛn nan nʋn yaakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛn nʋn Samweli wakʋn, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa! Tii len egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ eè di bugyu tii koro. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Ɛwʋ fɔ taà mɛ anlɛ bɩfɩɩ-kurumakyɛɛ, gɛtɛ bʋ̀ ba egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ eè gyegeye ɛ tɛ tɩ bɩtà baanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ nʋn baade powu gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, e birima yɩ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ tɛ Yahwe. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Yahwe e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nʋn baakʋn, fɔ àà sɩ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ tɛ bɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ alɛ, ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ san wo ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli ɛ sʋrʋ Sawulo bʋnɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Ete gbaa ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e ye Benyamin wofoli waanɩ gɛ bee kpèlè wɔ Kisi fɔ na sara. Kisi wote n di Abile gɛtɛ wobi n di Sero fɔ. Sero wote n di Bekorati, gɛ Bekorati wote n di Afiya. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Kisi ɛ̀ ba ebi-tenibi gɛtɛ bee kpele wɔ alɛ Sawulo. Ɛ̀ ba ɔmɩrɩ gɛ e ye gɩnɩ ɛ da ɛnɩ-kamasɛ Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Wʋ bɛ ba gɛtɛ Sawulo wote Kisi wakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ i lulu, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Ka bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ fɩya ma koro, fɔ yàà ma bugiti akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Okoro bɛ da ma Efarim wodon wʋʋ gɛtʋnkwaa ka ma ye Salisa, mɔ ben we yɩ. Bɛ kyaga wuu koro bɛ san Saalim wɔ ntʋnkwaa baanɩ, mɔ akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ ɩn ma dʋkɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ da ma Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, mɔ ben we yɩ.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Gɛtɛ be gyu Sufi gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ, Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsaranyan gɛtɛ ɛbɛ ma ɛwɔ bɛ san fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ taà biri, nka gɛlɛ fɔ miinte eè kere gɛsa amɩnlɛ akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ yii koro ɛ ya, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ sa amɩnlɛ tii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa ditele nyadɩ daanɩ gɛtɛ bee bù wɔ gepepe, gɛ ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ dɔ̀ fɔ, wʋʋ ba waanɩ. Yɛ taà san wakʋn. Nkɩfɔ eè wùlà tɩ osele gɛtɛ taà ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi tɩ̀ san fɔ, anʋn gɛ taà ka tɩ tɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ? anyandilɛ gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa tii bekotoku baanɩ fɔ, i were, gɛ tɩn ma anyan-kyɛlɛ gɛtɛ taà ka tɩ tɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ. Abɛɛ gɩnyankɩ gɩ̀ sa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, ǹ bà shekeli diibi dii geyo dikpen-naafɛ dɩkɩ dɩ̀ sa maakʋn. Nan ka dɩ n tɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ, fɔ èè wura wùlà tɩ osele gɛtɛ taà ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Wukukuba waanɩ fɔ, Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ fɔ, gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ san ɛ̀ ma lila ade Wurubwarɛ wakʋn fɔ, ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba, taà ma we ewelɛ,&gt;&gt; yema ɛnɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ ǹdò lɛ, nafɔ bee ti kpèlè wɔ gɛ ewelɛ Hebre ginde gaanɩ.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Gɛ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ, yɛ taà san.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛ tɔ bɛ da ditele gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔnɩ fɔ ɛ̀ sa daanɩ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Gɛtɛ bɛɛ bʋn odon fɔ bɛɛ fɔrɔ ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, be tuma bɛsʋgʋgyan bɛkɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ fɔrɔ bɛ ma kpa butu, gɛ be lila bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ewelɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ewelɛ ade è di Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ</char></note> ade fɔ ɛ̀ sa nfan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, ɛ̀ sa yɩɩ bʋnʋn. Ɩ kya koro! Nkenkele nyawʋ gɛ e be gyu tii ditele daanɩ, yema bɛnɩ bɛ ba bàà bɛ tɛ gedi gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Gengyi ɩ bɔ i gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, yaà we wɔ, pɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ bʋn san Dɩsʋma-kʋn ma di. Bɛnɩ fɔ bɛn nan di pɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma gyu, yema wù di gɛtɛ èè hira gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ gaanyan fɔ. Wʋʋ gama fɔ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be kpèlè fɔ baà talɩ be di. Ɩ bʋn ɩ san, ɔkʋna nyawʋ yaà we wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Bɛ san bɛ ma gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛtɛ bee gyu ditele fɔ daanɩ fɔ, be tuma Samweli ɛɛ fɔrɔ Dɩsʋma-kʋn fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Pɛ kere gaà bɛ kpa Sawulo ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ san Samweli wakʋn fɔ, Yahwe e tiri e wùlà wɔ alan, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Gɩsa ɔya nyawʋ wʋʋkʋna fɔ, nan sa ɛnɩ ɛkɩ n ye Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ n ba aakʋn. Sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ mɛ egyegeyelɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ Isareli bete boo koro. Eè tiri bɛ e ye Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ. Yema be wula be kpèlè mɩ, gɛ na nʋn boo gewùlà kpèlè fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Gɛtɛ Samweli e we Sawulo fɔ, Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ wade na tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ wɔ lɛ. Ɛwɔ nan di bugyu ɛ tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sawulo e kpe ɛ gbɛma Samweli ditele fɔ diitunu wʋʋpɩ, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, aà talɩ a wùlà mɩ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ ewelɛ ade fɔ dɩkpaara dɩ̀ sa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samweli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ ǹ di ewelɛ fɔ. Ɩ bɛ da i gyegeye taà san gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn, yema wù di gɛtɛ àà di ma nmɩ ǹdò, gɩsa gɛgyɩgyan fɔ nan dɔ̀ ade powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa aaturu waanɩ, fɔ nan tiri wɔ osele. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ gɛtɛ i lulu ǹdò awi asiyee lɛ bɩrɛ, ɩ kara sa yaamɩnlɛ, yema be we yɩ. Gɛ ɛnyan wade gɛ Isareli bete powu bee len? Nka awɔ ma aate dɩkpaara?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sawulo e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Na ye gɛ Benyamin wofoli gɛtɛ ɛwʋ n di Isareli wo-ifoli yaanɩ wʋpɩɩ, gɛ mɩɩn dɩkpaara n di dɩkpaara gɛtɛ dɩn taa di gʋnʋn ofoli fɔ waanɩ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa dɔ̀ mɩ ade nyayɩ yiidu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ ka Sawulo ma wɔsaranyan fɔ e gyu gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ, gɛ ɛ ka bɛ ɛ mɛ bɛndɩrɛ ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be kpèlè bàà be di fɔ. Baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ dikpilin ma fwo. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ ekpelelɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka gɩnan gɛtɛ na ka na tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ ba, ɛgɩ gɛtɛ na dɔ̀ alɛ tiri sɩ̀ gɩlan fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Okoro ekpelelɛ fɔ e tiri dɩbɛrɛ ma anyan powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ fɩya fɔ, ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Sawulo bʋnʋn. Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, nyawʋ n di gɩnyan gɛtɛ na tiri na sɩ̀ wɔ̀. Kɔrɔ, yema na tiri yɩ na sɩ̀ wɔ̀ wàà mɛ aayo ade-mɛlɛ nyayɩ yaanɩ, okoro kɔrɔ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ na kpèlè fɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e di ɔgyɔlɔ waanyandilɛ ma Samweli duwi dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Gɛtɛ bɛ waran be ye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn be be gyu ditele daanɩ fɔ, Samweli e tabʋrʋ ma Sawulo wabansʋrʋ fɔ wo koro. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Kere-kpalɛ gɛgyɩgyan-fuu fɔ Samweli e kpèlè Sawulo abansʋrʋ fɔ gatala gɛ e dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Pɩna koro, nan ma yela wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; Sawulo ɛ pɩna koro gɛ bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ be ye okòro disere-kɩlɩn. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Gɛtɛ bɛɛ nɩma ditele fɔ daatuma fɔ, Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ aasaranyan fɔ alɛ ɛ bɛ da e gyegeye.&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛsaranyan fɔ ɛ mɛ gɛlɛ. Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ yela nfan bɛrɛɛ, nan tɛ wɔ̀ ɔtʋn gɛtɛ wʋ ye Wurubwarɛ wakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ ka bʋnɔ ma parantwa, gɛ ɛ daa e lù Sawulo duyu, gɛ e mù wɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ̀ bʋnɔ, gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔ̀ egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Gɛtɛ aa ye maakʋn ǹdò lɛ, aà tuma beteni bɛnyɔɔ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Raheli gɩsàn gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Selisa gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Benyamin wɔbalan fɔ. Baà dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Be we akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ gɛtɛ a tɔ à san aa bugiti fɔ. Gɛ aate ɛn mɩnɩ taa nɩ sa yaamɩnlɛ mɔ ɛ yɛ ɛɛ sa gɛ awɔ amɩnlɛ, gɛ ee lila alan, &lt;Lan gɛ nan mɛ miinbi wade nyayɩ?&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />À san bʋnʋn fɔ, pɛ àà bè gyu Tabo woyon-dɩrɛ fɔ wʋʋpɩ fɔ, aà tuma beteni besiyee gɛtɛ bɛɛ bʋn bɛɛ fɔrɔ Beteli bàà ma sʋma Wurubwarɛ. Ɛkɩ è tola begbebi atan asiyee, edo è tola boroboro besiyee, edo mɔ è tola wayɩn bʋkan osun. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Baà sa wɔ̀ onyun, fɔ bɛ tɛ wɔ̀ boroboro bɛnyɔɔ. Gɛ wù di gɛtɛ àà to bɛ.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />Wʋʋ gama fɔ aà san Wurubwarɛ wodon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Gibeya, Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ getumakʋn. Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ aa gbɛma ditele fɔ, aà tuma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi, gɛtɛ bɛ waran be ye gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ma adʋlɛ, ma akyaka, ma akantan, ma adʋlɛ-dɩrɛ bè gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn fɔ ɛbɛ mɔ bɛɛ dɔ̀ Wurubwarɛ wade. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Fɔ Yahwe Gifiye gaà ba aa koro ɔkɛma waanɩ, gɛ awɔ ma ɛbɛ yaà tabʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ wade, gɛ aà foma a mɛ ɛnɩ-fon. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Gengyi gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ ɩ̀ ba waanɩ fɔ, mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩ kʋtʋma, yema Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma awɔ.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />Waran gyegeye mɩ san Giligali, nan bɛ tama wɔ̀, fɔ nan tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi. Mɔ wù di gɛtɛ àà so mɩ awi kwarankɩ ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ nan bè wùlà wɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ wù di gɛtɛ àà mɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛ sɩ̀ Sawulo bugyu-dɩrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e fi èè kpe ye Samweli wakʋn fɔ, Wurubwarɛ e foma Sawulo woturu, gɛ ade gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ powu ɩ ba waanɩ duwi dɩtɔkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Gɛtɛ be ma gyu Gibeya fɔ, Wurubwarɛ wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi be tuma wɔ. Wurubwarɛ gifiye gɩ ba ma ɔkɛma Sawulo wo koro, gɛ ɛ ma fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ, gɛ be gyu gɛtabʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ wade. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Gɛtɛ ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fʋrʋma bɛ̀ nyɩ wɔ fɔ, be we wɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ bɛɛ tabʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ wade fɔ, be lila ma bɛwɔlɔn alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yaade n di nyayɩ gɛtɛ ɩɩ ba Kisi wobi wo koro lɛ? Okoro Sawulo mɔ ɛ̀ fɩya Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ baanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Ete ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sara baakʋn fɔ, e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛ ɛnyan ǹ di boogyegeyelɛ?&gt;&gt; Okoro wʋ bɛ dʋrɔ dɩkpalɩ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Sawulo mɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e ten gɛtabʋrʋ fɔ, ɛ da gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Sawulo wogbete e lila ɛwɔ ma wɔsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gaanɩ gɛ ɩ san?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Sawulo e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Tii bugiti akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ, gɛ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ti we tɩ nyɩnla alɛ, tɩn nan we yɩ fɔ, tɩ san Samweli wakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Gɛ Sawulo wogbete alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ mɩ ade gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ dɔ̀ tɩ ɛ tana alɛ be we akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Sawulo ɛn dɔ̀ wogbete ade gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ kadama bugyu buu gedi fɔ baade. <verse eid="1SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Samweli e kpèlè Isareli bete fɔ e tuma Yahwe bʋnʋn Misipa ditele daanɩ, <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ Yahwe, Isareli bete boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ fɔ n di alan, &lt;Na tiri Isareli na ye Egyipiti gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛ na tiri yɩ na ye Egyipiti wɔkɛma waanɩ ma bugyu-bugyu gɛtɛ bʋʋ nyɩ yɩ fɔ baanɩ.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Mɔ nkele i terema yii Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ e tiri yɩ e ye gyerebi ma dɩfana powu fɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ ɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Sɩ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ tɛ tɩ.&gt; Wʋ kɔlɔ, i be yela Yahwe bʋnʋn yii-ifoli-ifoli ma yaakpara-akpara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ yɛ Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ powu i ye ɩ ba bʋnʋn fɔ, Benyamin wofoli gɛ Yahwe e tiri. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ yɛ Benyamin wofoli fɔ wʋʋ bɛnɩ be ye bɛ ba bʋnʋn, akpara-akpara, gɛ be tiri Matiri dɩkpaara. Wʋʋ gama powu fɔ, Kisi wobi Sawulo gɛ be tiri. Mɔ gɛtɛ be bugiti wɔ fɔ, ben we wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Gɛ be biri be lila Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ fɔ ɛ wɛrɛ ba nfan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Gɛ Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ ba, mɔ ɛ ma bu atola fɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Be serenti bɛ ma tiri wɔ be ye be be yela bɛnɩ fɔ boo getite. Gɛtɛ è yela fɔ, ɛ̀ ba abo da ɛkamasɛ. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bete fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;I we ɛnɩ gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri? Ɛkɩ ɛn ma yaanɩ gɛtɛ è we anlɛ ɛwɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ gbɛrɛ afala alan, &lt;&lt;Tiigyu ɛ sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Samweli e tiri bugyu buu gedi buu-ise e wùlà bɛnɩ fɔ. Ɛ ŋwara yɩ ɛ sa gɩkpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ bɛɛ ŋwara gɛ ade bɛ gyaga ɛnan gɩkpa gii koro</char></note> gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka gɩ ɛ sɩ̀ Yahwe bʋnʋn. Gɛtɛ e were fɔ, Samweli ɛ yasɩ bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ ɛkamasɛ e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Sawulo mɔ e biri ɛ da wɔlɛ Gibeya, fɩya ma dɩkpatɩ dɩɩ beteni gɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ kya boo-ituru fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Mɔ bɛnɩ bɛkɩ gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ ete nyawɔ ɛɛ̀ talɩ e to tɩ ɛ ya?&gt;&gt; Bɛn ka gebù tɛ wɔ, gɛ bɛn kyɛ wɔ anyan. Mɔ Sawulo ɛn dɔ ade ɩkɩ.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo e to Yabesi ditele ɛ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Ɔya wʋkɩ waanɩ fɔ, Amon-te gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Nahasi fɔ ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ bʋn bɛ ma sʋ Yabesi ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Gileyadi fɔ bɛ sa, gɛ ditele fɔ dii beteni powu bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ taà tà dikola ma awɔ, fɔ tàà sara aa gatɩn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Mɔ Amon-te Naasa e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nan tà dikola ma ɛyɩ, mɔ pɛgɛ nan tà dikola ma ɛyɩ fɔ, nan logoti eteni-kamasɛ wologyi wʋʋ gʋnʋn n tiri nan ka n fuli Isareli powu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Gɛ Yabesi bɛndɩrɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɛ tɩ awi kwarankɩ, fɔ taà sa bɛnɩ Isareli atele powu yaanɩ, gengyi tin wura etolɛ-yalɛ fɔ, taà ka koro tɩ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be gyu Gibeya, Sawulo ditele daanɩ, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ ɔtʋn fɔ, ɛkamasɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala e wula. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Dʋkɔbɛ fɔ Sawulo e ye oli e be gyu ma bɛkwɔ, gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn n de bɛnɩ fɔ? anʋn yii koro gɛ bee wula?&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ɔtʋn gɛtɛ wu ye Yabesi bɛndɩrɛ baakʋn fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, Wurubwarɛ Gifiye gi ba wo koro ɔkɛma waanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka owurufa gepepe. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Ɛ ka bɛkwɔ bɛnyɔɔ, gɛ e wolo bɛ, gɛ e belen bɔɔ gɩnan buru-buru, gɛ ɛ sa bɛnɩ alɛ, bɛ ka be silin Isareli gɩfɩɩ powu fɔ bàà dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛn nan tɛrɛma Sawulo ma Samweli fɔ, anlɛ gɛ baà mɛ wɔ bɛkwɔ-teni.&gt;&gt; Yahwe geserenti gi gyu bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ, gɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ mɛ onyun-kɩlɩn gɛ be ye. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ kʋla bɛ Beseki fɔ, Isareli bete bɛ̀ ba asepekyi fwo-ton (300,000), gɛ Yuda bete bɛ̀ ba disepekyi dɩkɩ ma ɩgbaa-ton (30,000).<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sa fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ Yabesi bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Gileyadi fɔ alan, Gɩsa ofila ken-ken, baà to yɩ bɛ ya.&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ bɛsalɛ fɔ bɛ ma dɔ̀ ade nyayɩ bɛ tɛ Yabesi bɛnɩ fɔ, wʋ mɛ bɛ ɔsɛ. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yabesi bete bɛ dɔ̀ Amon bete fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsa, taà ka koro tɩ tɛ yɩ, fɔ yàà mɛ tɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ì len.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ Sawulo e yo wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ akpen asiyee, gagyɩgyan-fuu gɩtɔkɔ. Gɛ Isareli bete be gyu Amoni bete boo gɛsarakʋn, gɛ be belen bɛ ayu ma sere ofila ken-ken. Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ be kuruma fɔ, bɛ yasɩ gɛtɛ an nan we bɛnyɔɔ bɛ̀ san.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Be to Sawulo bugyu bɛ sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Isareli bɛnɩ be lila Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan ɛbɛ na dɔ̀ alan, Sawulo ɛn nan talɩ ɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ tɩ fɔ? Ɩ ka bɛ ɩ tɛ tɩ tàà wolo bɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Mɔ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Bɛ nan wolo ɛkɩ ǹdò, yema Yahwe e to Isareli ɛ ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ba, taà san Giligali fɔ taà ma to Sawulo bugyu tɩ sa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Okoro bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ san Giligali, gɛ bɛ ma to Sawulo bugyu fɔ bɛ sa Yahwe bʋnʋn. Dʋkɔ gɛ bɛ tɛ Yahwe olila wuu gedi. Gɛ Sawulo ma Isareli bɛnɩ powu be di ɔsɛ-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli gɛtabʋrʋ kala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bɛnɩ powu alan, &lt;&lt;Na nʋn ade-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ, gɛ na sɩ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ nya yii koro. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Nkele ɩ̀ ba egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ è gyegeye ɛ̀ tɛ yɩ. Mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, na dan gɛ maayungu i fo, gɛ miin bebi-tenibi bɛ̀ sa ma ɛyɩ. Na mɛ yiigyegeyelɛ ye mɩɩn gɛsaranyan gaanɩ be ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Ɩ nyaa mɩ, gengyi na mɛ ade-kpen ɩkɩ fɔ, ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ Yahwe ma egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn. Ɛnyan wɔkwɔ gɛ na to? Abɛɛ ɛnyan dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ gɛ na to? Ɛnyan gɛ na kuti? Ɛnyan gɛ na nyanla? Ɛnyan gɛ na to gɩnyankɩ na ye wakʋn dibilin daanɩ? Gengyi gɛ na mɛ gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ ɩkɩ fɔ, nan birima anyan gɛtɛ na to fɔ n tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Bɛnɩ fɔ be tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;An kuti tɩ, an nyanla gɛ an to gɩnyankɩ ye ɛkɩ walɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ee di mɩ adansɛ, gɛ wɔsʋrʋlɛ bʋnɔ fɔ mɔ ee di mɩ adansɛ ǹdò gɛtɛ in we ade-kpen ɩkɩ miin koro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be yera alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwʋ lɛ, ee di adansɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe na tiri Mose ma Aaron, gɛ be tiri yiitu ɛbɛ be ye Egyipiti. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Nkele i yela nfan yiridi Yahwe bʋnʋn, fɔ nan kʋna yɩ ade-tʋnalɛ powu gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ ɛyɩ ma yiitu ɛbɛ.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yakobu e gyu Egyipiti fɔ, be wula be kpèlè Yahwe alɛ ɛ kpà bɛ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ sa Mose ma Aaron, gɛ be tiri yiitu ɛbɛ be ye Egyipiti bɛ ba gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />&lt;&lt;Mɔ be finla Yahwe boo Wurubwarɛ fɔ, okoro e fu bɛ ɛ tɛ Sisera gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Haso wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ boogyegeyelɛ fɔ. Gɛ ɛ nɩ ka bɛ ɛ sa Filisiti bete ma Mowabi wogyu gɛtɛ bɛ kpà ma ɛbɛ fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Be wula be kpèlè Yahwe alan, &lt;Tɩ mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen. Ti kere awɔ Yahwe tɩ ya, gɛ tɩ ma sʋma Bali ma Asitaroti boo bekpen. Nkele tiri ti ye tɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ baalɔ yaanɩ, fɔ taà sʋma wɔ̀.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ sa Yerubala, ma Baraki, ma Yefita, ma nmɩ, Samweli, gɛ e tiri yɩ e ye yɩɩ bɛkyʋnlɛ gɛtɛ be silin yɩ be tuma fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ, fɔ yàà sara olila waanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />Mɔ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ i we Nahasa gɛtɛ è di Amon bete boogyu fɔ ɛ̀ bɛ kpà ma ɛyɩ fɔ, ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;&lt;Tii len egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nya tii koro,&gt;&gt; ma gɛtɛ Yahwe yii Wurubwarɛ n di yiigyu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Ɩ nya egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ i tiri fɔ wɔlɛ, ɛwɔ gɛtɛ i lila fɔ gɛ Yahwe e tiri ɛ tɛ yɩ. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Gengyi ì serenti Yahwe, gɛ ɩ̀ sʋma wɔ, gɛ ì bù wɔ gɛ ɩn tɔ yela wo-ise fɔ yii koro, gɛ gengyi ɛyɩ ma egyu gɛtɛ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ yɩ lɛ, ɩ̀ tɛrɛma Yahwe yii Wurubwarɛ fɔ, wʋ̀ kɔlɔ <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Mɔ gengyi in bu Yahwe, gɛ ɩ tɔ yela wo-ise fɔ yii koro fɔ, Yahwe wowurufa waà tɔ ɛyɩ ma yiigyu-dɩrɛ fɔ wo koro anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ tɔ yiitu ɛbɛ boo koro fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />&lt;&lt;Okoro nkele, i yela, fɔ yàà nya ade-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ bɛ mɛ yɩɩ bʋnʋn baanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Nka anyan yii gesila yɩɩya wʋ lɛ? Nan tiri onyun n tɛ Yahwe, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ dɩkpaaba dàà fa fɔ ɛsʋn ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n. Fɔ yàà we nyɩnla ade-kpen gɛtɛ ɩ mɛ Yahwe, gɛtɛ i lila alɛ ii len egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ okoro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Gɛ Samweli e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ dɩkpaaba dɩ fa gɛ ɛsʋn ɛ nʋ̀n duwi dɩtɔkɔ ke. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ powu be serenti Yahwe ma Samweli gepepe.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Bɛnɩ fɔ powu bɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri onyun fɔ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ tɛ ɛtɩ aa bɛsaranyan, fɔ tɩ kara be ku, yema tɩ ka nyayɩ gɛtɛ tɩ dɔ̀ alɛ tii len egyu-dɩrɛ lɛ tɩ fɩya ma taade-kpen powu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ fʋrʋma ɩ̀ sa fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsaa gɩn kara ton yɩ, ɩ wɛrɛ mɛ ade-kpen nyayɩ powu ɩ bɛ da, mɔ ɩ kara fi gama i ten Yahwe, mɔ ɩ ka yiituru powu ɩ sʋma wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Ɩ kara fi yɩɩ bʋnʋn ɩ san bekpen gɛtɛ bɛn ma tɔnɔ lɛ baakʋn! Bɛn talɩ bɛ mɛ ade-kpara ɩkɩ bɛ tɛ yɩ, gɛ bɛn talɩ be to yɩ bɛ ya, yema ben di gɩnyankɩ. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Yahwe diyere-dɩrɛ fɔ dii koro, ɛn nan kere wɔ bɛnɩ ɛ ya, yema wu di wɔ gʋnʋn gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka yɩ mɛ woyo ɛbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Nmɩ bɩrɛ, mɩn nan mɛ Yahwe ade-kpen alɛ nan terema onyun wuu getiri n tɛ yɩ. Gɛ nan wùlà yɩ osele gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ ma ɛwʋ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Mɔ ɩ nya gepe gɛtɛ yàà serenti Yahwe, fɔ yàà ka yiituru powu ɩ sʋma wɔ nʋnkwarɩ anɩ. Ɩ yɛ ade-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ ɛ tɛ yɩ fɔ yàà di yɩ gʋnʋn. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Mɔ gengyi gɛ ɛyɩ ma yiigyu ɩ̀ sɩna bʋnʋn ɩ mɛ ade-kpen fɔ, ɛyɩ powu yaà muru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo ɛn nʋn Samweli wakʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sawulo e di bɩkyan dikpilin ma fwo pɛgɛ ɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ, gɛ e di bugyu Isareli bete boo koro bɩkyan akpilin anyɔɔ ma anyɔɔ.<verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sawulo e tiri bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (3,000) e ye Isareli bete baanɩ. Ɛ yɛ bɛnɩ gbaa (2,000) bɛ sara ma ɛwɔ Mikimasi ditele ma Beteli wodon wʋʋ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Gɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000) mɔ bɛ̀ sa ma Yonatan, Gibeya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. Gɛ e birima bɛnɩ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ ɛ tɩyɛma bɔɔ-ɩlɛ.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonatan ɛ tà bɩtà ma Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ gɛtɛ bè si Geba fɔ, gɛ e di boo koro, gɛ Filisiti bete bɛ nʋn ade fɔ. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ yɛ bɛ fʋn dɩkantan be silin gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ powu, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Hebre bete ɩ nʋn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Okoro Isareli bete powu bɛ nʋn ade fɔ alɛ, Sawulo e wolo Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bè si Geba fɔ, gɛlɛ wuu koro Filisiti bete bɛ ka owurufa Isareli bete boo koro. Gɛ Isareli bete be kpèlè getuma Sawulo wakʋn Giligali ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Gɛ Filisiti bete bɛ kʋla gɛtɛ bɛ̀ ma ta bɩtà ma Isareli. Bɛ kʋla tiiramisan ɛbɛ gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (3,000), ma abengyi yɩɩ bɛsaralɛ ɩgbaa isiyee (6,000), ma bɛnɩ dɩtɩnpan anlɛ ɛpʋ wɔ-ɩŋɛrɛ. Bɛ tɔ bɛ ma sara Mikimasi, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Beti-Afen ofila wʋʋ gɛtakʋn wʋʋ gɩlan fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete be we gɛtɛ boo geyelakʋn wʋ̀ ba ɔkɛma fɔ, gɛ bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ boo koro gi gye bɛ fɔ, be serenti bɛ ma bu ataa-fwe yaanɩ, gɛ bɛkɩ mɔ be bu akantibi, ma afwe-dɩrɛ, ma ɩlɔkɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Hebre bete fɔ bɛkɩ bɛ kaara Yodan getu bɛ san Gadi ma Gileyadi ntʋnkwaa baanɩ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sawulo ɛ wɔ Giligali, gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ gɩsaa gi gyu bɛ gɛ koro gɩ gbɛrɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sawulo e so dʋkɔbɛ awi kwarankɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, mɔ Samweli ɛn ba Giligali, gɛ Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ kya gɛyasɩ. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka gekuma gii gedi, ma olila wuu gedi yaanyan ɩ mɔma mɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Sawulo ɛ tɛ gekuma gii gedi. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Gɛtɛ ɛ bɔ ɛ tɛ gedi fɔ e were fɔ, Samweli e bè gyu. Gɛ Sawulo e ye ɛ ma sa wɔ onyun.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Gɛ Samweli e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ a mɛ lɛ?&gt;&gt; Sawulo e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ na we alɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɛɛ yasɩ bɛ yɛ mɩ, gɛ awɔ mɔ an taa ba ɔya gɛtɛ a sɩ̀ fɔ, gɛ Filisiti bete mɔ bɛ bɛ kʋla Mikimasi fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />na sa amɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt;Nkele, Filisiti bete baà bɛ tà bɩtà ma nmɩ Giligali, gɛ mɩn lila Yahwe gutunkoro gii gewe.&gt; okoro wʋ̀ nyɩ mɩ gɛ na tɛ Yahwe gekuma gii gedi fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;A mɛ anyimapu-de. An ton Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ wanyun-gyebi fɔ yaanɩ. Gengyi à daà ton yaanɩ fɔ, nafɔ ɛ̀ daà yɛ bugyu fɔ bàà wɔ awɔ ma aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ gakpaakpa Isareli. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Mɔ nkele, aa bugyu buu gedi bʋn nan kyɛrɩ. Yahwe e tiri ɛnɩ-fon gɛtɛ ɛwɔ gbagba è len wɔ ye woturu waanɩ gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔ egyegeyelɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ bɛnɩ, yema an di Yahwe wo-ise fɔ yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli ɛ tɔ e ye Giligali gɛ ɛ bʋn ɛ da Gibeya gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Benyamin fɔ. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ kalan bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ be kuruma bɛ̀ sa ma ɛwɔ fɔ. Bɛ̀ ba nkpɩn bisiyee (600).<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli ɛn ma akpanyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Waanɩ fɔ, Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ̀ sa Gibeya ditele, gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Benyamin gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. Fɔ Filisiti bete mɔ bɛ kʋla bɛ̀ sa Mikimasi. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bee kpila anyan fɔ be yo akpen asiyee. Dikpen dɩkɩ dɩ da ma Ofira, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa ma Sula gɩlan fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />dikpen dɩkɩ do dɩ dama Beti-Oron, gɛ dikpen-siyeefɛ fɔ dɩ da ma gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gɩɩbalan, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ gbɛma Seboyim dɩtagba gɛtɛ wʋ̀ ten otonkuma fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Ɔya wʋtɔkɔ fɔ, Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ fɔ, ɛwɔrɔ ɛkɩ ɛn ma, yema Filisiti bete bɛ sʋ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Hebre bete, ɩ kara mɛ bedon abɛɛ buturunyan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Okoro Isareli bete powu bɛ yɛ bɛɛ waran bɛ san gɛ Filisiti bete bɔɔ bɛwɔrɔ baakʋn bɛ ma lɔ bɔɔ bɩlɛlɛ, ma boo begyiga, ma baakyɔɔ, ma baawɔrɔnyan-kurumakyɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Bè yo sɛkɛlɩ dibi akpen asiyee fɔ, akpen anyɔɔ n di bɩlɛlɛ, ma begyiga, ma akyɔɔ yɩɩ gɛlɔ yɩɩ gɩyɛ. Gɛ dikpen dɩkɩ mɔ n di awɔrɔnyan kurumakyɛɛ yɩɩ gɛlɔ gɩɩ gɩyɛ.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Okoro duwi gɛtɛ bɩtà fɔ baà sere fɔ, ɛkɩ ɛn ma Isareli bɛkpàlɛ fɔ baanɩ, gɛtɛ è de edon abɛɛ gɩtà fɩya ma Sawulo ma wobi Yonatan.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatan ɛ tà bɩtà ma Filisiti bete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ dikpen dɩkɩ bɛ ma to osele gɛtɛ wʋ̀ dɔ wʋʋ fɔrɔ Mikimasi fɔ waanɩ be yela.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ Sawulo wobi Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsaranyan gɛtɛ è tola wakpanyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà kààrà tɩ san Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ baasarakʋn ofèn lɛ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Yonatan ɛn dɔ̀ wote.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Fɔ Sawulo è si Gibeya ditele diitunu pomegraniti woyon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Migron fɔ wʋʋ gatɩn. Fɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn bisiyee (600) bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Ahitubi wobi Ahiya gɛtɛ è di Ikabodi wonobi fɔ ɛ̀ sa gɛgba tinlɛ diboro gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma Sawulo. Ahitubi è di gɛ Finehasi wobi, gɛ Finehasi wote n di Eli, gɛtɛ è di Yahwe gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Silo ditele daanɩ fɔ. Mɔ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nyɩnla alɛ Yonatan e kpe e ye.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Osele gɛtɛ Yonatan ɛ ka è de ɛ ma gyu Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ, ɛɛ̀ da ma ɔkʋn mɔmɔkyɩ gɛtɛ ataa anyɔɔ ofèn ɩ̀ sa ma ofèn fɔ. Bee kpèlè dɩkɩ alɛ Bosesi, gɛ dido fɔ mɔ alɛ Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Dɩtaa fɔ dɩkɩ dì yela gatala gɩɩ gɩlan san ma Mikimasi gɩlan, gɛ dido mɔ dì yela gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan san ma Geba gɩlan.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ wɔsaranyan gɛtɛ è tola wakpanyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà kààrà tɩ san bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ ben belen bɩsan fɔ baakʋn. Nkɩfɔ, Yahwe eè yela tɩɩ gama. Gɩnyankɩ gɩn ma gɛtɛ gaà talɩ gɩ sʋ Yahwe osele ɛ̀ɛ̀ yɛ tɩ taà di boo koro, wʋn fɛ alɛ tɩ sɔ abɛɛ tɩn sɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Gɛ wɔsaranyan fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan,&lt;&lt;Mɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa aa duyu daanɩ. San bʋnʋn, ǹ de miinturu powu ǹ tɛrɛma wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba taà kààrà tɩ san bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn, fɔ taà yɛ bɛ bàà we tɩ. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Gɛ gengyi gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ tɩ alan, &lt;I yela dʋkɔ taà bɛ tama yɩ fɔ&gt;, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ, taà yela ɔkʋn gɛtɛ tì yela fɔ gɛtɛ tɩn nan san baakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Mɔ gengyi bɛ̀ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Ɩ bʋn ɩ ba taakʋn&gt; fɔ, ɛwʋ fɔ, taà bʋn tɩ san, yema ɛwʋ ǹ te wùlà alɛ, Yahwe e tiri bɛ ɛ tɛ tɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Okoro bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ be tiri koro be wùlà Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ, gɛ Filisiti bete fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya, Hebre bete fɔ be ye baafwe gɛtɛ be bu yaanɩ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Gɛ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kpen be kpèlè Yonatan ma wɔsaranyan gɛtɛ è tola waakpanyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ bʋn ɩ ba taakʋn, fɔ taà wùlà yɩ gɩnyan-kpara gɩkɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ wakpanyan yiitolalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bʋn tɛrɛma mɩ, yema Yahwe ɛ ka bɛ ɛ sa Isareli bete baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ ŋwalan ma walɔ ma wɔ bɩsɩrɩ ɛ bʋn, gɛ wakpanyan yiitolalɛ fɔ ɛ nyɩma wɔ. Gɛ Yonatan ɛ gbɛrɛ-gbɛrɛ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛkɩ e wolo, gɛ wakpanyan yiitolalɛ fɔ mɔ e wolo ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Akpa-gyangbasɛlɛ fɔ yaanɩ fɔ, Yonatan ma wakpanyan yiitolalɛ fɔ be wolo bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ dikpilin gɛtɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gaà mɛ ɩŋʋʋ nɩyɛ silin.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isareli e di Filisiti bete boo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Okoro gɩsaa gi gyu Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu. Ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa asarakʋn-dɩrɛ ma dɩfa daanɩ ma asarakʋnbi ma bekpilalɛ anyan fɔ powu be gyu gɩsaa. Gɛtʋnkwaa gi kpenti. Gɩsaa-dɩrɛ nyagɩ gi ye gɛ Wurubwarɛ wakʋn.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Sawulo bɛnɩ-dɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Gibeya fɔ be fi bɛ nya gɛ be we Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bee serenti bɛ yasɩ. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ sa wakʋn fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ kalan, taà nya alɛ, ɛnyan mɩnɩ ma taanɩ.&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ bɛ kalan fɔ, Yonatan ma wakpanyan yiitolalɛ fɔ mɩnɩ ma baanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Ahiya alan, &lt;&lt;Ka Wurubwarɛ Dikola dɩɩ dɩdaka fɔ ba.&gt;&gt; (Ɔkʋna wʋtɔkɔ fɔ Wurubwarɛ Dɩdaka fɔ dɩ̀ sa Isareli bete baakʋn) <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ma gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ, Filisiti bete bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ wuu gyu gidi-gidi wʋ fɩya. Okoro Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Oke! Tiri aa gʋlɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ma wɔ bɛnɩ be tuma, gɛ bɛ da bɩtà fɔ baanɩ. Be we Filisiti bete fɔ bɛ̀ sa getutu gaanɩ gɛ bè de bedon bee wolo-wolo bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Hebre bete gɛtɛ nafɔ bɛ̀ fɩya ma Filisiti bete gɛ bɛɛ tɩ kpà, bɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ, be biri bɛ ma fɩya ma Isareli bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Sawulo ma Yonatan baakʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Gɛlɛ ke gɛ gɛtɛ Isareli bete gɛtɛ be ma bu Efarim wodon waanɩ bɛ nʋn alɛ Filisiti bete bee serenti fɔ, ɛbɛ mɔ bɛ gbɛrɛ be gyu akpa fɔ yaanɩ bɛ kpa bɛ gyaga Filisiti bete fɔ boo koro. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Okoro Yahwe e to Isareli bete ɛ ya duwi dɩtɔkɔ. Gɛ akpa fɔ ɩ kààrà ɩ san Beti-Afen.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatan e di ɛŋɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ, Isareli bete bɛ fana bɛ kààrà, yema Sawulo ɛ fʋrʋma kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Baà fwala ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè di anyandilɛ pɛ ɔgyɔlɔ wàà nɩma nan le mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ gutunkoro pɛ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn dɩya anyandilɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu be gyu gɩkan gaanɩ, gɛ be we ɛŋɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Gɛtɛ be gyu gɩkan fɔ gaanɩ fɔ, be we ɛŋɔɔ ɛɛ kyasɩ ɛ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa. Mɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn ka gʋlɔ kya wɔ alɛ ee di, yema bè serenti ntam gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ kan fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Mɔ Yonatan ɛn nʋn ntam gɛtɛ wote ɛ kan e tin bɛnɩ fɔ. Okoro ɛ ka oyon gɛtɛ è de wɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ fɔ gɛ ɛ nyɩ ɛ sa ɛŋɔɔ dɩfʋgʋlʋn daanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka ɛ sa wonyun, gɛ wɔ bʋnʋn bʋ ŋmaŋɩ wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aate ɛ kan ntam ɛ sʋ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;Gɛfwala gaà ba ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ eè di anyandilɛ ǹdò fɔ wo koro.&gt; Okoro nyawʋ wʋ yɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛɛ nʋ̀n agbalɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte ɛ ka dɩyɩyɛ ɛ ba gɩfɩɩ fɔ gaanɩ. Nya anlɛ gɛtɛ mɩɩn bʋnʋn bʋ ŋmaŋɩ mɩ, gɛtɛ na dɩya ɛŋɔɔ fɔ pɩɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Gengyi nafɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nyabɛ powu bɛ daà di anyan gɛtɛ be gye bɩtà baanɩ lɛ fɔ, nafɔ bɛn daà belen Filisiti bete nyabɛ ayu kpekpesi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ, gɛtɛ Isareli bete be wolo Filisiti bete, ye Mikimasi ma sere Ayalon be were fɔ, bɛ fana bɛ kààrà. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Be firingi be gyu Filisiti bete baanyan yii gekukuru. Be gye bɛyɛran, ma bɛkwɔ, ma akwɔbi be wolo bɛ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ ben belen bɛ ayu nkalan ɛ̀ɛ̀ kyasɩ, gɛ bɛ kɔrɔ bɛ gɛlɛ. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ ma dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, bɛnɩ fɔ bɛɛ mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn. Bɛ kɔrɔ bɛnan gɛtɛ ben belen bɛ ayu fɔ bɔɔ gɩnan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ mɛ giten-kɛma. I bilima dɩtaa-dɩrɛ ɩ tɛ mɩ nfan bilenten!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san ɩ ma dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;ɛnɩ-kamasɛ ɛ ka wɔkwɔ, ma wɔyɛran ɛ ba nfan, èè be wolo wɔ nfan fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ kɔrɔ wɔ nfan. Ɩ kara mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe wo koro gɛtɛ yàà kɔrɔ bɛnan gɛtɛ ben belen bɛ ayu fɔ bɔɔ gɩnan.&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Okoro bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu bɛ ka bɔɔkwɔ-teni bɛ ba odente wʋtɔkɔ be be wolo dʋkɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e sere gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn ɛ tɛ Yahwe. Nyawʋ n di gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn-gyangbasɛ gɛtɛ e sere.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà waran tɩ san Filisiti bete fɔ baakʋn odente nyawʋ, fɔ taà kpila baanyan, gɛ tɩn nan kere baanɩ ɛkɩ tɩ ya ɛ̀ɛ̀ sara nkpa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Gɛ Isareli bete fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ gɩnyan gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Mɔ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ yɛ taà lila Wurubwarɛ pɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Gɛ Sawulo e lila Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ waran ǹ san n ma kpà ma Filisiti bete fɔ? Aà ka bɛ a sa Isareli bete bɔɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ?&gt;&gt; Mɔ Wurubwarɛ en tiri wuunyun tɛ wɔ duwi dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ bɩtà buu begyegeyelɛ fɔ powu ɩ ba nfan. Ɩ yɛ taà nya ade-kpen kitii gɛtɛ tɩ mɛ ǹdò. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ e to Isareli ɛ ya fɔ alan, gengyi gɛ miinbi Yonatan gba na mɛ ade-kpen fɔ, wù di gɛtɛ èè ku.&gt;&gt; Mɔ bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn dɔ̀ digyebi.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bete fɔ powu alan, &lt;&lt;I yela ofèn lɛ, fɔ nmɩ ma miinbi Yonatan mɔ taà yela ofèn nfan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ wʋ̀ kɔlɔ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Gɛ Sawulo e tiri onyun ɛ tɛ Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri ade yiinyun tɛ mɩ gepe.&gt;&gt; Anʋn yii koro gɛ an tiri maade-lilalɛ fɔ yiinyun tɛ mɩ ǹdò? Gengyi wù di gɛ nmɩ abɛɛ miinbi Yonatan na mɛ ade-kpen fɔ, Urim e tiri e wùlà. Mɔ gengyi wù di gɛ Isareli bɛnɩ fɔ baakʋn gɛ wu ye fɔ, Tumim e tiri e wùlà. Mɔ wu gye Yonatan ma Sawulo. Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be ye ade fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri ɛtɩ ma Yonatan tii getite!&gt;&gt; Gɛ wʋ Tiri Yonatan.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Gɛ Sawulo e lila Yonatan alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ mɩ ade-kpen gɛtɛ a mɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na ka miinyon gɛtɛ ǹ de fɔ wuunyun na kya ɛŋɔɔ pɩɩ na nʋnʋn. Okoro nan ku?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yonatan, gengyi an ku fɔ, Wurubwarɛ e tiira mɩ giten.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Gɛ Isareli bete fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Wun di gɛtɛ Yonatan èè ku! Kpakpaakpa! Ɛwɔ na kpà e to Isareli bete nkpa! Na nya Yahwe alɛ, wo diyungu-kɩlɩn gba dɩn nan nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa, yema Yahwe na kpà wɔ gɛ ɛ mɛ gʋtʋn nyagɩ ǹdò lɛ.&gt;&gt; Okoro bɛnɩ fɔ be to Yonatan nkpa, okoro ben wolo wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ mɩnɩ tɛrɛma Filisiti bete fɔ, gɛ Filisiti bete fɔ bɛ da boo geyekʋn.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e di bugyu Isareli fɔ, ɛ kpà ma bɔɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ powu ɔkʋn-kamasɛ. Ɛ kpà ma Moba bete, ma Amon bete, ma Edom bete, ma Soba begyu-dɩrɛ, ma Filisiti bete. Ɔkʋn-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ san fɔ, ee di boo koro. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Sawulo ɛ ka dɩkpatɩ ɛ kpà ma Amaleki bete gɛ e di boo koro, gɛ e to Isareli ɛ ya e ye Isareli bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ tà bɩtà ma ɛwɔ gɛ bee kpila waanyan fɔ baalɔ yaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawulo dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Sawulo bebi-tenibi n di Yonatan, ma Isiwi, ma Maliki-Suwa. Wobi-nanɩbi ɛndɩrɛ diyere n di Merabi, gɛ etiti fɔ wo diyere n di Mikali. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Sawulo wɔsɔ diyere n di Ahinoham gɛtɛ wote n di Ahimasa fɔ. Wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔdɩrɛ n di Abineri gɛtɛ è di Neri wobi fɔ, gɛ Sawulo woteti n di Neri nyawɔ. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Sawulo wote Kisi, ma Abineri wote Neri, bè di gɛ Abile bebi.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Sawulo wɔ nkpa wawi powu yaanɩ fɔ akpa-dɩrɛ na sara ɛbɛ ma Filisiti bete. Gengyi Sawulo è we eteni ɛkɩ ɛ̀ ba ɔkɛma gɛ è ba oturu fɔ, ɛɛ ka wɔ ɛ fɩya ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yahwe e terema Sawulo buugyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ gɛ Yahwe ɛ sa na sʋrʋ wɔ̀ bʋnɔ na sere bugyu na tɛ Isareli bete. Wuu koro nkele nʋn Yahwe wɔtʋn. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Ade gɛtɛ Yahwe-Kpatakpɩrɩ ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ n tɛ ba lɛ, &lt;Nan tiira Amaleki bete giten, yema ade gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ Isareli fɔ yii koro. Bɛn tɛ bɛ osele ɔya gɛtɛ be ye Egyipiti bɛɛ ba fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Okoro san ma kpà ma Amaleki bete, fɔ àà muru bɔɔ gɩnyankɩ-kamasɛ. Kara kere gɩnyankɩ ya. Wolo beteni ma bɛnanɩ, bebi ma bɛkyʋkyʋʋ, bɛkwɔ ma bɛyɛran, akpɔŋɔ ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Okoro Sawulo e kpèlè beteni fɔ e tuma, gɛ ɛ kalan bɛ Telami ditele daanɩ. Bɛ̀ ba bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ asepekyi fwo (200,000), ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ ɩgbaa ton gɛtɛ be ye Yuda wofoli waanɩ (10,000). <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ san bɛ ma bu gifoobi giikere gbɛma Amaleki bete boo ditele gɛtɛ bàà tà bɛ bɩtà. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Keni bete alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san, ɩ tɔ i ye Amaleki bete baanɩ, fɔ n kara be muru bɛ ma ɛyɩ powu, yema i tiri yɩɩ gɩnɩ-len i wùlà Isareli bete powu ɔkʋnan gɛtɛ be ye Egyipiti bɛ ba fɔ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Keni bete fɔ be tɔ be ye Amaleki bete fɔ baanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ tà bɩtà ma Amaleki bete fɔ, ye Awila wosele ma sere Suri, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Egyipiti wofila wʋʋ gɛtàkʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Sawulo e gye Amaleki bete boogyu Agagi gʋnʋn-ŋɔrɔ gɛ e wolo wɔ bɛnɩ powu. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Mɔ Sawulo ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be kere Agagi ma bɛyɛran-kpara ma bɛkwɔ-kpara, ma akwɔbi gɛtɛ ɩ̀ ba ayo, ma ayɛranbi, ma gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ gì di gɩnyan-kpara fɔ powu bɛ ya bɛ tɛ koro. Ben wolo yɩtɔkɔ. Mɔ anyan gɛtɛ ɩn ma tɔnɔ tɛ bɛ powu fɔ bɩrɛ, be muru yɩ.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yahwe ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Samweli alan, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />&lt;&lt;Na nu koro gɛtɛ na sɩ̀ Sawulo bugyu, yema e fi gama e ten mɩ gɛ ɛn taa di maade wùlàlɛ fɔ yii koro.&gt;&gt; Ade fɔ ɩ taga Samweli, gɛ e wula e kpèlè Yahwe odente wʋtɔkɔ powu.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩkpa gɛgyɩgyan-fuu fɔ Samweli ɛ lama ɛ tɔ ɛ san ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma tuma Sawulo. Mɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Sawulo ɛ da Kameli, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ e sere ataa ɛ ka e tiri wo koro diyere fɔ. Gɛ gɛtɛ e ye dʋkɔ fɔ, ɛ waran ɛ da Giligali ditele daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Gɛtɛ Samweli e gyu Sawulo wakʋn fɔ, Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e hira wɔ! Yahwe wade gɛtɛ ɛ sa mɩ fɔ gɛ na mɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Mɔ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛ anʋn yɩɩ bɛyɛran, ma bɛkwɔ boo gewula gɛ n tɛ nʋn maaten yaanɩ lɛ?<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sawulo e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ ka bɛ be ye Amaleki bete baakʋn. Be kere bɛyɛran-kpara, ma bɛkwɔ-kpara fɔ bɛ ya bàà ka tɛ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ gedi. Mɔ akurumakyɛɛ fɔ, ti muru yɩ powu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Kʋn! yɛ mɩ nan dɔ̀ wɔ̀ ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ walan odente.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Gɛ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Dɔ̀ mɩ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ma gɛtɛ nafɔ aa nya aa koro alɛ an di ɛnɩ gbaa gba fɔ, nka awɔ gɛ Yahwe ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Isareli wo-ifoli fɔ? Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ̀ bʋnɔ, gɛ ɛ sɩ̀ wɔ̀ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ tɛ Isareli bete. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Gɛ Yahwe ɛ tɛ wɔ̀ gʋtʋn alan, &lt;San ma muru Amaleki bete gɛtɛ bɛ ba duyu-kɛma fɔ, tà bɩtà ma ɛbɛ ka ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ aà kpa bɛ powu.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ an bù Yahwe? Anʋn yii koro gɛ a ma kpila Amaleki bete baanyan-kpara fɔ, gɛ a mɛ ade-kpen Yahwe bʋnʋn anlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Na bù Yahwe, na mɛ gʋtʋn gɛtɛ ɛ sa mɩ fɔ. Na muru Amaleki fɔ powu gɛ na gye boogyu Agagi fɔ na ba. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Gengyi bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be gye Amaleki bete bɔɔ bɛyɛran, ma bɛkwɔ fɔ, bee len bàà ka tɛ gɛ Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ gedi Giligali nfan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Mɔ Samweli e tiri wuunyun alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">&lt;&lt;Yahwe ee len gekuma gii gedi, ma gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀-kurumakyɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ɛ da gɛtɛ bàà nʋn wakʋn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Gɛnʋn Wurubwarɛ wakʋn, gɩ̀ kɔlɔ da gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">gɛsɩ̀ giten, gɩ̀ kɔlɔ da gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Yema gɛtɔ-yela ɛkɩ wo koro, wù di ade-kpen anlɛ gɛsɔma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">gɛ giten-kɛma gì di ade-kpen anlɛ dikpen-sʋma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Yema gɛtɛ a terema Yahwe wade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">wuu koro, ɛwɔ mɔ e terema aa bugyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen. Na nʋ̀n Yahwe wo-ise ma wade-wùlàlɛ fɔ yii koro. Na serenti bɛnɩ fɔ, wuu koro gɛ na nʋn baakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Okoro ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ, ka maade-kpen kyɛ mɩ, fɔ àà fɩya ma nmɩ taà biri, fɔ nàn ma sʋma Yahwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Mɔ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan biri n san ma awɔ, yema a terema Yahwe wanyun-gyebi, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ e terema wɔ̀ gɛtɛ àà mɛ Isareli wogyu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Gɛtɛ Samweli e fi èè kpe ye fɔ, Sawulo e gye Samweli gɛgba wurukyaa fɔ giinyun, gɛ gɩ fɛɛran. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anlɛ gɛtɛ a gye mɩɩn gɛgba a fɛɛran lɛ gɛlɛ ke gɛ Yahwe ɛ fɛɛran bugyu fɔ e ye aa koro ǹdò, gɛ ɛ ka bʋ ɛ tɛ ɛnɩ-fon gɛtɛ ɛ̀ kɔlɔ da wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Nyɩnla alɛ, ɛwɔ gɛtɛ è di Isareli gingyebi fɔ, ɛn ta di didebila abɛɛ èè foma wamɩnlɛ. Yema en di gɛ ɛnɩ-nyalɛ gɛtɛ èè foma waamɩnlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Gɛ Sawulo e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen, mɔ n fɔ wɔ gɛ sa mɩ gingyebi mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ, ma Isareli bʋnʋn. Biri ba ma nmɩ fɔ nàn sʋma Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Okoro Samweli e biri ɛ tɛrɛma Sawulo, gɛ Sawulo ɛ sʋma Yahwe.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka Amaleki wogyu Agagi mɔma mɩ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:32">Gɛ Agagi ɛ ba wakʋn ma bʋnʋn bʋʋ gɛgyagakʋn, gɛ ɛɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ gɩsaa gɛtɛ nafɔ gì de wɔ alɛ eè ku fɔ, gɩ da.<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Mɔ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">&lt;&lt;Anlɛ gɛtɛ a ka aadon a wolo bɛnɩ kpekpesi gɛ wʋ yɛ bɛnanɩ bɛn mɩnɩ ma bebi fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">gɛlɛ ke gɛ aana mɔ, ɛn nan wura ebi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Gɛ Samweli e wolo Agagi Yahwe bʋnʋn Giligali ditele.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Samweli e biri ɛ da Rama ditele, gɛ Sawulo ɛ bʋn ɛ da wɔlɛ Gibeya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Samweli en mini we Sawulo kʋtʋma ɛ ka e ku, mɔ Sawulo wade ɩ taga Samweli gepepe. Gɛ wʋ taga Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ Sawulo egyu-dɩrɛ Isareli bete boo koro.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samweli ɛ sʋrʋ Dafidi bʋnʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Aà yɩyɛ a tɛ Sawulo ka ma sere ɔya mɔmɔ? Na terema gɛtɛ èè di bugyu Isareli. Nya, yɔla bʋnɔ aa diyela fɔ daanɩ fɔ àà kya osele. N tɛ sa wɔ̀ Betelem-te Yese wakʋn, yema na tiri wo bebi-tenibi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Mɔ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ nan talɩ n san? Sawulo ɛɛ̀ nʋn ade fɔ, gɛ eè wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka dɩkwɔ-tan-nanɩ fɩya, fɔ àà dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Na ba nan bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Fɩna gʋlɔ kpèlè Yese gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ fɔ gɩɩpɩ, fɔ nan wùlà wɔ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ aà mɛ. Wù di gɛtɛ àà sʋrʋ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ nan wùlà wɔ fɔ bʋnɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Samweli ɛ mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. Gɛtɛ ɛ ma gyu Betelem fɔ, koro gɩ gbɛrɛ ditele fɔ dɩɩ bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ma tuma wɔ fɔ. Gɛ be lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;A ba ɔsɛ waanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Samweli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, Na ba ɔsɛ waanɩ, na ba nan bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi. Ɩ kpa koro dɩdɩɩ, fɔ yàà ba tàà tɛ gedi.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Samweli ɛ kpa Yese ma wo bebi-tenibi dɩdɩɩ, gɛ e kpèlè bɛ ɛ ba gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀kʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Gɛtɛ be gyu gɛ Samweli e we Eliyaba fɔ, ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Gbagbaagba fɔ, nyawɔ gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Mɔ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Kara nya wɔmɩrɩ, abɛɛ wabo, yema na terema wɔ. Nmɩ Yahwe mɩn taa nya ade anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ nyalɛ bɛɛ nya fɔ, ɛnɩ nyalɛ ɛɛ nya gɛ koro-kpaba, mɔ Yahwe ɛɛ nya gɛ oturu waanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yese e kpèlè Abinadabi gɛ ɛ yɛ wɔ ɛ bɛ dama Samweli bʋnʋn. Mɔ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe en tiri nyawɔ mɔ ke.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Gɛ Yese ɛ yɛ Sama ɛ bɛ da, mɔ Samweli alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe en tiri nyawɔ mɔ ke.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese ɛ yɛ wo bebi-tenibi kwarankɩ fɔ bɛ bɛ dama Samweli bʋnʋn, mɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Yese alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe en tiri baanɩ ɛkɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Okoro Samweli e lila Yese alan, &lt;&lt;Aa bebi-tenibi fɔ powu bɛ lɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Wu kuruma etiti fɔ, mɔ ɛwɔ ɛɛ nya bɛyɛran boo koro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Yese alan, &lt;&lt;Sa ɛnɩ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma ka wɔ ɛ ba, yema tɩn nan waran tɩ sara, ma ye gɛtɛ èè bè gyu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Gɛ ɛ sa ɛnɩ ɛ ma ka wɔ ɛ ba. Ɛ̀ sɩna, gɛ wo koro kpaba gɩ̀ ba ɔmɩrɩ, gɛ e ye gɩsaranyan.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɔ fɔ àà sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ, yema ɛwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ ka bʋnɔ ma diyela fɔ e lù wɔ̀ duyu, wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ bɔɔ bʋnʋn baanɩ. Gɛ boo ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ, Yahwe wo Gifiye gɩ bɛ gyu Dafidi wanɩ ɔkɛma waanɩ. Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Samweli ɛ tɔ ɛ da Rama ditele daanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ sʋma Sawulo wo digyukpaara daanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Nkele Yahwe Gifiye gi ye Sawulo wanɩ, gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ gifiye-kpen gɩ bɛ nyanla wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Gɛ Sawulo wɔ bɛsaranyan bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ afiye-kpen osele gɛ ɩ bɛ ɩɩ nyanla wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Tiifonte yɛ tɩ taà ma bugiti ɛnɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɩ tà adʋlɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ. Ɛɛ̀ tɩ tà wʋ ɔya gɛtɛ afiye-kpen fɔ ɩ̀ ba aa koro fɔ, fɔ àà koro gàà nʋ̀n wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ma bugiti ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ nyɩ̀ adʋlɛ gɛtà gepepe, fɔ yàà ka wɔ ɩ mɔmɔ mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Wɔ bɛsaranyanbi fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, na we Betelem-te Yese wobi-tenibi fɔ ɛkɩ, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtà gepepe. Ɛ̀ ba oturu, gɛ è di bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ. Ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtabʋrʋ, gɛ e ye gɩsaranyan, gɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ sa bɛnɩ Yese akʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ aabi Dafidi, gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya bɛyɛran boo koro fɔ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba maakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Okoro Yese ɛ ka boroboro, ma wayɩn bʋkan, ma digbebibi ɛ gyaga dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ dii koro, gɛ e tiri wobi Dafidi osele ɛ da Sawulo wakʋn.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Dafidi ɛ ba Sawulo wakʋn, gɛ ɛ kya gʋtʋn gɩɩ gɛmɛ ɛ tɛ Sawulo. Sawulo e len Dafidi wade gepepe. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ bɛ mɛ wakpanyan yii betolalɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ sa Yese ɔtʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ sara mɩɩn dɩkpaara ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ mɩɩn saranyan, yema wade ii di mɩ gʋnʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Okoro ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ afiye-kpen gɛtɛ Wurubwarɛ ɛ tɛ osele fɔ ɩ̀ ba Sawulo wo koro fɔ, Dafidi ɛɛ tɩ ka adʋlɛ fɔ ɛ tà. Fɔ Sawulo wo koro gɩ nʋ̀n wɔ, fɔ afiye-kpen fɔ ɩ tɔ wo koro.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ma Goliyati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Filisiti bete bɛ kʋla bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ Soko gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yuda ditele fɔ bàà san akpa Be sere gɛsarakʋn Efesi-Damim, gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Soko ma Aseka boo getite fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sawulo ma Isareli bete be tuma gɛ bɛ sara Ela dɩtagba daanɩ, ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛɛ pɩna koro bàà ma kpà ma Filisiti bete fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Filisiti bete fɔ be to odon fɔ wʋkɩ, gɛ Isareli bete mɔ, be to odon fɔ wudo gɛ dɩtagba dɩ̀ dɔ̀ boo getite.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Ete ma abo-kɛmalɛ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Goliyati gɛ e ye Gati ditele fɔ, e duru e ye Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baanɩ ɛ ba. Ɛɛ̀ mɛ anlɛ meta besiyee (3m). <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />È tin gɩwɔrɔnyan sɩya gii dikoto wo duyu di koro, gɛ ɛ̀ sa gɩwɔrɔnyan sɩya bɩtà bʋʋ gɛgba gɛtɛ gɩɩ dʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ kilo akpilin anyɔɔ ma fwo kwarankɩ (57 kg). <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Gɛ wɔ bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ fɔ, ɛ̀ sa gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya giimini tinlɛ bɩsɩrɩ, gɛ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ gɩtʋrʋnyan gɩ̀ fara wɔ gama. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Gɛ wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan giitin wu we anlɛ oyon lɔlɛ ayan, gɛ wɔ gɩta giinyun wʋʋ gɩwɔrɔnyan gɩɩdʋrʋ waà mɛ anlɛ kilo kwarankɩ (7 kg). Gɛ wɔsaranyan gɛtɛ è de omini panpasan-sʋlɛ geben fɔ, è gyegeye wɔ bʋnʋn.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Goliyati e be yela, gɛ e kpen ɛ dɔ̀ Isareli bete alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ kyɛ i yela ii len yàà kpà? Min di gɛ Filisiti-te, gɛ ɛyɩ mɔ in di gɛ Sawulo bɛsaranyan? I tiri yaanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ waran be tuma mɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Gengyi ɛ̀ talɩ ɛ kpà ma nmɩ, gɛ è wolo mɩ fɔ, taà mɛ yɩɩ bɛdɩ̀. Mɔ gengyi gɛ nmɩ mɔ na di wokoro gɛ na wolo wɔ fɔ, ɛyɩ mɔ yaà mɛ tɩɩ bɛdɩ̀, gɛ yaà sʋma tɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Gɛ Filisiti-te fɔ ɛ nɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya n te fuli Isareli bete, okoro i tiri ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɩ tɛ mɩ fɔ ɛtɩ ma ɛwɔ taà kpà.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ma Isareli bete powu bɛ nʋn Filisiti-te fɔ wade nyayɩ fɔ, koro gi ku bɛ, gɛ gɩsaa gi gyu bɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Dafidi è di gɛ Efirata-te gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Yese, gɛ e ye Betelem Yuda gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ fɔ wobi. Yese ɛ̀ ba bebi-tenibi nɩyɛ, gɛ Sawulo wɔya waanɩ fɔ, Yese ɛ dan ditenikwaa. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Yese bebi-tenibi bɛndɩrɛ besiyee fɔ bɛ nyɩma Sawulo bɛ san bɩtà fɔ baanɩ. Ɛndɩrɛ fɔ n di Eliba, ɛnyɔɔfɛ fɔ ǹ di Abinadabi, gɛ esiyeefɛ fɔ ǹ di Sama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Dafidi n di getu-gɔnɔ, gɛ wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ besiyee fɔ bɛ tɛrɛma Sawulo. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Mɔ Dafidi ee ye Sawulo wakʋn ɛ san Betelem, ɛ ma nya wote bɛyɛran.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Awi akpilin anyɔɔ powu yaanɩ fɔ, Goliyati Filisiti-te fɔ ee be yela Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn gagyɩgyan ma ɔgyɔlɔ.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Duwi dɩkɩ, Yese ɛ dɔ̀ wobi-tenibi Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Kya koro fɔ àà ka afɩnaa sʋnlɛ mudu fwo ton, ma boroboro fwo nyayɩ san ma aadɩrɛ ɛbɛ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Ka ɛkwɔ dɩnyʋn dɩɩ wangasɩ fwo nyawʋ, san ma bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ bʋʋndɩrɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn ton (1,000) boo koro fɔ. Nya alɛ, aadɩrɛ ɛbɛ bè si gepe, fɔ àà to bɔɔ gɩnyankɩ bè wùlà mɩ gɛtɛ waà wùlà alɛ bè si gepe. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Sawulo ma aadɩrɛ ɛbɛ, ma Isareli bete powu bɛ̀ sa Ela dɩtagba daanɩ, bɛɛ kpà ma Filisiti bete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Dafidi ɛ tɔ kere-kpalɛ gagyɩgyan, gɛ e kere bɛyɛran fɔ ɛ ya ɛ sɩ̀ ɛnyalɛ ɛkɩ, gɛ ɛ ban waatola gɛ ɛ kya osele anlɛ gɛtɛ wote Yese ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. E ma gyu gɛsarakʋn fɔ ɔya gɛtɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛɛ fɔrɔ bɩtà fɔ baanɩ, gɛ bɛɛ gbɛrɛ bɩtà baafala. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, ma Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ, bɛ tɩyɛ bè yela ofèn ma ofèn gɛtɛ bàà kpà. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Dafidi e kere wanyan fɔ ɛ ya ɛ tɛ ɛwɔ gɛtɛ ɛɛ nya anyan yii koro fɔ, gɛ e serenti ɛ san ɔkʋn gɛtɛ bɛ tɩyɛ bè yela fɔ ɛ ma sa wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ onyun. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ma ɛbɛ fɔ, Filisiti-te Goliyati gɛtɛ e ye Gati gɛ ɛwɔ ǹ di Filisiti bete bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ fɔ, ɛ gbɛrɛ e ye wɔgba waanɩ ɛ ba bʋnʋn, gɛ e kpen ɛ dɔ̀ wade-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ ɛɛ tɩ dɔ̀ fɔ, gɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn.<verse eid="1SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete powu be we ete fɔ, be serenti be ye dʋkɔ ma gɩsaa-dɩrɛ.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Gɛ Isareli beteni fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ booko-booko alan, &lt;&lt;Ii we ete nyawɔ gɛtɛ ee ti ye ɛ ba lɛ? Ɛɛ bɛ dɔ̀ ade ɛ sa Isareli ahin. Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ ɛɛ̀ tɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ eè wolo wɔ fɔ, anyan ma ɔyɛ-kɛma, eè biri ɛ ka wobi-nanɩbi ɛ tɛ wɔ èè to gɩna, gɛ wote dɩkpaara mɔ, dɩn nan nɩ le lonpoo dɩ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila beteni gɛtɛ bè yela wakʋn fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ baà mɛ bɛ tɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ eè wolo Filisiti-te nyawɔ gɛ eè tiri ɩnɩnfa nyayɩ e ye Isareli wanɩ fɔ? Ɛnyan ǹ di Filisiti-te gɛtɛ ben kebi gɩsan lɛ gɛtɛ ee fuli Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Gɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be biri bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fʋrʋma bɛɛ dɔ̀ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ade gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ lɛ, ɛyɩ gɛ baà mɛ bɛ tɛ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ eè wolo wɔ fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Gɛtɛ wɔdɩrɛ Eliyaba ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛɛ tabʋrʋ ma bɛnɩ fɔ, woturu wʋ tɔ Dafidi wo koro, gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a waran a ba nfan? Gɛ ɛnyan gɛ a kere bɛyɛran bɛrɛɛ fɔ a ya a sì otonkuma fɔ waanɩ? N nyɩ̀ wɔ̀ ma aa dɩkyapara, ma oturu-kɛma gɛtɛ à ba, a ba àà bɛ nya gɛ akpa fɔ yiiko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ na mɛ? Nn mini wura n tabʋrʋ mɔ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ ni fi ɛ san ɛnɩ-fon wakʋn, gɛ e lila wɔ ade-kɩlɩn fɔ ke, gɛ ɛnɩ fɔ e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ tɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Bɛnɩ bɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, gɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Sawulo, gɛ Sawulo ɛ yɛ be kpèlè wɔ bɛ tɛ wɔ̀.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛkɩ woturu wʋ kara gbɛrɛ wɔ Filisiti-te nyawɔ wade-dɔ̀lɛ yii koro! Yema nmɩ, aasaranyan nan san nan ma kpà ma ɛwɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;An nan san a ma kpà ma Filisiti-te nyawɔ, yema à di gɛ ɛsaranyanbi, gɛ ɛwɔ è di bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ye sɩyɛɛ wɔ gɩsaranyan gaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Mɔ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ, aasaranyan n tɛ nya miinte bɛyɛran boo koro. Gɛ gengyi ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ abɛɛ etiti e be gye ɛyɛran ɛkɩ e ye bɛnan fɔ baanɩ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />ntɛ tɛrɛma wosele, fɔ na baba wɔ, fɔ na to ɛyɛran fɔ na ye wonyun waanɩ. Mɔ gengyi ɛ̀ tɔ e yela miin koro fɔ, nte gye wanu fɔ na gbɛrɛ wɔ na wolo. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Nmɩ, aasaranyan na wolo ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ ma etiti, gɛ Filisiti-te nyawɔ gɛtɛ ben belen gɩsan lɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ gɛ anlɛ baanɩ ɛkɩ, yema e fuli Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe, gɛtɛ e tiri mɩ e ye ɛdɩ̀rɛ̀ ma etiti baakɔlɔ yaanɩ fɔ, eè tiri mɩ e ye Filisiti-te nyawɔ wɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;San, Yahwe ɛ fɩya ma wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ ka waakpanyan ɛ sa Dafidi. Ɛ ka wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan-sɩya gɩɩ dikoto e tin wɔ, gɛ ɛ ka wakpa yɩɩ gɛgba ɛ sa wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ fara Sawulo wodon fɔ, gɛ ɛ sa aniya èè dugba bɩsɩrɩ, mɔ ɛn talɩ ɛ san, yema ɛn sa yɩ wàà marama wɔ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan talɩ n san ma nyayɩ, yema ɩn marama mɩ ma gɛsa.&gt;&gt; Okoro e tiri anyan fɔ ɛ sɩ̀. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ ka woyon-tonlɛ ɛ sa wɔ gʋlɔ, gɛ ɛ tasɩ ataa tɔlɩ-tɔlɩ ton getu gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ ka yɩ ɛ sa bɛnan bɔɔ bɛnyalɛ bɔɔ kyankoro wanɩ, fɔ è de ma wɔ taya wɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ, gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma gbɛma Filisiti-te fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Filisiti-te fɔ ɛ san ɛ gbɛma Dafidi, fɔ wɔ gɩwɔrɔnyan-dɩyɛlɛ koro giitolalɛ fɔ è gyegeye wɔ bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti-te fɔ e we Dafidi fɔ, e we gɛtɛ è di gɛ ɛsaranyan-bi-sɩya ma ɔmɩrɩ fɔ, en bù wɔ alɛ è di gɩnyankɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />E lila Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ ɛkpɛɛ, gɛ aa ba maakʋn ma oyon?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Filisiti-te fɔ ɛ ka wo bekpen fwala Dafidi. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Filisiti-te fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ba nfan, nan ka aa gɩnan n tɛ gatala gɩɩ bɛsɩsɩra ma dɩfa dɩɩ bɛnan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Filisiti-te fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ aa ba maakʋn ma edon, ma gɩtʋrʋnyan, ma gɩtà ma abo, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, n tɛ ba aakʋn Yahwe-kpatakpɩrɩ, Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ è di Isareli bɩtà bʋʋtalɛ, gɛtɛ a sa ɩnɩnfa fɔ diyere dii daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Ǹdò, Yahwe eè tiri wɔ ɛ tɛ mɩ, gɛ nan wolo wɔ̀, gɛ nan belen aa duyu. Ǹdò nan ka Filisiti bete bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ boo gikpena n tɛ gatala gɩɩ bɛsɩsɩra, ma gɛtʋnkwaa gɩɩ bɛnan, fɔ bɛnɩ powu bàà we alɛ, Wurubwarɛ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa Isareli. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Gɛ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ be tuma nfan fɔ baà we alɛ, nka ma edon abɛɛ gɩtʋrʋnyan gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ ka e to nkpa, yema akpa fɔ ì di gɛ Yahwe woyo, gɛ ɛɛ̀ ka ɛyɩ powu ɛ sa taalɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti-te fɔ e kpe ɛ gbɛma Dafidi ɛ̀ɛ̀ tà wɔ̀ bɩtà fɔ, Dafidi e serenti bilin e ma gyu akpa yɩɩ-ɩgba fɔ yaanɩ gɛtɛ èè tuma wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Dafidi ɛ sa gʋlɔ wɔ kyankoro anɩ, gɛ e tiri dɩtaa ɛ sa wɔ taya anɩ, gɛ ɛ tà wʋ ɛ fʋlɩ Filisiti-te fɔ gɛyɛ, gɛ dɩtaa fɔ dɩ nyɩ̀ di gyu wɔ gɛyɛ gaanɩ, gɛ e ye ɛ nʋ̀n e tin gɛtʋnkwaa.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ ka gɛ wɔ taya ma dɩtaa e di Filisiti-te fɔ wo koro, ma gɛtɛ en de edon gba fɔ, ɛ gbɛrɛ wɔ e wolo wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Dafidi e serenti ɛ ma yela Filisiti-te fɔ wo koro, gɛ e tiri Filisiti-te fɔ wodon e ye dɩfwa daanɩ, gɛ e kebi wɔ duyu. Gɛtɛ Filisiti bete be we gɛtɛ bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋtalɛ-dɩrɛ fɔ e ku fɔ, be fi gɛ be serenti.<verse eid="1SA 17:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Isareli ma Yuda bete fɔ be kpèn be yoli, gɛ bɛ kpà bɛ gyaga Filisiti bete fɔ boo koro gɛlɛɛ ma ye Gati watuma, ma Ekuron ditele diitunu. Gɛ Filisiti bɛnɩ gɛtɛ be wolo fɔ bɛ̀ fɩna ye Saarami wosele waanɩ ka ma ye Gati ma Ekuron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete be kere Filisiti bete boo geberema bɛ ya fɔ, be biri bɛ ba Filisiti bete fɔ bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gɛ be kpila baanyan-kpara powu. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Dafidi ɛ ka Filisiti-te fɔ duyu ɛ ba Yerusalem, gɛ ɛ ka Filisiti-te fɔ wakpanyan ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ dɩyan-kwo daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 17:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ ma tuma Filisiti-te fɔ, Sawulo ɛ nya wɔ, gɛ e lila wɔ bɩtà bʋʋtalɛ ɛndɩrɛ Abine alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan wobi n di ɛsaranyan nyawɔ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Abine e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu-kpara, na nya na tɛ wɔ alɛ, mɩn nyɩ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Bugiti ɛnɩ-kɩlɩn gɛtɛ è di ɛsaranyan-bi wote.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e wolo Filisiti-te fɔ e were gɛ e biri ɛ ba fɔ, Abine ɛ ka wɔ ɛ san egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo bʋnʋn, fɔ Dafidi ɛ̀ sangba è de Filisiti-te fɔ duyu.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Gɛ Sawulo e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛsaranyan ɛ nyan wobi gɛ à di?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte n di aasaranyan Yese gɛtɛ e ye Betelem fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo bʋnʋn bʋ sɩna Dafidi wo koro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ tabʋrʋ ma Sawulo e were fɔ, Dafidi wade ɩ kya Yonatan woturu, gɛ e len wade anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wo koro. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ Sawulo ɛ yɛ Dafidi ɛ wɔ wakʋn, gɛ ɛn mɩnɩ yɛ wɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san wote dɩkpaara. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ tà dikola ma Dafidi, yema e len wɔ anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wo koro. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yonatan e tiri wɔ gɛgba wurukyaa gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa fɔ ɛ tɛ Dafidi, fɩya ma wɔ gɛgba serelɛ, ma wɔ tata, ma wɔ gyangarɩ, ma wolilɛ.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ sa Dafidi alɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ, ɛɛ mɛ wʋ gepepe. Wuu koro Sawulo ɛ mɛ wɔ ɛndɩrɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu baanɩ. Gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ ii di bɛnɩ fɔ powu ma Sawulo wɔ bɛndɩrɛ gʋnʋn.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Dafidi e wolo Filisiti-te fɔ, gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be biri bɛɛ ba ditele fɔ, bɛnanɩ fɔ be gbɛrɛ be ye Isareli atele fɔ powu yaanɩ bè be tuma egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo ma ɩnʋn, ma gelèn, ma ɔsɛ wʋʋ-ɩnʋn, ma akyaka, ma adʋlɛ ɛbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Ɔya gɛtɛ bee lèn fɔ, bɛ nʋma ɔnʋn alan, &lt;&lt;Sawulo e wolo bɛnɩ nkpɩn ton-ton, gɛ Dafidi mɔ e wolo bɛnɩ ɩgbaa ton-ton.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ ka owurufa, yema ɔnʋn gɛtɛ bɛɛ nʋma fɔ wuu koro. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Be sila Dafidi alan, e wolo ɩgbaa ton-ton fɔ, gɛ nmɩ na wolo nkpɩn ton-ton. Anʋn na nɩ kuruma gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Gɛ boo ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ, Sawulo ɛ ka gʋnʋn-kyʋn ɛ gyaga Dafidi wo koro.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ yɛ afiye-kpen ɩ ba Sawulo wo koro ma ɔkɛma. Gɛ e gyu gɛtabʋrʋ wɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ, fɔ Dafidi ɛɛ ta adʋlɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ ta fɔ. Fɔ Sawulo è de gɩtʋrʋnyan ma gʋlɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e fun gɩsɩnta fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan sere Dafidi n marama ɔpɔrɩ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ Dafidi e ye waanɩ disere dɩnyɔɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Nkele Sawulo è serenti Dafidi, yema Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma Dafidi, mɔ Yahwe e kere Sawulo ɛ ya. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Sawulo e tiri Dafidi e ye wɔ dɩkpaara daanɩ, gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔ egyegeyelɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn ton boo koro. Gɛ Dafidi e gyegeye ma bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ bɛ da bɩtà baanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ mɛ fɔ, wʋʋ san gepepe wʋ tɛ wɔ, yema Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e we anlɛ gɛtɛ, ade ɩɩ san gepe ɩ tɛ Dafidi fɔ, e serenti wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Mɔ Isareli ma Yuda bete powu be len Dafidi wade, yema e gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn ɛ ka bɛ ɛ san bɩtà, gɛ e biri ma bɛ ɛ ba.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e to Sawulo wobi Mikali gɩna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya miinbi-nanɩbi ɛndɩrɛ Merabi. Nan ka wɔ n tɛ wɔ̀ àà to gɩna, awɔ bɛ sʋma mɩ ma aakɛma powu fɔ àà kpà Yahwe akpa fɔ.&gt;&gt; Fɔ Sawulo wamɩnlɛ ɩɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nmɩ, mɩn nan ka mɩɩn gʋlɔ n kya wɔ, mɔ Filisiti bete nan mɛ wʋʋ gʋtʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Mɔ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan n di mɩ? Gɛ ɛnyan n di mɩɩn bɛfʋrɩ, abɛɛ miinte dɩkpaara Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ, gɛtɛ nan mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ wolete?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Okoro gɛtɛ ɔya wʋ nɩma gɛtɛ Sawulo wobi Merabi ɛ̀ɛ̀ kpà Dafidi fɔ, bɛ ka wɔ bɛ tɛ Mehola-te Adirile gɩna.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Fɔ Sawulo wobi Mikali ee len Dafidi gepepe. Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo ade fɔ, wʋ mɛ wɔ ɔsɛ. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Sawulo ɛ mɛ wɔ dɩmɩnlɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Nan ka miinbi fɔ n tɛ wɔ, fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ anlɛ ɔdʋ-tenlɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ, fɔ èè wura nʋ̀n Filisiti bete bɔɔ gʋlɔ gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Nkele a biri a wura osele gɛtɛ àà biligi miinlote.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I kpèlè Dafidi gɩlan, fɔ yàà dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Nya, aade ɩ̀ ba egyu-dɩrɛ ɔmɩrɩ, gɛ wɔ bɛsaranyan powu bee len aade. Wuu koro wʋ kɔlɔ gɛtɛ àà mɛ wolote.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Gɛ Sawulo bɛndɩrɛ fɔ be biri bɛ tabʋrʋ ade fɔ bɛ tɛ Dafidi, gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ wù di gɛ onyun waanɩ gɛtɛ àà biligi egyu-dɩrɛ wolote? Nmɩ bɩrɛ, ǹ di gɛ eyenpu, gɛ bɛnɩ bɛn nyɩ̀ mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo bɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛn taa len getiri-koro gaanyan ɩkɩ fɩya ma Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɩsan baakpa-kpen akpilin ton, gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka le wɔ bɛkyʋnlɛ gutoro.&gt; &gt;&gt; Yema Sawulo ɛɛ mɛ dɩmɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛɛ̀ nʋ̀n Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Okoro gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi ade nyayɩ fɔ, wʋ mɛ wɔ ɔsɛ, gɛtɛ eè biligi egyu-dɩrɛ wolete. Pɛgɛ gɛ ɔya gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ sɩ̀ fɔ wàà nɩma fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Dafidi ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɛ san bɛ ma wolo Filisiti bete gɛkpɩn (200). Gɛ Dafidi ɛ ka bɔɔ bɩsan baakpa-kpen fɔ ɛ ma wùlà egyu-dɩrɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ e lila fɔ, fɔ èè wura biligi egyu-dɩrɛ wolote. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ ka wobi-nanɩbi Mikali ɛ tɛ wɔ gɩna. <verse eid="1SA 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e we alɛ, Yahwe ɛ̀ fɩya ma Dafidi, gɛ wobi-nanɩbi Mikali è len wɔ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Sawulo e biri e serenti Dafidi ɛ fɩya, gɛ Dafidi e biligi wɔkyʋnlɛ gakpaakpa.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ bee ti ye bɛ san bɩtà, mɔ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ san fɔ, Dafidi ee di boo koro gʋsɔ ɛ da Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ. Okoro Dafidi e di diyere gepepe.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo e len èè wolo Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wobi Yonatan ma bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ powu gɛtɛ bàà wolo Dafidi. Mɔ Yonatan ee len Dafidi wade gepepe. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Okoro Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Miinte Sawulo ee len osele gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka wolo wɔ̀, okoro dɩyɛ koro gɩsa gɛgyɩgyan. Ma bugiti gebukʋn gɩkɩ fɔ àà sara dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Nan san n ma yela miinte wakʋn oli waanɩ ɔkʋn gɛtɛ aà ma bu fɔ. Fɔ nan dɔ̀ aade n tɛ wɔ, gɛ gengyi ɛ̀ dɔ̀ ade ɩkɩ fɔ, nan biri n bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ ade-kpara ɛ dama Dafidi wo koro ɛ tɛ wote alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ egyu-dɩrɛ, kara mɛ aasaranyan Dafidi ade-kpen, yema ɛn mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen ɩkɩ. Ade gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ gba fɔ, wʋ kpà gɛ awɔ gepepe. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Yema ɛ ka wɔ nkpa ɛ sɩ̀, gɛ ɛ ma wolo Filisiti-te fɔ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛ yɛ Isareli powu e to koro, gɛ a we wʋ gɛ a di ɔsɛ. Anʋn yii koro gɛ aà mɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ anlɛ Dafidi ade-kpen fɔ àà wolo wɔ gɛtɛ ɛn nyɩ̀ ade ɩkɩ yaanɩ?<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sawulo ɛ nʋn Yonatan wakʋn gɛ ɛ kan ntam alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ è si nkpa lɛ alan, mɩ nan wolo Dafidi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Okoro Yonatan e kpèlè Dafidi, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ fɔ powu, gɛ Yonatan ɛ ka Dafidi ɛ ba Sawulo wakʋn. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ sʋma Sawulo anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ mɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Nyawʋ wʋʋ gama fɔ, be biri be wura akpa ma Filisiti bete fɔ. Gɛ Dafidi ɛ ka ɔkɛma-dɩrɛ ɛ kpà ma ɛbɛ gɛ wʋ yɛ be serenti bɛ da.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Mɔ Yahwe ɛ yɛ gifiye-kpen gɩ ba Sawulo wo koro gɛtɛ è si wɔ dɩkpaara gɛ wɔ giturunyan gɩ̀ sa wɔ gʋlɔ fɔ. Fɔ Dafidi ɛɛ tà adʋlɛ. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sawulo e fun gɩtà fɔ èè sere Dafidi marama ɔpɔrɩ, mɔ Dafidi ɛ waran e kura gɛ gɩtà fɔ gi ma sere ma ɔpɔrɩ. Gɛ Dafidi e serenti ɛ da odente wʋtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Sawulo ɛ sa bɛnɩ Dafidi dɩkpaara bàà ma dɩyɛ wɔ, fɔ bàà wolo wɔ koro-kpalɛ gagyɩgyan fuu. Mɔ Dafidi wɔsɔ Mikali ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi gɛ an serenti odente nyawʋ àà to aa nkpa fɔ, baà wolo wɔ̀ gɩsa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Mikali e tiri Dafidi e ye ma nfansɩrɩ, gɛ e serenti. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Mikali ɛ ka ekpen-salɩlɛ ɛ dʋrɔ difenge dii koro, gɛ ɛ ka dɩyan e tin wɔ, gɛ ɛ ka begbebi baanu e tin wo duyu.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ sa bɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ma gye Dafidi fɔ, Mikali ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ee yeba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e biri ɛ sa bɛnɩ Dafidi akʋn gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ san yàà ma ka wɔ ma wo difenge fɔ powu ɩ ba nfan fɔ nan wolo wɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Mɔ gɛtɛ bɛnɩ fɔ be gyu dikwo fɔ daanɩ fɔ, ekpen-salɩlɛ n dɔ difenge fɔ dii koro, gɛ begbebi baanu n tin wo duyu.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Gɛ Sawulo e lila Mikali alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a gban mɩ anlɛ, gɛ a tiri mɩɩnkyʋnlɛ osele gɛ a yɛ wɔ e serenti&gt;&gt; Gɛ Mikali e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;Yɛ mɩ nan serenti, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, nan wolo wɔ̀.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e serenti fɔ, ɛ san Samweli wakʋn Rama ditele, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ mɛ wɔ fɔ powu. Gɛ ɛwɔ ma Samweli bɛ san bɛ ma sara Nayito ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Gɛ wʋ ma nʋn Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛ̀ sa Nayito ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Rama fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ sa bɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ma gye Dafidi. Mɔ gɛtɛ bɛ ma gyu fɔ, be we Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ dikpi gɛtɛ bè yela bɛɛ tabʋrʋ Wurubwarɛ wade, fɔ Samweli è gyegeye bɔɔ bʋnʋn. Gɛ Wurubwarɛ Gifiye gɩ ba Sawulo bɛnɩ fɔ mɔ boo koro, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be gyu Wurubwarɛ ade yɩɩ gɛtabʋrʋ. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo ade gɛtɛ i sere fɔ, e biri ɛ sa bɛnɩ ɛ fɩya, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be ma gyu Wurubwarɛ ade fɔ yɩɩ gɛtabʋrʋ. Sawulo e biri ɛ sa bɛnɩ disere-siyeefɛ, gɛ ɛbɛ mɔ be gyu Wurubwarɛ ade yɩɩ gɛtabʋrʋ. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛwɔ gbagba ɛ san Rama, gɛ ɛ san ditiribun-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Seku fɔ dɩɩpɩ. Gɛ e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Gaanɩ gɛ Samweli ma Dafidi bɛ̀ sa?&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛkɩ e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, bɛ̀ sa Nayito gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Rama ditele fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ san Nayito gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Rama ditele daanɩ fɔ. Mɔ Wurubwarɛ Gifiye gɩ ba wo koro, gɛ ɛ kya Wurubwarɛ ade yɩɩ gɛtabʋrʋ gɛlɛɛ ma gyu Nayito. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Ɛ kʋrʋba wɔ ngba, gɛ ɛwɔ mɔ e gyu Wurubwarɛ ade yɩɩ gɛtabʋrʋ Samweli bʋnʋn. Ɛ dʋrʋ dibolonkwaa duwi fɔ powu ma wuudente. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ bɛnɩ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Sawulo mɔ ɛ̀ fɩya ma Wurubwarɛ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ma Yonatan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Dafidi e serenti e ye Nayito gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Rama fɔ gɛ ɛ san ɛ ma lila Yonatan alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ na mɛ? Ade-kpen mɔmɔ gɛ na mɛ? Anʋn yaade gɛ na mɛ aate, gɛ ee len èè wolo mɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yonatan e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa! aa nan ku. Nya, miinte ɛn taa mɛ gɩnyan-dɩrɛ gɩkɩ abɛɛ gɩnyan-pɩɩ gɩkɩ, gɛtɛ ɛn nan yɛ mɩ nan nyɩnla. Anʋn yii koro gɛ eè bubwa mɩ ade nyayɩ? Wʋn ma waanɩ gɛlɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Mɔ Dafidi ɛ kan ntam gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Aate ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ aa len maade gepepe, okoro ɛ mɛ dɩmɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt; Wun di gɛtɛ Yonatan ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyɩnla ade nyayɩ, nka gɛlɛ fɔ, dɩkpʋkpʋ daà be ton wɔ.&gt; Mɔ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɛ̀ sa nkpa gɛ awɔ mɔ à sa nkpa lɛ, nn mɩnɩ ma ɔfɔ ma diku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aa len nan mɛ fɔ, nan mɛ n tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Yonatan alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, gɩsa wù di gɛ ebon-fon wɔsɛ wuu gedi, gɛ wù di gɛtɛ nàn di ma egyu-dɩrɛ, mɔ yɛ mɩ nan ma bu dɩfa daanɩ ka ma sere gɩsarama ɔgyɔlɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Gengyi aate en we mɩ fɔ, dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Dafidi ɛ fɔ mɩ osele, alɛ eè serenti ɛ san wɔlɛ Betelem ditele, yema wofoli wʋʋ bɛnɩ powu bee di gɩkyan gɩɩsɛ.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Gengyi ɛ̀ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ&gt; fɔ, fɔ gɩnyankɩ gɩn nan mɛ nmɩ aasaranyan. Mɔ gengyi ɛ̀ ka owurufa fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ, nyɩnla alɛ, ɛ̀ nyɩ è len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ mɩ ade-kpen. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Okoro n fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ we mɩ gutunkoro, yema nmɩ ma awɔ tɩ tà dikola Yahwe bʋnʋn. Gengyi na di dɩpwɛ fɔ, awɔ gbagba wolo mɩ! Anʋn yii koro gɛ aà tiri mɩ a tɛ aate?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kpakpaakpa! Wʋʋn nan ba waanɩ wʋ nya! Gengyi gifiye bɛrɛɛ gba gɩ̀ gbɛrɛ mɩ alɛ miinte ee len èè wolo wɔ̀ fɔ, anʋn yii koro gɛ mɩn nan dɔ̀ wɔ̀?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila Yonatan alan, &lt;&lt;gengyi aate e tiri ade fɔ yiinyun ɛ tɛ wɔ owurufa waanɩ fɔ, lan gɛ nan mɛ gɛ nan nyɩnla?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Bà taà san dɩfa daanɩ!&gt;&gt; Gɛ bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ da dɩfa fɔ daanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ na tɛ wɔ alɛ, gɩsarama ɔya nyawʋ wʋʋkʋna fɔ, nan tabʋrʋ ma miinte. Gengyi ɛ̀ ba dɩmɩnlɛ-kpara tɛ wɔ̀ fɔ, nan yɛ wɔ̀ àà nyɩnla. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Mɔ gengyi ɛ̀ ba dɩmɩnlɛ-kpen aa koro gɛ mɩn yɛ wɔ̀ àà nyɩnla àà serenti fɔ, ɛwʋ bɩrɛ Yahwe ɛ gbɛrɛ mɩ e wolo. Yahwe ɛ sara ma awɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ sara ma miinte fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Mɔ gɛtɛ ǹ nyɩ̀ ǹ sì nkpa lɛ, boo len maade anlɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri gelen e len mɩ fɔ, fɔ aate ɛ kara bè wolo mɩ. <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Gengyi Yahwe eè wolo nmɩ Dafidi mɩɩn bɛkyʋnlɛ powu e ye gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ gba fɔ, kara yɛ gelen gɛtɛ à ba tɛ mɩɩn dɩkpaara fɔ, gàà lanla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yonatan ɛ tà dikola ma Dafidi dɩkpaara gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e le aa bɛkyʋnlɛ gutoro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Gɛ Yonatan e biri ɛ yɛ Dafidi ɛ kan ntam ɛ fɩya gɛtɛ ee len wɔ, yema ɛwɔ Yonatan mɔ ee len wɔ anlɛ ɛwɔ gbagba wo koro.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩsa wù di ebon-fon wɔsɛ wuu gedi, taà kʋna wɔ̀, yema aa gɛsarakʋn gaà mɛ gɛbɩya-kwaa. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Gɩsarama ɔgyɔlɔ san ma bù ɔkʋn gɛtɛ a daà ma bu ɔkʋna gɛtɛ ade nyayɩ i sere ɔpɩ fɔ, fɔ àà so ataa-tɩyɛlɛ fɔ yɩɩ gama. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Gɛ nan tà bɩsɩnta bisiyee n sa ofen dʋkɔ, anlɛ n tɛ tà nan sere gɛ gɩnyankɩ. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Fɔ nan sa ɛsaranyan ɛkɩ alan, &lt; San ma bugiti bɩsɩnta fɔ.&gt; Gengyi ǹ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;Bɩsɩnta fɔ bʋ̀ sa gɛ aafèn nyawʋ, ka bʋ ba nfan&gt; fɔ, wuu wùlà alɛ ade ɩkɩ ɩn ma, ye ba. Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ ade-kpen ɩkɩ ɩn ma. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Mɔ gengyi n dɔ̀ ɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;Nya, bɩsɩnta fɔ bɩ̀ kààrà bʋ da sɩyɛɛ ɔfɔ fɔ,&gt; ɛwʋ bɩrɛ, serenti yema Yahwe e tiri wɔ̀ osele. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Gɛ ade gɛtɛ ɛtɩ ma awɔ tɩ tabʋrʋ fɔ, kʋna gɛtɛ Yahwe n di taadansɛ gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Dafidi ɛ ma bu dɩfa fɔ daanɩ, gɛ ɔya gɛtɛ ebon-fon wɔsɛ wuu gedi wʋ̀ nɩma fɔ, egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo ɛ ma sara gɛ e di. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Ɛ sara wɔ gɛbɩya gii koro anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ̀ fʋrʋma ɛɛ sara ɔya-kamasɛ ɛ marama ɔpɔrɩ fɔ, Yonatan è si wofèn, gɛ Abine è si Sawulo wɔ bɩlan baanɩ, mɔ Dafidi gɛsarakʋn bɩrɛ gɩ̀ dɔ̀ gɛbɩya-kwaa. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Mɔ Sawulo ɛn dɔ̀ ade ɩkɩ duwi dɩtɔkɔ, yema ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alɛ, &lt;&lt;nkɩfɔ anlɛ gɩnyankɩ na sa Dafidi dɩdɩɩ, gbagbaagba fɔ e gyu dɩdɩɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Mɔ ebon fɔ duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ, Dafidi gɛsarakʋn gɩ̀ sangba gɩ̀ dɔ gɛlɛ. Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e lila Yonatan alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ Yese wobi fɔ ɛn ba gedi walan ma ǹdò?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatan e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛ fɔ mɩ osele gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san Betelem ditele daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Yɛ mɩ nan san, yema tɩɩ dɩkpaara dɩɩ tɛ gedi ditele-dɩrɛ daanɩ, gɛ mɩɩndɩrɛ ɛɛ nyɩ mɩ gɛtɛ nan sara dʋkɔ. Okoro we mɩ gutunkoro fɔ àà tiri mɩ osele nan ma we mɩɩndɩrɛ ɛbɛ.&gt; Nyawʋ wuu koro gɛ ɛn talɩ ɛ ba egyu-dɩrɛ gedikʋn gɩɩkpʋlɔ fɔ wʋʋpɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Gɛ Sawulo woturu wʋ tɔ Yonatan wo koro, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnanɩ giten-kɛma, ma oturu-dʋrʋ wobi! À nyɩ̀ alɛ mɩn nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ a mɛ onyun ma Yese wobi, gɛtɛ wù di awɔ gbagba ma aana gɛtɛ e wo wɔ̀ fɔ yɩɩnɩnfa? <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />An nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ Yese wobi nyawɔ è si nkpa fɔ an nan talɩ a di bugyu gɛtʋnkwaa nyagɩ gaanɩ? Okoro sa bàà ma ka wɔ mɔma mɩ, yema wù di gɛtɛ èè ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Gɛ Yonatan e lila wote alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ baà wolo wɔ? Anʋn gɛ ɛ mɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Mɔ Sawulo e fun wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan èè sere wɔ wolo. Gɛ Yonatan e we ɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ wote ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ee len gɛtɛ èè wolo Dafidi gɛ.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yonatan ɛ ka owurufa-dɩrɛ ɛ tɔ e ye gedikʋn fɔ gɩɩpɩ. Gɛ ebon fɔ duwi-nyɔɔfɛ dɩtɔkɔ daanɩ fɔ, e terema en di anyandilɛ, yema wote ade gɛtɛ ɛɛ mɛ Dafidi fɔ wʋ sa wɔ ɩnɩnfa.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Kere-kpalɛ gagyɩgyan fɔ, Yonatan ɛ ka ɛsaranyanbi ɛkɩ ɛ tɛrɛma koro gɛ ɛ san dɩfa fɔ daanɩ, ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma tuma Dafidi. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Serenti san ma bugiti bɩtà gɛtɛ na tà fɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ e serenti ɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ, Yonatan ɛ tà gɩtà ɛ kààrà wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Gɛtɛ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ ɛ nɩma ɔkʋn gɛtɛ gɩtà fɔ gɩ nʋn fɔ, Yonatan e kpen ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɩtà fɔ gɩ̀ dɔ̀ bʋnʋn!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Gɛ e kpen ɛ dɔ̀ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kya koro! San belen-belen! Kara yela!&gt;&gt; Ɛsaranyanbi fɔ ɛ ka gɩtà fɔ, gɛ e biri ɛ ba wofonte wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Mɔ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ ɛn nyɩnla ade gɛtɛ wuu wùlà. Yonatan ma Dafidi booko n nyɩ̀. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Yonatan ɛ ka waakpanyan ɛ tɛ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ, gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San, birima yɩ san ditele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Gɛtɛ ɛsaranyanbi fɔ ɛ da e were fɔ, Dafidi ɛ tɔ e ye ataa-tɩyɛlɛ fɔ yɩɩ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan, gɛ ɛ waran e kura ɛ ka bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa Yonatan bʋnʋn disere disiyee. Ɛwʋ gɛ be mù bɛwɔlɔn, gɛ be wula, mɔ Dafidi na wula gʋsɔ.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Gɛ Yonatan ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;San olila waanɩ yema ɛtɩ ma awɔ tɩ kan ntam Yahwe diyere daanɩ, tɩ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Yahwe ǹ te di ɛtɩ ma awɔ adansɛ, ma aadu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ ma miindu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ boo getite gakpaakpa.&gt; &gt;&gt; Dʋkɔ gɛ Dafidi ɛ da, gɛ Yonatan mɔ e biri ɛ ba ditele.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e serenti e ye Sawulo wakʋn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Dafidi ɛ san gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Ahimeleki wakʋn Nobi ditele daanɩ. Gɛtɛ Ahimeleki e we wɔ fɔ, gɩsaa gɩ ton wɔ gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ à san aako? Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn fɩya ma awɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Dafidi e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ Ahimeleki alan, &lt;&lt;Egyu ɛ sa mɩ gʋtʋn gɩkɩ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alan, &lt;Wun di gɛtɛ àà yɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ nyɩnla gʋtʋn gɛtɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ lɛ.&gt; Mɔ mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɩrɛ, na dɔ̀ bɛ alɛ be tuma mɩ ɔkankɩ. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Nkele anyan-dɩlɛ mɔmɔ gɛ à ba? Tɛ mɩ boroboro ton abɛɛ gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ à ba fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Mɔ gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ ma anyan-dɩlɛ tuntun ɩkɩ maakʋn, mɔ boroboro gɛtɛ bè gye bɛɛ tɛ gedi wuuko n sa. Gengyi bɛn dʋrɔ ma ɛna bɩrɛ fɔ bɛ̀ talɩ be be di.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Gɛ Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;Ɩɩn bɛnanɩ ben taà gbɛma tɩ ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ n tɛ fɔrɔ gʋtʋn tuntun gba fɔ, wàà ba yɛ ǹdò wuuyo nyawʋ.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Okoro gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ ɛ tɛ Dafidi Wurubwarɛ wo boroboro gɛtɛ nafɔ osele wʋn dɔ tɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ èè di fɔ, yema boroboro ɛkɩ ɛ mɩnɩ ma fɩya ma boroboro gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ tɛ Yahwe gedi fɔ, gɛ bɛ ka boroboro yalɛ bɛ sɩ̀ wʋʋ didin duwi dɩtɔkɔ gɛtɛ bɛ ka wʋ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ fɔ, Sawulo, bɛnan bɔɔ bɛnyalɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Dohegi, gɛ e ye Edom fɔ ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ bɛ, yema ee len ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ Yahwe gelen-bi duwi dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Dafidi e lila Ahimeleki alan, &lt;&lt;À ma gɩtʋrʋnyan abɛɛ tata nfan? Mɩɩn ka mɩɩn tata abɛɛ maakpanyan yaanɩ wʋkɩ ba, yema egyu-dɩrɛ gʋtʋn fɔ gɩ yɛ mɩ na kutuma na kere mɩɩn tata ma maakpanyan na ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ fɔ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Filisiti-te Goliyati gɛtɛ a wolo Ela dɩtagba daanɩ fɔ wodon ɛ̀ sa nfan, wʋ̀ ban ma dɩyan wʋ̀ sa gɛgba tinlɛ diboro gɩɩ fɔ gɩɩ gama. Gengyi à len wʋ fɔ, à talɩ a ka, yema edon ɛkɩ ɛɛn mɩnɩ ma nfan.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Edon ɛkɩ ɛn mɩnɩ ma nyawʋ gama, ka wʋ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e serenti ɛ san Gati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Duwi dɩtɔkɔ Dafidi e serenti e ye Sawulo wakʋn gɛ ɛ san Gati wogyu Akisi wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Mɔ Akisi bɛsaranyan bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka Dafidi nyawɔ n di gɛtʋnkwaa giigyu? Nka ɛwɔ gɛ bɛɛ nʋma ɩ nʋn boo gelen gaanɩ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;Sawulo e wolo bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn mɔ Dafidi e wolo gbaa ton fɔ?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Dafidi e gyu ade nyayɩ ɛ sa woturu waanɩ gɛ e serenti Gati wogyu Akisi gepepe. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro, Dafidi ɛ mɛ anlɛ e di gɛ ɛbalanɩ. Ɛɛ ŋwara ɩpʋnʋ wuu koro gɛ ɛ yɛ atɩtan ɩ waran wɔ ma wo bikpri.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Gɛ Akisi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ nya ete fɔ, è di gɛ ɛbalanɩ. Gɛ anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ ka wɔ ɩ ba maakʋn? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Bɛbalanɩ be were mɩ, okoro gɛ i birima nyawɔ ɩ bɛ mɔma nmɩ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ ɩ ka ɛnɩ nyawɔ wodu ɩ ba mɩɩn dɩkpaara?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ baaku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Dafidi e serenti e ye Gati ditele gɛ ɛ ma bu dɩtaa-fwe gɛtɛ dɩ̀ gbɛma Adulam ditele fɔ daanɩ. Gɛtɛ wɔdɩrɛ ɛbɛ ma wote dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛ nʋn gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ fɔ, bɛ waran bɛ san wakʋn dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Gɛ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dɩyɩyɛ daanɩ, abɛɛ bè de atoro, abɛɛ ade ɩn sara ma ɛbɛ fɔ powu be be tuma wakʋn dʋkɔbɛ, gɛ Dafidi ɛ bɛ mɛ boogyegeyelɛ. Bɛnɩ fɔ baà mɛ anlɛ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ sara ma ɛwɔ dʋkɔbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e ye dʋkɔbɛ fɔ, ɛ da Misipa ditele gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa Mohabi gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Mohabi wogyu alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ fɔ wɔ̀ gɛ aà yera miinte ma mɩɩna ɛbɛ baà bɛ sara aakʋn ka ma sere ɔya gɛtɛ nan we ade gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ mɛ ɛ tɛ mɩ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ ka wote ma wɔna ɛ sɩ̀ Mohabi wogyu, gɛ bɛ sara dʋkɔbɛ ye ɔya powu gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa gebukʋn fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Mɔ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ Gadi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara sara gebukʋn nfan, tɔ san Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.&gt;&gt; Okoro Dafidi e ye dʋkɔbɛ gɛ ɛ da Hereti gɩkan gaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawulo e wolo Nobi gedi gɩɩtɛ̀lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Duwi dɩkɩ Sawulo ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ be we Defidi ma bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ fɩya ma ɛwɔ fɔ. Fɔ è si Tamarisiki woyon wʋʋ gatɩn, Gibeya wodon wuu koro gɛ è de wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan, gɛ wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ be yela be silin wɔ be tuma. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛyɩ Benyamin bɛnɩ ɩ nʋn, Ɩ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ Yese wobi Dafidi ɛɛ̀ tɛ yɩ ili ma wayɩn wo-ili powu? Abɛɛ ɩ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ ɛɛ̀ sɩ̀ yɩ bɩndɩrɛ ɛ tɛ bɛnɩ nkpɩn ton, ma bɛnɩ akpilin ton? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ ɛyɩ powu ɩ mɛ onyun miin koro? Gɛ ɛkɩ ɛn talɩ ɛ dɔ̀ mɩ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ nmɩ gbagba miinbi ɛ tà dikola ma Yese wobi fɔ. Yaanɩ ɛkɩ ɛn fɛ ma nmɩ gba abɛɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ miinbi ɛ yɛ mɩɩnsaranyan ɛ tɔ e yela miin koro gɛ ee bugiti osele èè tiri mɩ ye dʋkɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ wù we ǹdò lɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Mɔ Dowegi, Edomi-te gɛtɛ è yela ma Sawulo bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Na we Yese wobi fɔ gɛtɛ ɛɛ fɔrɔ Ahitubi wobi Ahimeleki gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa Nobi fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimeleki e lila Yahwe anlɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛɛ̀ mɛ, gɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ anyandilɛ ma Filisiti-te Goliyati wɔ tata fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Okoro Sawulo ɛ sa bɛnɩ Ahitubi wobi Ahimeleki ma wote dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bè di Nobi gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ baakʋn. Gɛ ɛbɛ powu bɛ ba Sawulo wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ahitubi wobi, nʋ̀n.&gt;&gt; Gɛ e yera wɔ alan, yoo! Miinfonte. <verse eid="1SA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sawulo e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ a wɔ ma Yese wobi ɩ mɛ onyun miin koro gɛ a tɛ wɔ boroboro, ma tata gɛ a biri a lila Yahwe gelenbi a tɛ wɔ, gɛ wʋ yɛ wɔ ɛ tɔ e yela miin koro gɛ ee bugiti osele èè tiri mɩ ye waanɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ mɛ ǹdò lɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Ahimeleki e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ egyu-dɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Aa bɛsaranyan powu baanɩ fɔ, ɛ mɔmɔ ǹ ba nʋnkwarɩ anlɛ Dafidi gɛtɛ è di awɔ gbagba aalote gɛ è di aa bɛdɩyɛlɛ bɔɔdɩrɛ, gɛ ɛ̀ ba gebu-dɩrɛ aa dɩkpaara daanɩ? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Okoro duwi dɩtɔkɔ n di dɩgyangbasɛlɛ gɛtɛ na lila Yahwe gelenbi na tɛ wɔ? Kpakpaakpa! Egyu kara ka ade gyaga nmɩ aasaranyan miin koro abɛɛ miinte dɩkpaara dɩɩnɩ ɛkɩ wokoro. Yema nmɩ aasaranyan mɩɩn nyɩ̀ ade ɩkɩ kadama gɛlɛ gaade nyayɩ yii koro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Mɔ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ahimeleki, awɔ ma aate dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu yaà nyɩ̀ i ku.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Okoro egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛdɩyɛlɛ gɛtɛ bè yela dʋkɔ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;I wolo Yahwe gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ, yema ɛbɛ mɔ be yela Dafidi gama. Ma gɛtɛ bɛ̀ nyɩ̀ alɛ ee serenti gba fɔ, bɛn dɔ̀ mɩ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ bɛdɩyɛlɛ fɔ be terema gɛtɛ bàà wolo Yahwe gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Dohegi alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ fi, fɔ àà wolo gedi bɛtɛlɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dohegi e fi gɛ e wolo bɛ. Duwi dɩtɔkɔ e wolo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ akpilin anaa ma ton gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa boo gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ ngba tinlɛ diboro fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Sawulo e biri ɛ yɛ be wolo gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ boo ditele Nobi bɛnɩ powu. Be wolo beteni ma bɛnanɩ, ma bebi, ma bɛkyʋkyʋʋ, ma bɛkwɔ, ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, ma bɛyɛran powu.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Mɔ Ahimeleki wobi Abiyatari gɛtɛ wotu n di Ahitubi fɔ, e serenti gɛ ɛ ma fɩya ma Dafidi. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alɛ Sawulo e wolo Yahwe gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abiyatari alan, &lt;&lt;Duwi dɩtɔkɔ gɛtɛ na we Edom-te Dohegi dʋkɔbɛ fɔ, nan nyɩnla gɛtɛ ɛɛ̀ tɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo ade fɔ. Miin koro gɛ aate dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu be ku lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Sara maakʋn kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ, ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ee bugiti aa diku fɔ, ee bugiti nmɩ mɔ miinyo ke. À sara maakʋn fɔ, aà wura getoya.&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e to Keyila ditele ɛ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Duwi dɩkɩ ɛkɩ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, Filisiti bete bɛɛ kpà ma Keyila bete gɛ bee yuri ili yaanyan-fon fɔ,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />e lila Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;N san nan ma kpà ma Filisiti bete nyabɛ?&gt;&gt; Yahwe e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;San ma kpà ma ɛbɛ fɔ àà to Keyila ditele ya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Mɔ Dafidi bɛnɩ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, gɛtɛ tì sa Yuda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ gba lɛ, gɩsaa gì de tɩ, fɔ lan gɛ taà talɩ tɩ tɔ tɩ san Keyila ditele alɛ tɩ maà tà bɩtà ma Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Okoro Dafidi e biri e lila Yahwe gelenbi, gɛ Yahwe e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Waran san Keyila, yema nan ka Filisiti bete n sa aalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Okoro Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ san Keyila, gɛ bɛ kpà ma Filisiti bete fɔ gɛ Dafidi e wolo bɛ kpekpesi gɛ be kpila baanyan, gɛ e to Keyila bete ɛ ya. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />(Ɔya gɛtɛ Ahimeleki wobi Abiyatari e serenti ɛ ba Dafidi wakʋn fɔ, ɛ ka gedi gɩɩ bɛtɛlɛ bɔɔ gɛgba tinlɛ diboro ɛ ba Keyila ditele daanɩ.)<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawulo ɛ kpa ɛ gyaga Dafidi wokoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Gɛtɛ bɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alɛ Dafidi ɛ ba Keyila fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Wurubwarɛ e tiri wɔ ɛ tɛ mɩ, yema wu we anlɛ gɛtɛ e gye wo koro ɛ tan dikwo, gɛtɛ e be gyu ditele gɛtɛ ɔpɔrɩ wu silin di wu tuma gɛ dɩ̀ ba bʋwɔrɔnyan diitunu dɩrɛ-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e kpèlè wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ powu gɛtɛ bàà waran san Keyila bàà ma sʋ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ sa.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn alɛ Sawulo ɛɛ sa amɩnlɛ-kpen wokoro fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ gedi gɩɩ gɩtɛlɛ Abiyatari fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;ka gɛgba tinlɛ diboro fɔ ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Oo Yahwe, Isareli Wo Wurubwarɛ, nmɩ aasaranyan na nʋn alɛ, miin koro Sawulo ee len èè bè muru Keyila ditele. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Keyila bete baà tiri mɩ bɛ bɛ tɛ wɔ? Sawulo ɛɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɛ ba anlɛ gɛtɛ na nʋn fɔ? Oo! Yahwe, Isareli Wo Wurubwarɛ, dɔ̀ nmɩ aasaranyan.&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn ɛɛ̀ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Dafidi e biri e lila alan, Keyila bete baà tiri nmɩ ma mɩɩn bɛnɩ bɛ tɛ Sawulo? Gɛ Yahwe ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn baà tiri yɩ bɛ tɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Gɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ baà mɛ anlɛ nkpɩn bisiyee fɔ be ye Keyila, bɛɛ sara, sara bɛ tɔ. Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ nʋn alɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be serenti be ye Keyila fɔ, ɛ mɩnɩ san dʋkɔbɛ.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Dafidi e bu odon wʋʋ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Sifi wotonkuma waanɩ fɔ. Sawulo e bugiti wɔ duwi n di duwi, mɔ Wurubwarɛ en tiri Dafidi sa walɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ sa Horesi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Sifi wotonkuma waanɩ fɔ, Dafidi ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ ba è be wolo wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Gɛ Sawulo wobi Yonatan ɛ san Dafidi wakʋn Horesi ɛ ma kpà wɔ èè yela kin-kin Wurubwarɛ anɩ. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ, miinte Sawulo ɛɛn nan ka gʋlɔ ɛ kya wɔ. Aà bɛ mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ aà nya Isareli powu wo koro gɛ nmɩ nan mɛ aanyɔɔfɛ. Miinte Sawulo gba ɛ nyɩ̀ gɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Bɔɔ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ tà dikola Yahwe bʋnʋn. Dʋkɔ gɛ Yonatan ɛ da dɩkpaara, mɔ Dafidi ɛ wɔ Horesi.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Sifi bete bɛ bʋn bɛ san Sawulo wakʋn Gibeya, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi è bu odon wʋʋ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gɩ̀ sa Horesi, Hakila wodon fɔ wuu koro, Yesimon wɔ gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Oo egyu-dɩrɛ! waran ba ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ aa len fɔ taà gye wɔ tɩ tɛ wɔ̀.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe e hira yɩ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɩ dɔ̀ mɩ ade nyayɩ lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Ɩ san fɔ yàà ma nya gepepe, i bugiti yàà we ɔkʋn gbagbaagba gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ sa, ma ɛnɩ gɛtɛ e we wɔ dʋkɔbɛ. Bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ alɛ ɛ̀ ba dɩgyasɛyɩ. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />I bugiti yàà we wabukʋn powu fɔ yàà biri bɛ dɔ̀ mɩ ade gɛtɛ ɩ̀ sa waanɩ gbagba. Fɔ nan san ma ɛyɩ gengyi ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔbɛ fɔ, nan dɩyɛ n gye wɔ. Gengyi wù di gɛtɛ nan bugiti wɔ Yuda wakpara fɔ powu yaanɩ gba fɔ, nan mɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Okoro be gyegeye Sawulo bɛ da Sifi. Fɔ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ̀ sa Mayon wotonkuma waanɩ Araba gatɩn gɩɩ gɩlan gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yesimon fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sawulo ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ kya wo gebuti, gɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ fɔ, ɛ waran ɛ da ataa yiidon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Mayon wotonkuma waanɩ fɔ gɛ ɛ sara dʋkɔ. Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ nʋn gɛlɛ fɔ, ɛ san Mayon wotonkuma waanɩ ɛ ma bugiti Dafidi.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sawulo ɛ̀ san ma odon fɔ wuufèn wʋkɩ, fɔ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ mɔ bɛ̀ sa ofèn do, bee kutuma bàà serenti ye Sawulo wakʋn. Gɛtɛ Sawulo ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ gbɛma Dafidi ɛbɛ bàà gye bɛ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />ɛnɩ-salɛ ɛkɩ ɛ ba Sawulo wakʋn ɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Ba bilen! Filisiti bete bee to gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Sawulo e kere Dafidi gɛtɛrɛma ɛ ya, gɛ ɛ da ɛ̀ɛ̀ ma tuma Filisiti bete fɔ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro gɛ bee kpèlè dʋkɔ alan Sela Hammalekoti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛtɛ wuu wùlà alɛ dɩtaa gɛtɛ diyo</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Dafidi e ye dʋkɔ gɛ ɛ ma sara En Gedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e wura osele wololɛ Sawulo mɔ en wolo wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ ma kpà ma Filisiti bete e were fɔ, e biri ɛ ba, gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛ̀ sa En Gedi wotonkuma waanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Okoro Sawulo e tiri Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ nkpɩn bisiyee (3,000), gɛ ɛ da ɛ̀ ma bugiti Dafidi ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dɩfa dii begbebi bɔɔ dɩtaa-fwe daanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />E be gyu kpanan difwe gɛtɛ dɩ̀ gbɛma bɛyɛran baadʋrɔkʋn fɔ gɛ Sawulo e gyu daanɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san mosele. Fɔ ɛn nyɩ̀ alɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ mɔ bè bu kpanan difwe dɩtɔkɔ ke daanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹdò n di duwi gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tɩ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ alɛ, &lt;Nan ka aakyʋnlɛ n sa aalɔ yaanɩ àà mɛ wɔ anlɛ gɛtɛ àà len fɔ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Okoro Dafidi ɛ pɛtɩ gɛ e ma kebi Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ gɛgba giinyun bɛrɛɛ. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Mɔ wʋʋ gama fɔ, Dafidi woturu wʋ gbɛrɛ wɔ, yema gɛtɛ e kebi Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ gɛgba bɛrɛɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yahwe ɛ ka ɛ san ɔfɔ, gɛtɛ nan mɛ miinfonte gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ fɔ ade-kpen ɩkɩ, abɛɛ nan tiri gʋlɔ wo koro, yema Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Okoro Dafidi e yela ade fɔ yii koro ɛ fa wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ gɛ ɛn yɛ bɛ bàà ma kpà ma Sawulo. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ tɔ e ye dɩtaa-fwe fɔ daanɩ ɛ da.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Dafidi e ye dɩtaa-fwe fɔ daanɩ gɛ ɛ gbɛrɛ afala e kpèlè Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ!&gt;&gt; Gɛtɛ Sawulo e fi ɛ nya wɔ gama fɔ, e we gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ waran e kura gɛ ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa nʋn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alɛ &lt;Nmɩ Dafidi ǹ ba amɩnlɛ-kpen aa koro?&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Awɔ gbagba a we gɛtɛ ǹdò Yahwe ɛ ka wɔ̀ ɛ sa mɩɩn gʋlɔ dɩtaa-fwe fɔ daanɩ. Bɛkɩ bɛ fʋba bɛ sa mɩ alɛ, n wolo wɔ̀, mɔ na kere wɔ̀ na ya. Yema na dɔ̀ alɛ, &lt;Mɩn nan ka mɩɩn gʋlɔ n kya miinfonte kpakpaakpa, yema è di egyu-dɩrɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Miinte, nya aa gɛgba wurukyaa fɔ giinyun mɩɩn gʋlɔ gaanɩ. Na kebi aa gɛgba wurukyaa fɔ giinyun mɔ miin wolo wɔ̀. Nkele nʋn fɔ àà nyɩnla alɛ n ma aa koro gaamɩnlɛ kpen ɩkɩ, gɛ mɩn tɔ yela aa koro. Mɩn mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen ɩkɩ, mɔ aa fan mɩ gɛtɛ àà wolo mɩ. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Yahwe nan dɔ̀ ɛtɩ ma awɔ tɩɩ gɛdɔ̀. Fɔ èè le wɔ̀ ade-kpen gɛtɛ a mɛ mɩ fɔ powu yii gutoro, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ, mɩn nan ka mɩɩn gʋlɔ n kya wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛndɩrɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ dɩkpalɩ alɛ, &lt;Bɛnɩ-kpen n tɛ mɛ ade-kpen&gt; fɔ, okoro mɩɩn gʋlɔ gɩ nan kya wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />&lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛ Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ ee len èè wolo? Ɛnyan gɛ à serenti à berema? Ɛkpɛɛ-kulɛ? Abɛɛ dɩbaaba? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Yahwe eè gyu taade yaanɩ, ɛɛ̀ dɔ̀ ɛtɩ ma awɔ tɩɩ gɛdɔ̀. Eè to maade ɛ sa fɔ èè tiri mɩ e ye aalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ tabʋrʋ e were fɔ, Sawulo e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi Dafidi, awɔ n tɛ tabʋrʋ lɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e gbena ɛ sa gewula. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ayo wʋ̀ ba aten, yema alɛ a mɛ mɩ gepe, mɔ nmɩ bɩrɛ na mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Gɛ ǹdò a tiri aa gɩnɩ-kpara a wùlà mɩ, yema Yahwe ɛ ka mɩ ɛ sa aa gʋlɔ gaanɩ, mɔ an wolo mɩ. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Gengyi ɛnɩ ɛkɩ è wura wɔkyʋnlɛ fɔ, ee kere wɔ ɛ ya ɛ̀ɛ̀ da tuntun? Ade gɛtɛ a mɛ a tɛ mɩ ǹdò lɛ wuu koro, Yahwe ɛ ka ade-kpara e le wɔ̀ gutoro. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Ǹ nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ aa nyɩ a ba mɛ egyu-dɩrɛ gɛ Isareli bugyu baà sere wɔ̀ gepe. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Nkele kan ntam Yahwe diyere daanɩ tɛ mɩ alɛ a nan wolo miindu waanɩ wʋʋ bɛnɩ abɛɛ a nan kpa miin diyere a ye miinte bɛfʋrɩ baanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ kan ntam ɛ tɛ Sawulo. Dʋkɔ gɛ Sawulo e biri ɛ da dɩkpaara, mɔ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be biri bɛ da boo gebukʋn.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi, ma Nabali, ma Abigeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Samweli e ku, gɛ Isareli bete powu be tuma be wula wɔ, gɛ be lò wɔ wɔlɛ Rama ditele daanɩ. Wʋʋ gama fɔ, Dafidi ɛ waran ɛ da Mayon wotonkuma waanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Ete ɛkɩ ɛ sara Mayon ditele, gɛ e wura anyan kpekpesi Kameli ditele daanɩ. E wura begbebi nkpɩn ton, ma bɛyɛran gbaa ma nkpɩn-ton (3,000). <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Bee kpèlè wɔ alɛ Nabali gɛ e ye Kalebi dɩkpaara daanɩ. Bee kpèlè wɔsɔ alɛ Abigeli, ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ade gepepe gɛ e ye gɩsʋgʋgyan, mɔ wɔsan ɛ̀ ba duyu-kɛma gɛ ɛn ta we ɛnɩ gutunkoro. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Ɔya gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ sa otonkuma waanɩ fɔ, ɛ nʋn gɛtɛ Nabali ɛɛ wɔrɔ wɔ bɛyɛran anu. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Okoro ɛ sa wɔ bɛsaranyan-bi fwo gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ bɛ alan, &lt;Ɩ bʋn ɩ san Nabali wakʋn Karimeli fɔ yàà sa wɔ onyun ɩ tɛ mɩ. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Ɩ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Sara nkpa ma ɔfɔ. Awɔ ma aa dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ yàà sara ɔkɛma waanɩ! Ɔkɛma wàà sara ma aa gɩnyan-kamasɛ!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Nkele, na nʋn gɛtɛ aa bɛnɩ bɛɛ wɔrɔ aa bɛyɛran. Ɔya gɛtɛ aa bɛnan bɔɔ bɛnyalɛ bè si taakʋn fɔ, tɩn nyanla bɛ gɛ ɔya powu gɛtɛ bɛ sara Karimeli fɔ, bɔɔ gɩnyankɩ mɔ gin lulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Lila awɔ gbagba aa bɛsaranyan fɔ bàà dɔ̀ wɔ̀. Gɛlɛ wuu koro, wula aa bɛsaranyan gutunkoro yema tii gyu ɔsɛ wuu gedi wʋʋya waanɩ. Ǹ fɔ wɔ gɛ tɛ aa bɛsaranyan ma nmɩ aabi Dafidi gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ yaà wura ɩ tɛ bɛ fɔ.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ ma gyu fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ Nabali ɔtʋn gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ tɛ bɛ fɔ, gɛ be so wɔ dʋkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Nabali e tiri wuunyun ɛ tɛ Dafidi bɛsaranyan fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan n di gɛlɛ wuu Dafidi nyawɔ? Ɛnyan n di Yese wobi nyawɔ? Ǹdò waawi nyayɩ, anlɛ gɛ bɛsaranyan kpekpesi bee serenti be ye boofonte ɛbɛ baakʋn bɛ̀ san bɛ̀ san. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Anʋn yii koro gɛ nan ka miin boroboro ma miin butu ma mɩɩn gɩnan gɛtɛ na wolo nan tɛ mɩɩn bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛɛ wɔrɔ mɩɩn bɛyɛran baanu fɔ n tɛ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ mɩn nyɩ boo geyekʋn?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ be fi gɛ biri bɛ da. Gɛtɛ bɛ ma gyu fɔ, bɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi anʋn agyebi gɛtɛ Nabali ɛ dɔ̀ fɔ powu. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn ade nyayɩ fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩ ka yɩɩ bɛtata yàà ban bɛgbagya.&gt;&gt; Okoro ɛkamasɛ ɛ ka wɔ tata gɛ Dafidi mɔ ɛ ka woyo. Baà mɛ anlɛ bɛnɩ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ gɛtɛ bɛ bʋn bɛ da fɩya ma Dafidi, mɔ bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn bɛ wɔ bè si bɛɛ dɩyɛ baanyan.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Nabali bɛsaranyan fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ ɛ ma dɔ̀ Nabali wɔsɔ Abigayeli alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛ sa bɛsaranyan bɛkɩ e ye otonkuma waanɩ alɛ bɛ ma sa tiifonte onyun, mɔ ɛ ka owurufa gɛ e toro bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Mɔ bè di bɛnɩ kpara tɛ tɩ. Bɛn nyanla tɩ gɛ ɔya powu gɛtɛ tɩ sara gɛtʋnkwaa fɔ gaanɩ tɩ gbɛma bɛ fɔ, tɩɩ gɩnyankɩ gin lulu. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Ɔya gɛtɛ tɩ sara tɩ̀ gbɛma bɛ tɩ nya bɛnan boo koro fɔ, bɛ dɩyɛ odòn ma ofilibo anlɛ ɔpɔrɩ na silin tɩ wu tuma. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro sa amɩnlɛ gepe fɔ àà nya gɩnyan gɛtɛ aà talɩ a mɛ, yema gyerebi wʋ talɩ wu di tiifonte ma wɔ dɩkpaara dɩɩ bɛnɩ powu. È di duyu-kɛma dɩɩnɩ ɛkɩ gɛtɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛn nan talɩ ɛ tabʋrʋ ɛ tɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigeli ɛn kyɛrɩ gɛ ɛ ka boroboro gɛkpɩn, ma wayɩn bʋkan ɛnan-gɩkpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔya fɔ waanɩ fɔ, ɛnan gɩkpa gaanɩ gɛ bɛɛ sa bʋkan.</char></note> bʋnyɔɔ, ma bɛyɛran kumalɛ ton, ma afɩnaa sʋnlɛ muru ton, ma oyon wabi dikpilin ma fwo, ma figi wabi-nyɩmalɛ yii boroboro gɛkpɩn gɛ ɛ ban yɩ ɛ gyaga akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ yii koro. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;I gyegeye nan tɛrɛma yɩ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ ɛn dɔ̀ wɔsan Nabali.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Gɛtɛ ɛ̀ gyaga wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ dii koro gɛ ɛ ma nɩma gɛwaran-gyu gifoobi gaanɩ fɔ, Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛɛ waran bɛɛ ba ma wɔ gɩlan gɛ e tuma bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ bɔ ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Gɛnya gɛtɛ na nya ete nyawɔ wanyan yii koro otonkuma waanɩ gɛ gɩnyankɩ gɩn lulu fɔ powu, wʋ mɛ tuntun. Ɛ ka ade-kpen e le mɩ ade-kpara yii gutoro. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Wurubwarɛ e wolo mɩ gengyi ma gɩsaa gɛgyɩgyan ǹ kere wo beteni gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba fɔ ɛkɩ n ya nkpa fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Gɛtɛ Abigeli e we Dafidi fɔ, ɛ waran bilen wɔ dɩkpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ dii koro, gɛ ɛ waran e kura ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa Dafidi bʋnʋn. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Ɛ waran e kura Dafidi bɩsɩrɩ baanɩ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Miinfonte yɛ dɩpwɛ fɔ dàà tola miinko. Koturu gɛ yɛ aasʋgʋgyan ɛ̀ɛ̀ tabʋrʋ ma awɔ fɔ àà nʋn ade gɛtɛ ɛ̀ ba ɛ̀ɛ̀ dɔ̀ wɔ̀. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Miinfonte, ǹ fɔ wɔ gɛ kara nʋn duyu-kɛma diite Nabali nyawɔ wakʋn. Ɛ̀ bɔ è we gɛ anlɛ wo diyere fɔ. Wo diyere fɔ dii wùlà alɛ enyimapulɛ gɛ anyimapu-de n tɛrɛma wɔ. Mɔ nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan bɩrɛ, min we bɛnɩ gɛtɛ miinfonte a sa fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Yahwe na sʋ wɔ osele gɛ an wolo aa bɛkyʋnlɛ ka le ade-kpen gɛtɛ bɛ mɛ wɔ fɔ yii gutoro aa gʋlɔ gii koro. Gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ sa gɛ awɔ mɔ à si nkpa lɛ, aa bɛkyʋnlɛ powu ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ baà tɔ be yela aa koro fɔ, Yahwe eè tiira bɛ giten anlɛ Nabali. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Koturu gɛ miinfonte, to anyan-kyɛlɛ gɛtɛ aasʋgʋgyan ɛ ka ɛ mɔmɔ wɔ lɛ fɔ à ka tɛ aa bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ tɛrɛma wɔ̀ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Koturu gɛ gengyi aasʋgʋgyan ɛ mɛ wade-kpen ɩkɩ fɔ, ka kyɛ wɔ, yema Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka bugyu boo gedi ɛ tɛ awɔ ma aa dɩkpaara yema akpa Yahwe wakpa. Ade-kpen ɩkɩ ɩ nan tama wɔ aa nkpa awi powu yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Gengyi terema ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ee bugiti è wolo wɔ gba fɔ, Yahwe aa Wurubwarɛ eè to aa nkpa ɛ sɩ̀ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛɛ dɩyɛ ɛnɩ wanyan fɔ. Mɔ aa bɛkyʋnlɛ fɔ bɩrɛ, eè fun bɛ e lulu anlɛ gɛtɛ bee fʋn dɩtaa fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Gengyi Yahwe ɛ̀ mɛ ade-kpara powu gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ sɩ̀ ɛ tɛ miinfonte, gɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ wɔ Isareli wo gyegeyelɛ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />Miinfonte wʋ̀ ba gɛlɛ fɔ, wʋn nɩ taga wɔ̀ alɛ a wolo ɛnɩ ɛkɩ tuntun abɛɛ awɔ gbagba na wolo ɛkɩ a le gutoro. Gɛ gengyi Yahwe e hira wɔ̀ fɔ, n fɔ gɛ miinfonte, kara finla mɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abigeli alan, &lt;&lt;Sila Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ, gɛtɛ ɛ yɛ a be tuma mɩ ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Tɩɩ sa Yahwe onyun aamɩnlɛ kpara gɛtɛ a ba ma ade gɛtɛ a mɛ ǹdò gɛtɛ a yɛ miin wolo ɛnɩ gɛ miin le getoro mɩɩn gʋlɔ gii koro lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Na nyà Yahwe, Isareli wo Wurubwarɛ gɛtɛ ɛn yɛ mɩ nan mɛ wɔ̀ ade-kpen ɩkɩ fɔ alɛ, an da bè tuma mɩ belen fɔ, nafɔ ma gɩsa gagyɩgyan Nabali ma wɔ bɛsaranyan powu baà ku<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi e to anyan gɛtɛ Abigeli ɛ ka ɛ mɔma wɔ fɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Biri san dɩkpaara olila waanɩ, na nʋn aade gɛtɛ a dɔ̀ fɔ. Nan mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ aa len fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Gɛtɛ Abigeli e biri ɛ san Nabali wakʋn fɔ, ɛ̀ sa dɩkpaara ee di ɔsɛ dɩrɛ anlɛ egyu-dɩrɛ woyo. Ɛ nyʋn bʋkan e su. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Abigeli ɛn dɔ̀ wɔ ade ɩkɩ gɛlɛ kere gɩ kpa. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Gɛtɛ kere gɩ kpa gɛ wɔ bʋkan fɔ bʋ da wokoro fɔ Abigayeli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ ade nyayɩ powu, dʋkɔ fɔ woturu wu bele wɔ gɛ ɛ kʋn e yela anlɛ dɩtaa. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Awi fwo yɩɩ gama fɔ, Yahwe ɛ gbɛrɛ Nabali gɛ e ku.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ nʋn alɛ Nabali e ku fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tii sila Yahwe, gɛtɛ e le Nabali gutoro ɛ tɛ mɩ ɔya gɛtɛ e toro mɩ fɔ. Ɛn yɛ nmɩ wɔsaranyan nan wolo wɔ. Mɔ ɛ yɛ Nabali wade-kpen gɛtɛ ɛ mɛ fɔ yii biri wo koro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ sa bɛnɩ alɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Abigeli alɛ eè to wɔ gɩna. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Dafidi bɛsaranyan bɛ san Karimeli gɛ bɛ ma dɔ̀ Abigayeli alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi ɛ sa tɩ aakʋn, alɛ tɩ bɛ wɔ tɩ mɔma wɔ fɔ àà mɛ wɔsɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Ɛ waran e kura ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya aasʋgʋgyan, ɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ gʋtʋn ɛ tɛ wɔ̀, fɔ èè fere miinfonte bɛsaranyan bɔɔ bɩsɩrɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Dɩkpalan daanɩ fɔ Abigayeli ɛ bʋn dɩkpɔŋɔ tɩtɩɩ dii koro fɩya ma wɔ bɛsʋgʋgyan ton gɛ bɛ tɛrɛma Dafidi bɛsalɛ fɔ bɛ da gɛ e biligi wɔsɔ. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Dafidi e were to Ahinoham gɛtɛ e ye Yesireli fɔ gɛ bɛ bɛnyɔɔ bɛ mɛ wɔsɔ ɛbɛ. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Mɔ ɔya wʋtɔkɔ waanɩ fɔ, Sawulo ɛ fʋrʋma labɩrɩ wobi-nanɩ Mikali gɛtɛ nafɔ è di Dafidi wɔsɔ fɔ, ɛ tɛ Palitiyeli gɛtɛ è di Layisi wobi gɛ e ye Galim fɔ gɩna.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e biri e kere Sawulo ɛ ya gɛtɛ en wolo wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Sifi bete bɛ san Sawulo akʋn Gibeya bɛ ma dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;A nyɩ̀ gɛtɛ Dafidi è bu Hakila wodon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ ten Yesimon wotonkuma fɔ waanɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Okoro Sawulo e tiri bɛnɩ gbaa ma nkpɩn ton (3,000) e ye Isareli bete baanɩ gɛ bɛ da Sifi wotonkuma waanɩ bàà ma bugiti Dafidi. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sawulo e sere baasarakʋn ɛ gbɛma osele Hakila wodon gɛtɛ wʋ̀ ten Yesimon wotonkuma fɔ, fɔ Dafidi ɛ̀ sa otonkuma fɔ waanɩ. Gɛtɛ e we alɛ Sawulo ɛ tɛrɛma wɔ ɛ ba dʋkɔ fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />ɛ sa beyurunyalɛ gɛ bɛ ma we gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ nyɩ̀ ɛ̀ ba ɛ̀ sa dʋkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ tɔ gɛ ɛ da ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ̀ sa fɔ. E we ɔkʋn gɛtɛ Sawulo ma bɩtà bʋʋtàlɛ ɛndɩrɛ Neri wobi Abineri bɛ̀ dɔ̀. Sawulo ɛ̀ dɔ̀ gɛsarakʋn fɔ gii getite gɛ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ dʋrɔ be silin wɔ be tuma. <verse eid="1SA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Gɛ Dafidi e lila Hiti-te Ahimeleki ma Saruwa wobi Abisayi gɛtɛ è di Yowabi wɔdɩrɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan nan fɩya ma nmɩ taà waran tɩ san Sawulo wakʋn gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Gɛ Abisahi alan, &lt;&lt;Nan fɩya ma awɔ n san.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Okoro Dafidi ma Abisahi bɛ san bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ baakʋn odente, fɔ Sawulo ɛ dʋrɔ ɛ fwa bʋda gɛsarakʋn fɔ gii getite gɛ wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan gɩ̀ sere gɛtʋnkwaa gbɛma wo duyu. Abineri ma bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ mɔ bɛ dʋrɔ be silin wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Abisahi ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹdò Yahwe e tiri aa kyʋnlɛ ɛ tɛ wɔ. Nkele yɛ mɩ nan sere wɔ mɩɩn gɩtʋrʋnyan fɔ n marama gɛtʋnkwaa. Mɩn nan sere wɔ dɩnyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Mɔ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abisahi alan, &lt;&lt;Kara wolo wɔ, ɛ nyan nan talɩ ɛ ka gʋlɔ ɛ kya Yahwe wɔnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ gɛtɛ ɛn nan di dɩpwɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan &lt;&lt;Gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɛ sa lɛ, ɛwɔ gbagba nan wolo wɔ, nkɩfɔ ɛwɔ gbagba wawi nan nɩma gɛ eè ku, abɛɛ ɛɛ̀ san bɩtà baanɩ gɛ ɛɛ̀ ma ku. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Mɔ Yahwe ɛ ka ɛ san ɔfɔ alɛ nmɩ nan ka gʋlɔ n kya wɔnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ. Ka wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan ma wo butu bʋʋ gɛsakʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀ gbɛma wo duyu fɔ taà san.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Okoro Dafidi ɛ ka gɩtʋrʋnyan ma butu bʋʋ gɛsakʋn gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀ gbɛma Sawulo duyu fɔ gɛ bɛ da. Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ en we gɛ ɛn nyɩnla ade nyayɩ abɛɛ ɛnɩ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ lama. Ɛbɛ powu bɛ fwa, yema Yahwe ɛ yɛ bɛ fwa bʋda bɛ kyolon.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ɛ kààrà ɛ san ofèn-do fɔ gɛ ɛ ma bʋn e yela odon fɔ wuu duyu dii koro, fɔ bɛ ba ɔfɔ ma bɛwɔlɔn. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />E kpen e kpèlè bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ ma Neri wobi Abineri alan, &lt;&lt;Abineri, aa nʋn maakʋn? Gɛ Abineri e lila alan, Ɛnyan gɛ à di gɛ aa kpen àà lama egyu-dɩrɛ gɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Gɛ Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nka awɔ n di eteni Isareli fɔ? Gɛ anʋn yii koro gɛ an talɩ dɩyɛ aafonte egyu-dɩrɛ? Ɛnɩ ɛkɩ e gyu yɩɩ gɛsarakʋn fɔ gaanɩ èè wolo aafonte egyu-dɩrɛ. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Ade gɛtɛ a mɛ lɛ ɩn kɔlɔ, na nya alɛ gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ̀ nyɩ̀ ɛ sa lɛ, awɔ ma aa bɛnɩ fɔ yɩ kʋtʋma ma diku, yema ɩɩn dɩyɛ yiifonte, gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ sʋrʋ bʋnɔ fɔ. Ɩ nya i silin alɛ yaà we wɔ gɩtʋrʋnyan ma womini-salɛ-butu gɛtɛ ɩ̀ dɔ̀ gbɛma wo duyu fɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sawulo ɛ nyɩnla Dafidi gɩta gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Nka Miinbi Dafidi gɩta gɩ lɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn, wù di gɛ nmɩ, miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Gɛ e biri ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ miinfonte ɛ̀ tɛrɛma nmɩ wɔsaranyan? Anʋn gɛ na mɛ, gɛ ade-kpen mɔmɔ gɛ na mɛ gɛtɛ yii tin mɩ dɩpwɛ? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ, nʋn nmɩ aasaranyan maagyebi. Gengyi wù di gɛ Yahwe na yɛ gɛ aa tɔ a yela miin koro fɔ, e to gedi gɩɩ gɛtɛ̀ nyagɩ fɔ woturu wàà nʋ̀n wɔ. Mɔ gengyi wù di gɛ bɛnɩ n tɛ mɛ fɔ, Yahwe ɛ fwala bɛ, yema be berema mɩ be ye mɩɩn gedikʋn ye gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ tɛ Isareli bete fɔ gaanɩ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;San ma sʋma bekpen.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro ɩ kara yɛ mɩɩn nkalan ɛ̀ɛ̀ nʋ̀n gɛtʋnkwaa ma ɔfɔ gaanɩ gɛtɛ wun di gɛ Yahwe bʋnʋn. Awɔ Isareli wogyu a ba aa fan nmɩ gɛtɛ n we anlɛ dɩbaaba, anlɛ gɛtɛ bɛɛ fan efwi idon yii koro fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Dʋkɔ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na mɛ ade-kpen. Biri ba, miinbi Dafidi. Yema ǹdò a we alɛ mɩɩn nkpa wù di ade gbaa. Mɩɩn nan nɩ tɔ n yela aa koro, gbagbaagba fɔ na mɛ anyimapu-de gɛ na mɛ ade-kpen na kààrà.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Nya aa gɩtʋrʋnyan fɔ gɩlɛ, yɛ aasaranyan fɔ ɛkɩ èè be to gɩ. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Yahwe ee le ɛnɩ-kamasɛ gɛtɛ wade ɩ̀ tʋna gɛ ee di nʋnkwarɩ fɔ gutoro. E tiri wɔ̀ ɛ tɛ mɩ ǹdò, mɔ mɩn ka gʋlɔ kya wɔ̀, yema à di wɔnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ sʋrʋ wɔ bʋnɔ. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Gbagbaagba fɔ, anlɛ gɛtɛ ǹdò na we aa nkpa alɛ wù di ade gbaa lɛ, gɛlɛ gɛ Yahwe mɔ ɛɛ̀ nya mɩɩn yo fɔ èè tiri mɩ ye ade-kpen-kamasɛ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Miinbi Dafidi, Wurubwarɛ e hira wɔ̀. Aà mɛ ade-dɩrɛ gɛ aà di aa bɛkyʋnlɛ boo koro.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Gɛ Dafidi ɛ da, gɛ Sawulo e biri ɛ ba ditele.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi ɛ̀ sa Filisiti bete baanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Dafidi ɛ sa amɩnlɛ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Sawulo eè wolo mɩ awi nyayɩ yaanɩ. Okoro ade gɛtɛ nan talɩ n mɛ fɔ n di gɛtɛ nan serenti n san Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Gɛlɛ fɔ, Sawulo eè kere miin gebugiti Isareli gɩfɩɩ gaanɩ ɛ ya, fɔ nmɩ mɔ nan mɔlɩ n ye walɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Okoro Dafidi ma bɛnɩ nkpɩn bisiyee fɔ bɛ tɔ gɛ bɛ san Akisi gɛtɛ wote n di Mahoki gɛ è di Gati wogyu fɔ wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Gɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ sara Gati, Akisi wakʋn. Ɛnɩ-kamasɛ è de wɔsɔ ma wo bebi, gɛ Dafidi è de wɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ, Ahinoam gɛtɛ e ye Yasereli fɔ ma Abigeli gɛtɛ e ye Kameli gɛ è di Nabali wɔkpɩnsɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo ɛ nʋn alɛ Dafidi e serenti ɛ da Gati fɔ, en mini biri tɛrɛma wɔ.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Duwi dɩkɩ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Akisi alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi maade ii di wɔ gʋnʋn fɔ, yɛ mɩ nan wura ditelebi dɩkɩ n sara daanɩ. Wʋn kʋtʋma nmɩ aasaranyan ma awɔ tàà sara aa digyu-tele daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Okoro Akisi ɛ ka Sikalagi ditele ɛ tɛ wɔ, nyawʋ wuu koro Sikalagi wu biligi Yuda begyu-dɩrɛ booyo be ye ma ǹdò. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Dafidi ɛ sara Filisiti bete baakʋn gɩkyan ma bebon bɛnaa.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ ka dɩkpatɩ bɛ ma kpila Gesuri bete, ma Girisi bete, ma Amaleki bete baanyan. Bɛnɩ bɛtɔkɔ bɛ sara ɔlanlan wʋtɔkɔ ye sɩyɛɛ ɔya kpekpesi wʋkɩ waanɩ, gɛ bɛ sara gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ gɩ̀ dɔ gɩɩ fɔrɔ Suru, Egyipiti wosele waanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Ɔya-kamasɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ɛ̀ tà bɩtà ma gɩlan gɩkɩ gɩɩ bɛnɩ fɔ, ɛn taa kere eteni abɛɛ ɛnanɩ ɛ ya, mɔ ɛɛ ka bɔɔ bɛyɛran, ma bɔɔ bɛkwɔ, ma baakpɔŋɔ ma baakpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ, ma baanyɩmɩnyan, fɔ e biri ɛ ba Akisi wakʋn. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Gengyi Akisi è lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan ɛbɛ gɛ a ka dɩkpatɩ a ma kpila baanyan ǹdò?&gt;&gt; Dafidi ɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Negefi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yuda fɔ, abɛɛ Negefi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Yerameli, abɛɛ Negefi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Keni fɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Dafidi en kere eteni abɛɛ ɛnanɩ ɛ ya bàà san Gati, yema ɛ sa amɩnlɛ alan, &lt;&lt;Baà ma dɔ̀ tii koro wade alan, &lt;Ade nyayɩ gɛ ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ mɛ.&gt; &gt;&gt; Gɛlɛ gɛ Dafidi ɛ mɛ ɔya gɛtɛ ɛ sara Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Akisi e to Dafidi e di gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ ɛ tɛ koro alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛwɔ gbagba wɔ bɛnɩ Isareli bete bɛ kyʋn wɔ, okoro ɛɛ̀ mɛ mɩɩndɩ̀ gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo ma Endo wɔsɔlɔ-nanɩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Ɔkʋna wʋkɩ waanɩ Filisiti bete bɛ pɩna koro gɛtɛ bɛ bɛ kpà ma Isareli bete. Ɛwʋ gɛ Akisi ɛ dɔ̀ Dafidi alan, &lt;&lt;Nyɩnla alɛ wù di gɛtɛ àà awɔ ma aa bɛnɩ yàà fɩya ma nmɩ ɩ ma kpà ma Isareli bete ɩ tɛ mɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ gbagba aà we ɛwʋ gɛtɛ aasaranyan ɛɛ̀ talɩ ɛ mɛ.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Akisi alan, &lt;&lt;Wʋ̀ kɔlɔ. Nan mɛ wɔ̀ ɛnɩ gɛtɛ ɛ tɩ dɩyɛ mɩ gakpaakpa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Nkele Samweli e ku, gɛ Isareli bete fɔ powu be wula wɔ, gɛ be lo wɔ wɔlɛ Rama ditele daanɩ. Fɔ Sawulo ɛ fʋrʋma berema bɛbwɔ, ma bɛfa-te e ye Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Filisiti bete be tuma gɛ be sere bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gbɛma Sunemi ditele. Fɔ Sawulo mɔ e tuma Isareli bete powu gɛ be sere bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn gbɛma Gilibwa wodon wʋʋpɩ. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Gɛtɛ Sawulo e we Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ, gɩsaa gi ton wɔ gɛ woturu wu belen wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Sawulo e lila Yahwe gɩnyan gɛtɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ mɛ. Mɔ Yahwe ɛn da ma okute waanɩ abɛɛ ataa yɩɩ gɛsɩ̀ abɛɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔtabʋrʋlɛ èè tiri ade wùlà wɔ. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ bɛsaranyan alan, &lt;&lt;I bugiti ɛbwɔ-nanɩ ɩ tɛ mɩ, fɔ nan san gɩbɔ wakʋn.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛbɔ ɛkɩ ɛ̀ sa Endo ditele daanɩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Okoro Sawulo e foma wo koro, ɛ sa ngba-fon, gɛtɛ ɛkɩ ɛɛn nyɩnla wɔ. Gɛ ɛwɔ ma bɛsaranyan bɛnyɔɔ bɛ da ɛna fɔ waakʋn odente. Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Sɔma tɛ mɩ, kpèlè ete gɛtɛ nan kpèlè wo diyere lɛ, wo gikpena tɛ mɩ ɛ̀ɛ̀ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Mɔ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Gbagbaagba fɔ à nyɩ̀ ɛwʋ gɛtɛ egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo ɛ mɛ, e berema bɛbwɔ, ma bɛfa-te e ye Isareli gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ. Gɛ nkele, anʋn yii koro gɛ a ba aa ten mɩ ɔdʋ, fɔ wàà mɔma mɩ diku?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ ka Yahwe ɛ kan ntam ɛ tɛ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ na tɛ wɔ̀ alɛ bɛn nan tiira wɔ̀ giten ade nyayɩ yii koro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛnyan gɛ n kpèlè n tɛ wɔ̀?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Kpèlè Samweli ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Gɛtɛ ɛna fɔ e we Samweli fɔ, ɛ gbɛrɛ afala-kin-kin ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Awɔ ǹ di egyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo. Anʋn yii koro gɛ a gban mɩ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ egyu-dɩrɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Kara yɛ gɩsaa gàà ton wɔ̀. Anʋn gɛ a we?&gt;&gt; Gɛ ɛna fɔ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Na we ekpena ɛkɩ gɛtɛ e duru e ye gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ ɛɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Ɛwʋ gɛ e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Lan gɛ è we?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛna fɔ e tiri wonyun alan, &lt;&lt;Diteni-kwaa dɩkɩ gɛtɛ dɩ̀ sa gɛgba serelɛ n tɛ ba.&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo ɛ nyɩnla gɛtɛ wù di gɛ Samweli, gɛ ɛ waran e kura ɛ ka wɔ bʋnʋn e tin gɛtʋnkwaa. <verse eid="1SA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Gɛ Samweli ɛ dɔ̀ Sawulo alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa sʋra mɩ koro gɛ a kpèlè mɩ a ba?&gt;&gt; Ɛwʋ gɛ Sawulo e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;N sa ɔnʋn-sɩna waanɩ, yema Filisiti bete fɔ bee len baà bɛ kpa ma mɩ, mɔ Wurubwarɛ e tiri bʋnʋn ɛ yɛ mɩ. Nkenkele ɛ mɩnɩ taà nɩ nʋn maakʋn. Ɛn mɩnɩ taà nɩ da ma wɔ bɛtabʋrʋlɛ, abɛɛ ma okute waanɩ e tiri maade yiinyun ɛ tɛ mɩ. Okoro gɛ na kpèlè wɔ̀, fɔ àà dɔ̀ mɩ ade gɛtɛ nan mɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Samuweli e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn yii koro gɛ aa kpèlè mɩ ɔkʋna gɛtɛ Yahwe e tiri bʋnʋn ɛ yɛ wɔ̀, gɛ a biligi wɔkyʋnlɛ lɛ? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Yahwe ɛ mɛ ade gɛtɛ ɛ da ma miin koro ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ fɔ. E to bugyu fɔ e ye aakʋn, gɛ ɛ ka bʋ ɛ tɛ Dafidi, aa bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ ɛkɩ. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Gɛtɛ an bu Yahwe gɛ an di wade gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ̀ ka da ma Amaleki bete boo koro fɔ, ɛwʋ na yɛ gɛ ɛ mɛ wɔ̀ gɛlɛ ǹdò lɛ. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka awɔ ma Isareli bete fɔ ɛ sa Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ. Gɛ gɩsa awɔ ma aa bebi yaà bɛ fɩya ma nmɩ. Gɛ Yahwe ɛɛ̀ ka Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ mɔ ɛ sa Filisiti bete baalɔ yaanɩ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ade gɛtɛ Samuweli ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ ɩ mɛ wɔ gɩsaa ɩ kààrà, okoro e belen ɛ nʋ̀n disere-kɩlɩn ɛ tʋna gɛtʋnkwaa. Ɛ yɔlɔ, yema en di gɩnyankɩ duwi dɩtɔkɔ powu wuudente. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Gɛtɛ ɛna fɔ e be we Sawulo ɛ̀ dɔ̀ ɛɛ gbɛrɛ kpakpakpa fɔ, ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Nya, nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan na bù wɔ̀. Na yera diku gɛ na mɛ ade gɛtɛ a lila mɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Nkele, nʋn nmɩ aasʋgʋgyan maakʋn. Yɛ mɩ nan tɛ wɔ anyandilɛ à di fɔ àà wura ɔkɛma fɔ àà talɩ biri san aa geyekʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Mɔ Sawulo e terema alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩn nan di.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:23">Mɔ bɛsaranyan bɛ fɩya ma ɛna fɔ be koturu wɔ, gɛ ɛ nʋn baakʋn. Ɛ tɔ gɛtʋnkwaa ɛ sara difenge dii koro. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ɛna fɔ ɛ̀ ba ɛkwɔ dɩtan ma ayò, e wolo dɩ, gɛ ɛ ka ɔnʋmʋ ɛ mɛ boroboro gɛtɛ bɛn sa gɩfa-ŋanlɛ. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ɛwʋ gɛ ɛ ka ɛ bɛ sɩ̀ Sawulo ma wɔ bɛsaranyan, gɛ be di. Gɛ odente wʋtɔkɔ, bɛ tɔ gɛ bɛ da.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Filisiti bete be terema Dafidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Filisiti bete be tuma bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ powu Afeki, gɛ Isareli bete be sere bɔɔ gɛsarakʋn Yesereli wɔlɔkɔ wʋʋpɩ. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Gɛtɛ Filisiti bɛndɩrɛbi bɛ ka bɔɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ akpilin ton-ton ma nkpɩn ton-ton yaakpi be ye bɛɛ fɔrɔ fɔ. Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ mɔ bɛ̀ san bɔɔ gama fɔ Akisi ɛ̀ san ma ɛbɛ gamaama. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ be lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ Hebre bete nyabɛ bee len nfan?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akisi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Dafidi gɛtɛ è di Isareli wogyu-dɩrɛ Sawulo bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔndɩrɛ fɔ gɛ wù di. E were di gɩkyan ɛ kààrà maakʋn, gɛ boo ye duwi gɛtɛ e ye Sawulo wakʋn e be gyu mɩ bè sere ma ǹdò lɛ, min we wɔ ma ade-kpen ɩkɩ nya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Mɔ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛbi fɔ bɛ ka owurufa wokoro gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Yɛ wɔ è biri ma sara ɔkʋn gɛtɛ a ka a tɛ wɔ fɔ. Ɛ kara nyɩma tɩ ɛ san bɩtà fɔ baanɩ, nkɩfɔ fɔ ɛɛ̀ tɔ e yela tii koro bɩtà fɔ baanɩ. Anʋn gɛ ɛɛ̀ mɛ wàà di wofonte Sawulo gʋnʋn, da gɛtɛ eè belen tɩ ayu ɛ̀ɛ̀ ka san ma wɔ? <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Nka Dafidi nyawɔ gɛ bɛ nʋma ɩ nʋn be len gɛ bɛ dɔ̀ alan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">&lt;&lt;Sawulo e wolo bɛnɩ nkpɩn ton-ton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">gɛ Dafidi e wolo ɩgbaa ton-ton fɔ?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Akisi e kpele Dafidi gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Na nya Yahwe gɛtɛ ɛ̀ sa lɛ na tɛ wɔ alɛ à di nʋnkwarɩ wɔnɩ gɛ nafɔ ǹ len gɛtɛ àà gyegeye tɩɩ bʋnʋn a san akpa, yema boo ye duwi gɛtɛ a ba maakʋn be ye ma ǹdò lɛ, min we wɔ ma ade-kpen ɩkɩ, mɔ bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bʋʋ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ ben yera gɛtɛ àà san ma ɛtɩ. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Okoro fi fɔ à biri san olila waanɩ, kara mɛ gɩnyankɩ gɛtɛ gɩ nan di Filisiti bɛndɩrɛ fɔ gʋnʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Mɔ Dafidi e lila alan, &lt;&lt;Anʋn gɛ na mɛ? Anʋn yaade-kpen gɛ a we nmɩ aasaranyan miin koro ye duwi gɛtɛ na ba aakʋn be ye ma ǹdò lɛ? Anʋn yii koro gɛ wun pe nan ma kpà ma awɔ miinfonte egyu-dɩrɛ aa bɛkyʋnlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akisi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ nyɩ gɛtɛ aade ii di mɩ gʋnʋn anlɛ Wurubwarɛ wɔsalɛ. Mɔ Filisiti bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ bɔɔ bɛndɩrɛ fɔ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, Ɛ kara tɛrɛma tɩ ɛ san akpa fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Okoro gɩsaa gagyɩgyan-fuu, wʋ̀ bɔ wʋ ŋmangɩ fɔ awɔ ma aafonte Sawulo bɛsaranyan gɛtɛ bɛ tɛrɛma wɔ̀ bɛ ba fɔ, ɩ tɔ fɔ yàà biri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Gɛlɛ wuu koro Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ tɔ gɛgyɩgyan-fuu gɛ bɛ da Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ tɛ wɔ fɔ gaanɩ, gɛ Filisiti bete bɛ bʋn bɛ da Yesereli.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Dafidi e muru Amaleki bete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Duwi siyeefɛ fɔ, Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be ma gyu Sikilagi. Gɛ Amaleki bete bɛ ma kpila Negefi ma Sikilagi bete baanyan dɩkpatɩ daanɩ, gɛ bɛ sa Sikilagi ditele fɔ ɔtan. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Gɛ be gye bɛnanɩ ma bɛnɩ powu gɛtɛ bè si ditele fɔ daanɩ. Be gye bebisorobi ma bɛndɩrɛ powu, mɔ ben wolo ɛnɩ ɛkɩ, be gye bɛ gɛ bɛ ka bɛ bɛ da.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ ma gyu Sikilagi fɔ, be we gɛtɛ bɛ sa dɩ ɔtan gɛ be gye bɔɔsɔ ɛbɛ ma boo bebi-teni ma bebi-nanɩ gɩdɩ bɛ da. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Okoro Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be wula gepepe gɛtɛ bɛ mɩnɩ ma ɔkɛma bàà biri wula gba. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Be gye Dafidi wɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ Ahinoham gɛtɛ e ye Yesereli fɔ ma Abigeli Nabali wɔkpɩnsɔ gɛtɛ e ye Kameli fɔ bɛ da. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Dafidi e gyu gɛtʋrʋn-dɩrɛ gaanɩ yema wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bee len bàà fʋn wɔ ataa. Wʋ taga baanɩ-kamasɛ yema boo bebi-teni ma boo bebi-nanɩ boo koro. Mɔ Dafidi ɛ sa koro ɔkɛma Wurubwarɛ Yahwe waanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ dɔ̀ Abiyatari, gedi gɩɩtɛlɛ gɛtɛ è di Ahimeleki wobi fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ka gɛgba tinlɛ diboro fɔ mɔma mɩ.&gt;&gt; Abiyatari ɛ ka gɩ ɛ mɔma wɔ, <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />gɛ Dafidi e lila Yahwe alan, &lt;&lt;N kpa n gyaga bɛnɩ nyabɛ boo koro? Nan ta ma bɛ?&gt;&gt; Gɛ Yahwe e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ɩɩn! Kpa gyaga boo koro, aà gye bɛ gɛ aà to gɩnyan-kamasɛ gɛtɛ bɛ ka bɛ da fɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Okoro Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ nkpɩn bisiyee bɛ kya osele gɛ bɛ ma gyu Besori Gifobi, gɛ bɛkɩ bɛ wɔ dʋkɔ, <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />bɛ ba bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn gɛtɛ bɛ wɔ yema bɛ fana gɛtɛ bàà kààrà getu fɔ. Mɔ Dafidi ma bɛnɩ nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ gɛtɛ be kuruma fɔ, bɛ kààrà bɛ̀ tɛrɛma bɛnɩ fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ be we Egyipiti-te ɛkɩ oli waanɩ gɛ bɛ ka wɔ bɛ mɔma Dafidi. Bɛ tɛ wɔ butu ma anyan-dɩlɛ. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Bɛ tɛ wɔ figi wo keki ma resin wo keki. E di gɛ e wura ɔkɛma yema awi asiyee powu fɔ, en di anyandilɛ ɩkɩ abɛɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ nyʋn butu bʋkɩ.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Ɛ nyan n di aafonte gɛ gaanɩ gɛ a ye?&gt;&gt; Gɛ e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Ǹ di gɛ Egyipiti-te Amalaki-te ɛkɩ wɔdɩ. Awi asiyee ɩ lɛ gɛtɛ n te yeba wuu koro miinfonte e kere mɩ ɛ ya. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Tɩ ka dɩkpatɩ ti ma kpila Kereti bete Negefi ma Yuda, ma Kalebi baanyan. Gɛ ti kuma Sikilagi ditele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Dafidi e lila wɔ alan, &lt;&lt;A talɩ a ka mɩ a waran a san gɛlɛ gɩɩ bɛnɩ bɛtɔkɔ baakʋn?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">E tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Gengyi aà nya Yahwe a tɛ mɩ alan an nan wolo mɩ abɛɛ an nan ka mɩ a sa miinfonte ɛbɛ bʋʋ gʋlɔ bɩrɛ fɔ nan ka wɔ n san baakʋn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ɛ ka Dafidi ɛ waran ɛ san, gɛtɛ be gyu dʋkɔ fɔ be we gɛtɛ bɛ yasɩ bee di bee di gɛ bɛɛ nyʋn ɔkʋn-kamasɛ yema anyan gɛtɛ be gye bɩtà ye Filisiti bete ma Yuda bete baakʋn fɔ yii koro. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ bɛ ma tama bɛ fɔ, bɛ kpà ma ɛbɛ be ye ɔgyɔlɔ ka ma sere duwi nyɔɔfɛ dɩɩgyɔlɔ. Bɛ wolo bɛ powu wu kuruma gɛ bɛsaranyan-bi nkpɩn bʋnyɔɔ gɛtɛ be serenti ma akpɔŋɔ-tɩtɩɩ fɔ booko. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Dafidi e biri e to anyan powu gɛtɛ Amaleki bete be gye bɛ da fɔ, fɩya ma wɔsɔ ɛbɛ bɛnyɔɔ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Gɩnyankɩ gin kuruma, bɛndɩrɛ, ma bebi, ma bɛsʋgʋgyan, ma bɛsaranyan, ma anyan powu gɛtɛ Amaleki bete be gye bɛ da fɔ powu. Dafidi e birima yɩ powu ɛ ba. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />E to bɛyɛran ma bɛkwɔ gɛ wɔ bɛnɩ fɔ bɛ ka bɛ ma gyegeye bɛnan-do fɔ bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ bɛɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Anyan gɛtɛ Dafidi e gye e ye bɩtà baanɩ yɩ lɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Gɛ Dafidi ɛ san bɛnɩ gɛkpɩn gɛtɛ gɛ fɩna gɛ bɛn talɩ tɛrɛma bɛ san gɛ bɛ wɔ Besori getu fɔ gɩɩpɩ fɔ baakʋn. Be ye be be tuma Dafidi ma bɛnɩ fɔ, gɛ Dafidi ɛ ma sa bɛ onyun. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Mɔ bɛnɩ-kpen ma ilolo yɩɩ bɛnɩ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Dafidi bɛnɩ fɔ baanɩ bɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;Tɩ nan yo anyan gɛtɛ ti gye bɩtà baanɩ fɔ ma ɛbɛ, yema bɛn tɛrɛma tɩ san. Mɔ baanɩ-kamasɛ ɛ̀ɛ̀ talɩ e be to wɔsɔ ma wo bebi fɔ ɛ̀ɛ̀ san.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Gɛ Dafidi e tiri wuunyun alan, &lt;&lt;Mɩɩn bɛnɩ, wʋn kɔlɔ gɛtɛ tàà mɛ anyan gɛtɛ Yahwe ɛ ka ɛ tɛ tɩ fɔ anlɛ. Ɛ dɩyɛ gɛ e to ti e ye ɩkɛma gɛtɛ ɩ tɔ i yela tii koro fɔ yaanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Ɛnyan nan nʋn aakʋn? Anyan gɛtɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ sara bɛ nya atola fɔ baà wura fɔ, ɛyɩ ke gɛ ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ san bɩtà fɔ mɔ baà wura. Ɛbɛ powu baà wura anyan kyɛkyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Dafidi ɛ yɛ ade-mɛlɛ nyayɩ i biligi ose wʋ tɛ Isareli bete ye duwi dɩtɔkɔ be ye ma ǹdò.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Gɛtɛ Dafidi e be gyu Sikilagi fɔ, ɛ sa bɛ ka anyan-gyelɛ akpa yaanɩ fɔ bɛ sama Yuda bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bè di wɔwɔlɔn ɛbɛ fɔ gɛ ɛ dɔ̀ alan, &lt;&lt;I to anyan-tɛlɛ nyayɩ, ì di anyan gɛtɛ ti gye bɩtà baanɩ, ye Yahwe bɛkyʋnlɛ baakʋn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Ɛ ka anyan fɔ ɛ tɩyɛma bɛndɩrɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Beteli, ma Ramoti, ma Negefi, ma Yatiri, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Sifomoti, ma Esitemowa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />ma Rakali, ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Yerameli atele yaanɩ, ma Keni bete, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa Homa, ma Bori Asam, ma Ataki, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />fɩya ma Hebron, ma ɛbɛ powu gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa ɩkʋn-kurumakyɛɛ gɛtɛ Dafidi ma wɔ bɛnɩ be gyu-gyu be ye fɔ.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Sawulo ma wo bebi-teni baaku</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Ɩya-ɩya 10.1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Filisiti bete bɛ kpà ma Isareli bete. Mɔ Isareli bete bɛn talɩ yela Filisiti bete bɔɔ bʋnʋn gɛ be serenti. Be belen Isareli bete kpekpesi ayu Gilibwa wodon wuu koro. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Filisiti bete bɛ kpa bɛ gyaga Sawulo ma wo bebi besiyee boo koro gɛ be wolo wo bebi-teni, Yonatan, Abinadabi ma Maliki-Suwa. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Akpà fɔ yiinyun ɩ mɛ ɔtan wʋ tɛ Sawulo, gɛ bɩsɩnta bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ bɛ gbɛma wɔ gɛ be pira wɔ gɛtɛ wʋn ma gɛnya. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Gɛ Sawulo ɛ dɔ̀ wakpa-anyan yiitolalɛ fɔ alan, &lt;&lt;Tiri aa tata fɔ àà sere mɩ wolo! Fɔ Filisiti bete gɛtɛ ben belen bɩsan lɛ, bɛ kara bè fuli mɩ fɔ bàà wolo mɩ.&gt;&gt; Mɔ gɩsaa gi ton wakpa-nyan yiitolalɛ fɔ, okoro e terema gɛ ɛn mɛ anlɛ gɛtɛ ɛ dɔ̀ wɔ fɔ. Gɛlɛ wuu koro Sawulo ɛ ka ɛwɔ gbagba wo tata e sere gɛtʋnkwaa, gɛ ɛ tà ɛ nʋ̀n wo koro. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Gɛtɛ wakpa-nyan yiitolalɛ fɔ e we gɛtɛ Sawulo e ku fɔ, ɛwɔ mɔ ɛ ta ɛ nʋn ɛwɔ mɔ wɔ tata wo koro gɛ e ku ɛ fɩya ma ɛwɔ. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Okoro Sawulo, ma wo bebi besiyee, ma wakpa-nyan yiitolalɛ ma wɔ bɛnɩ powu be ku duwi-kɩlɩn dɩtɔkɔ.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Gɛtɛ Isareli bete gɛtɛ bɛ̀ sa dɩtagba daanɩ ma ɛbɛ gɛtɛ bè sì Yodan wofèn fɔ be we gɛtɛ Isareli bɩtà bʋʋ bɛtàlɛ fɔ be serenti, gɛ Sawulo ma wo bebi be ku fɔ, bɛ tɔ be serenti be kere baatele fɔ bɛ ya. Okoro Filisiti bete fɔ be be to baatele fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Duwi-nyɔɔfɛ fɔ, gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ ba bàà be lo bekpena fɔ baanyan gbaa fɔ, be we Sawulo ma wo bebi besiyee fɔ gɛtɛ be ku bɛ̀ dɔ Gilibwa wodon wuu koro. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Be kebi Sawulo duyu, gɛ be tiri wakpanyan, gɛ bɛ sa ɔtʋn Filisiti bete bɔɔ gɛtʋnkwaa powu gaanɩ gɛtɛ bàà ma yasɩ ade fɔ baakpen-kwo ma bɔɔ bɛnɩ powu baanɩ. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Ɛwʋ gɛ bɛ ka wakpanyan bɛ ma sɩ̀ Asitaroti dikpen-kwo daanɩ, gɛ bɛ gbɛrɛ wo gikpena bɛ marama Beti-San wɔpɔrɩ fɔ. <verse eid="1SA 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Gɛtɛ Yabesi gɛtɛ wʋ̀ sa Gileda gɛtʋnkwaa gaanɩ fɔ bɛnɩ bɛ nʋn ade gɛtɛ Filisiti bete bɛ mɛ Sawulo fɔ, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />beteni powu gɛtɛ bɛ ba oturu fɔ, bɛ san ma odente bɛ san Beti-San ditele. Be tiri Sawulo ma wo bebi fɔ boo gikpena be ye ɔpɔrɩ fɔ wuu koro, gɛ bɛ san Yabesi bɛ ma kuma bɛ. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ɛwʋ gɛ be kpila anankʋba-kurumakyɛɛ fɔ be ma lò oyon gɛtɛ bee kpèlè Tamarisiki fɔ wʋʋ gatɩn, Yabesi ditele daanɩ. Gɛ bɛ ban onyun awi kwarankɩ.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>